<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="JER" style="id">Jeremiah</book>
  <para style="h">Jeremiah</para>
  <para style="toc1">Jeremiah</para>
  <para style="toc2">Jeremiah</para>
  <para style="mt">Jeremiah</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Benjamin gam Anathoth khuo-a siempute lahah khat ahi Hilkiah’ tapa Jeremiah’ thugente tam bang ahi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kumpi Amon’ tapa Josiah, Judah gamah a maan zaw kum sawm le thum a cin kumin Jeremiah kungah Topa’ kammal a tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Judah Kumpi Josiah’ tapa Jehoiakim’ uh hun le Judah kumpi Josiah’ tapa Kumpi Zedekiah’ uh kum sawm le khatna a tawp dong cieng, Jerusalem mite sal tang dinga a kipeipi a hla ngana dong ciengin zong a tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tu-in keima kungah Topa’ thu ang tung a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Na nu gil sunga tuisih a na vei masangin kang thei zo a, na suo masangin zong kang siengthosah zo hi; minamte tungah kamsang dingin nang kang koi zo hi,” ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ciengin keima in, “Ah, Topa Pasien! Ka thugen dan ding zong mantahin ka thei sih hi, azieh pen kei naupang khat ka hi bo hi,” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahi vangin Topa in kei kungah, “’Naupang khat ka hi bo hi,’ ci sin; azieh pen kang sawlna mi zosie kungah na pei ding a, nang kang sawl popo na gen ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amate giing sin, azieh pen nangma ang hunkhie dingin kang ompi hi, Topa in kang ci hi,” ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa in a khut hing zampheisahin ka kam ei thampieh hi; tuale Topa in kei kungah, “Tu-in na kam sungah ka thute ka koi zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />En in, minamte le kumpi gamte tungah a botkhie ding le a phelkhie ding, a susie ding le a paimang ding, a lam ding le a phut dingin nangma kang koi zo hi,” ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Keima kungah Topa’ thu ang tung a, “Jeremiah, bang na mu ei?” ei ci hi. Keima in, “Almond singba khat ka mu hi,” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa in ka kungah, “Na hoi mu hi; azieh pen ka thu a tangtun nadinga a ngah gige ka hi hi,” ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka kungah Topa’ thu ang tung leuleu a, “Bang na mu ei?” ei ci hi. Tuale keima in, “Leilu a kinga tui a so beel khat ka mu hi,” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa in keima kungah, leilu lam gam panin gam sunga a teng zosie tungah gimna ang tung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Azieh pen tu-in leilu lam kumpi gam sunga om minam zosie ka hlan ding hi; amate a unpi-in ang pei-in Jerusalem lutna tunkot teng, a kulpi baang kimvel zosie le Judah khuopi zosie-ah a kumpi tophate uh ang phut ciet ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuale a gitlona ziehun keima ei taisanna uh, pasien dangte tunga biehna a lui zieh ule a khut utawh a bawlsa uh milimte a bieh ziehun amate tungah ka thukhenna ka gen ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hizongle na kawng gah in; dingto inlen, kang thupieh zosie amate kungah va gen ta’n. A mai vuah zau sin; na zau leh amai vuah kang zausisah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuni-in gambuppi- Judah kumpite, a uliente, a siempute le a gammite langah a pang dingin kulh tawh a ki-im khuopi khat, sia khuompi khat le sumngo kulpi khat bangin kang bawl zo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amate in nang ang do ding uhi; hinanle ang zo sih ding uhi, azieh pen nang ang hunkhie dingin kang ompi ding hi, Topa in ci hi,” ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka tungah Topa’ kammal ang tung a, tam bangin gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jerusalem’ zah dingin pei-in va tangko in, Topa in ci hi: Na khangno lai-a na kipieh dan, motha banga kei nei itna, a kihlo nai lo gam lahah nei zui lai ka phawh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa adingin Israel siengtho a, ama’ anlahna ah ga masa pen ahi hi. Tuami a ne zosie a maw suoh a, a tung vuah gimna a tung hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jacob’ innkuon le Israel innkuon zosie aw, Topa’ thu za un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa in tam bangin gen hi: Na pu na pate un ka sungah bang khielna mu a, ka kung panin gamlapi ah peimangin, kimanna a nei lo nate nua zui-in, bangma lo suoh uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amate in, “Egypt gam panin eite ei peipi to-in gammang lahah ei na pui a, senel gam le dumte lah, leigaw gam mielking lah, tui a oplona gam, koima pei ngai lona gam le koima ten lona gam sungah ei peipi pa “ Topa hei-ah om ahei,” a ci sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A gate le a hoi nate na neh thei nadingun an vauna gamah note kang tunpi hi. Ahi vangin na lut ciengun ka gam na buasah vua, ka gouluo leitang kidah na huoisah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Siempute in, “ Topa hei-ah om ahei” ci loin, thukham zangte in zong ei thei sih vua, Keima tungah makaite in khielna a bawl vua, kamsangte in Baal min tawh thu genin, amate in phattuomna a pie lo nate’ nua a zui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin keima in note khatvei kang mawsah hi, Topa in ci hi. Keima in na tate uh’ tate tungah kang mawsah lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cyprus tuipi gei kan unlen va en ta un. Kedar ah mi sawl unlen va lim-et ta un; tam bang nate a pieng ngai amah, en un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pasien tahtah ahi sih vangin minam khat in a pasien-te a hleng ngai uh amah? Ahi vangin ka mite in a minthanna uh pen phattuomna a pie lo nate tawh a hleng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Vantungte aw, tami thu-ah ciza unlen, zauthawngin sip dide un, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Azieh pen ka mite in sietna nam ni a bawl uhi: Amate in hinna tuinah ahi keima ei taisan zo ta vua, amate adingin tui a vei thei lo, a kehsa tuikhuh a to uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Israel sila ahi amah? Inn sunga pieng sila ahi amah? Tua ahile bang dinga ama kisuom gam ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Humpite in ama hawhsan a, amate nahpitahin a hawh uhi. Amate in ama’ gam gamkhing a suohsah vua, a khuopite vuah koima teng loin a kisie gawp hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua tham loin Memphis le Tahpanhes mite in nangma’ lu tunga kumpi lukhu a satkeh zo ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Topa na Pasien un lampi-ah note ang pui laitahin, ama na nuasie ziehun, na tung vua tam bang ang tung hi lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ahile Nile tuite dawn dingin Egypt gamah na pei ziehun bang na phattuompi uh ahei? Ahi sihle Euphrates tuite dawn dingin Assyria gam na pei ziehun bang na phattuompi uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na gitlona un dan ang tuohsah ding a, na nuatolna un ang mawsah ding hi. Topa na Pasien uh taisanin, na sung vuah keima nei giin nawn lo ciengun, tua khu a hoi lo a khalawng ahi lam mu-in thei ta un, Vanglien Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hun sawtpi lai panin na hahkol na hliehtawng ta mel a, ang kikhina khaute zong bottanin, “Na na ka sem sih ding hi!” na ci hi. Muolsang tung teng le singna hing nei cin tengah lumin na pahtat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hinanle nang pen a ci hoi pen pana deiteel lenggui banga kang na tu na hi hi. Tua ahile nang bangci kisiet a, gam lenggui na suoh ta vanuh na hei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tang-al tui tawh kisilin savan tampi zang nan lacin ka mai-ah na mawna nieh om lai veve hi, Topa Pasien in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Bangci bangin, “Kei ka bua sih a, Baal pasien-te nua ka zui sih hi,” ci thei na hei?” Kuom sunga na lampi en in; na bawlsate thei in. Nang pen a kawi taitai kalaoh laa hua na bang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Gamlah nuom a sa, a hua senga hui dih vapiel gam sakol koi in khaam zo ding ahei? A suite in gim pipi-in sui kul loin a hua hunin mu lel ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Na keng guohin lam pei sinlen, na dang zong tasah sin. Ahi vangin, “Lamet om sih, azieh pen khuol mite ka ngai hi, amau’ nua zui vang,” na ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Guta khat a kimat ciengin a maizum bangin, Israel innkuonte- amate, a kumpite uh, a uliente uh, a siempute ule a kamsangte uh a maizum ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Amate in singkung khat kungah, “Nang ka pa na hi hi,” a ci vua, suongtum khat kungah, “Ei piengsah pa na hi hi,” a ci uhi. Bangzieh ahei cile amate in kei ei maingat loin, ei nuangat uhi. Ahi vangin hamsat a tuo uh ciengin, “Hing pei inlen ei hun in!” ei ci veve uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hizongle noma dinga na bawl uh na pasien-te uh hei-ah a om ta ahei? Amate in na hamsat hun vua ang hun thei uh ahile kihunsah un. Bangzieh ahei cile Judah aw, note in na khuopi zaza uh pasien-te na nei valia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Bang dinga nei mawsah uh ahei? Na unpi-un kei nei ledo zo uhi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A thu om lo pi-in na tate uh dan ka pie hi; amate in sapna a sang tuon sih uhi. A gilkiel humpi bangin na namsau un na kamsangte uh thatgam zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />No khang mite aw, Topa’ kammal ngai un! Israel adingin kei senel gam tawh ka kibang ngai ta a, ahi sihle a miel keikui gam ka bang ngai ta amah? Tua ahile ka mite in, “Kote ka suohta ta vua, nang kungah kang pei nawn sih ding uhi,” bang dingin ci thei uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ngahnu khat in a kizepnate mangngilin, motha khat in a motha puonte a mangngil thei amah? Hizongle ka mite in sim zawh lo ni tampi sung kei ei mangngil uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Na lawmngai ding a sui dan siem ta lawm ma cie! Numei gilote tung nangawn-ah zong na zie na tongte na hil tabo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />A inn uh lu-in na mat sih vangin, na puon mongah mawnei lo mizawngte’ sisan baang kimu hi. Tam teng zosie gamta napi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />nangma in, “Kei ka maw sih hi, a mantahin kei tungah ama lungthah nawn lo hi,” na ci hi. “Kei ka maw sih hi,” na ci ziehin tu-in nang tungah thu kang khen ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Na opdante khel zieuzieu-in nop len sam cie izaw! Assyria in nang ang maizumsah bangin Egypt-te in zong ang maizumsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Topa in na mi muonte a nuol tah ziehin nang zong luhum kawmin tua gam panin nang pei ding hi; amate tungtawnin bangma na nga sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pasal khat in a zi khul hinlen ama kung panin tua nu pei-in midang khat’ zi va hi taleh, ama tua nu kungah a peikia diei mah? Khum gam nahpi tahin bua ta lo ding amah? Kingaipi tampite tawh na pahtat zaw ciengin ka kung nang kilekia diei mah, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Muolpawn sangte lamah dahto inlen en in! Mi tawh na lupton lona mun hei-ah om ahei? Lam gei-ah to-in na lawmngaite na ngah a, senel gam sunga a zin kawikawite na bang hi. Na gitlona le na pahtatna in gam sung na buasah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin guotui kikangsah zo a, khal guo a zu nawn sih hi; hinanle numei pahtatte’ mel na puo a, na zum thei vawt sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tu mama-in keima nei hlan a, “Ka Pa aw, nang pen ka khangno lai-a kipanin ka lawmpa na hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A tawp dongin ama lungthah denin, a lungham den sam ding amah? Nangma tam bang danin na ham a, hinanle na bawl thei sietna zosie na bawl zo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kumpi Josiah in a uh lai-in Topa in keima kungah tam bangin a gen hi: A zulzau Israel, muolsang cinteng le singna hing nei cinteng ah kato-in khum mun tenga a gamtat dan le a pahtat dante na mu zo tai mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuale keima in, “Tam teng zosiepi a gamtat zaw ciengin ka kungah ama ang kinualekia na va,” ci-in ka ngaisun hi; hizongle ama ang kinuale sih a, numei ginalo a sanggamnu Judah in ama’ gamtatna a mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama in a angkawmna teng zosie zieha khulna lai tawh ka sawlmang a zulzau Israel zong a mu hi; hizongle numei ginalo Judah a zau vawt sih a, tuale mahin ama nu zong va pei-in a va pahtat zawsop hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama in ama’ pahtatna a bai ngaisut lel ziehin suongtum le singkungte tawh mawna bawlin gam sung a buasah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hizongle tam teng zosiepi ziehin a zulzau, a sanggamnu Judah pen lungsim tahpi tawh ang kilekia ahi sih a, ang kilekia kipang ahi bo hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa in ka kungah ang gen hi: A ginalo Judah sangin a zulzau Israel pen khielna a tawmzaw nei bang danin a kitalang zawsop hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pei inlen tami kammalte leilu lamah va tangko in: A zulzau Israel aw, hing kilekia in, Topa in ci hi. Kei mi khuotuo thei pa ka hi ziehin lungthahna tawh kang en sih ding a, zong ka lung a thah zing sih ding hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Topa na Pasien na langpanna, singna hing nei cin tenga zinte lahah na angvanna na thezahna, keima’ thu nei man lonate beh pulah in, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A zulzau ka tate aw, hing kilekia un, azieh pen kei nohaw’ pupa ka hi hi, Topa in ci hi; keima in khuopi khat pan mi khat, innkuon khat pan mi ni kang la ding a, Zion ah kang peipi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka lungsim banga pilna le theitelna tawh note ang va dingin ka tuucingte kang pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuami ni ciengin gam sungah note pungin na khan ciengun, amate in “ Topa’ thuciemna Singkuong,” thu a gen nawn sih ding uhi. Tua pen kingaisun kha nawn loin, kiphawkhah nawn lo ding a, zong kigoi beh lo ding hi; adang khat zong kibawl lo ding hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Khum hun ciengin Jerusalem khuopi pen Topa’ topha kici ding a, Topa’ opna Jerusalem ah minam zosie kikhawmin, amate in a gitlo lungsim uh a pauzui nawn sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuami ni ciengin Judah innkuonte in Israel innkuonte a pawl ding vua, leilu lam panin na pu na pate’ gouluo dinga ka na piehsa gamah a peiton ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Minam zosie’ gouluo lahah a hoipen le a nop tuoh gam khat hing pie-in, ka tapate lahah bang hing ci koi ding ka hei, ci-in ka ngaisun hi. Keima nei zuina panin nuakia loin ka Pa aw, ei ci va uteh, ci-in ka ngaisun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuale mahin a zulzau zi in a pasal a nuasie bangin, tuaci’n ka tungah na zulzau uhi, Israel innkuonte aw, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Muolpawn sangte tungah awging khat kiza a, tua khu Israel’ tate kaana le mauna ahi hi, azieh pen lampi panin amate a piel vua, Topa a Pasien uh a mangngil uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A zulzau ka tate aw, hing kilekia un, keima in na zulzauna uh kang damsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Muol tungte le a tunga om guolnopna le muoltangte khu zuoupi tahtah ahi hi. A mantahin Israel’ hutdamna pen Topa i Pasien uh sungah a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Ahi vangin a zumhuoi nate in i khangdawn lai vua kipanin i pu i pate sep gimna zosie, a tuuhon le a ganhonte uh, a tanu a tapate uh valtum sieng zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Maizumin lumin mindaina in kituomsah vai. Azieh pen i khangdawn lai-a kipan tuni dongin Topa i Pasien tungah eihaw le i pu i pate i maw zo ta vua, Topa i Pasien uh’ thu i na mang ta sih uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel aw, na kinuale leh, kei kungah hing kinuale in, Topa in ci hi. Ka opna panin na kidahhuoinate hemmang dawhin, na vathap nawn sih a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“ Topa a hing ahi ma bangin!” ci-in ka minin thuman thutang le thudih tawh na kiciem leh, ama ziehin minamte in thupha nga ding a, ama’ vang tawh amate a kisathei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Topa in Judah mite le Jerusalem-a tengte kungah tam bangin ci hi: Na lo uh kal unlen, ling lahah khaici vaw sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Judah mite le Jerusalem-a tengte aw, Topa adingin no le no tep kitan unlen, na lungsim tepte tan un. Na khuci bawl sih uleh na gitlo gamtatnate uh ziehin koima in a phel zawh lo ka lungthahna mei bangin ang kuong ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Judah gamah genzah unlen, Jerusalem ah tangko un: Gam sung cintengah pengkul mut un; nahpi-in awng unlen, “Hing kikhawm un, kul tawh ki-im khuopite sungah pei-in lut va vui!” va ci ta un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile leilu lam panin gitlona le sietna lienpi kang puoh ziehin, Zion lam nga-in dielkhai khat khai-in na suotah nadingun tai unlen, khuomuong sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A kibuhna hamphul lah panin humpi khat ang pusuoh zo a, minamte a susie ding pa ang kipanzo ta hi; na gam uh gamdai a suohsah ding le mi ten thei lo a suo nadinga na khuopite uh a susie dingin a opna panin ama ang kuon zo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tam thu ziehin la-ip puon kikhu-in kapin mau un: “Eite kung panin a zauhuoi mama Pasien’ lungthahna a kinuale nai sih hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ni ciengin kumpite le uliente lungkie ding uhi; siempute ciza-in kamsangte in lamdang a sa ding uhi, Topa in a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ciengin keima in, “Kadei, Topa Pasien, ka lawl vua namsau a kiphu laitah na ngawnin, ‘Nohaw adingin ang hoi na ding hi,’ ci-in tam mite le Jerusalem-te sol citahin na sol hi!” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua hun ciengin tam mite le Jerusalem-te kungah tam bang kici ding hi: Senel gam sunga muolpawn sangte lah panin ka mite lamah huisa khat ang lang ding a, tua hui pen ansi zap ding le a mut siengtho ding hi lo hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />tua bang adingin tua hui hat luo ding hi. Tu-in amate kungah thukhen ding a genpa keima ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />En un! meii bangin ama ang zamto a, a sakol leengte pumpei tawh kibang hi; muvanlai sangin a sakolte gangzaw hi. Eite in gimna i thuoh ding uhi, azieh pen a kisie i hi ta uhi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Jerusalem aw, ang kihutdam nadingin na lungsim gitlonate sawp sieng in. Na sungah na gitlo lungsim bang tanvei vom ding na hei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Azieh pen Dan panin aw khat ang ging a, Ephraim Muol panin gimna kiphuongzah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Minamte kungah, “Amate tanah om!” ci-in gen un. Jerusalem langkhatah phuongzah un. “Gamlapi panin a imtawm dingte ang kuon uhi; Judah khuopite langkhatah amate a awng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lohungte bangin ama a imtawm uhi, azieh pen ama in keima ei ledo hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Na opdante ule na silbawlte un note tunga tam thu ang tut ahi hi. Tam khu na manthaina ahi ta hi; tua khu bang a ci khat ta diei! Tuami in na lungtang ang sun hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka sintang na, ka sintang na! A na sengin ka kilumlet va-ia hi! Aw ka lungsim gim sam e! Ka lungtang a kisai vapial hi; ka om muong thei sih hi; azieh pen keima in pengkul mutna aw, gal sim pataukona aw ka za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Gimna khat zaw gimna khat tung a, gam buppi a kisie zo hi. Thakhatin ka buhte kisie a, bakhat sungin ka puonkhaite kisie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Bang tanvei kidona dielkhai mu-in bang tanvei pengkul aw za ding ka hei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Ka mite a mot ziehun theitelna ei nei sih uhi. Amate naupang maw a bang vua, theitelna a nei sih uhi. A sie bawl lam a siem vua, hinanle a hoi sep dan ding a thei sih uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Leitung ka en a, tua in lim le mel nei loin a awngthawlpi ahi hi; vantungte zong ka en a, khuovah a nei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Muolte ka en leh, a kiling valuh vua, muoltangte zong khu a kivei kawikawi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuale keima in ka en a, koima a om vawt sih hi. Vana leng vate zosie zong a lengmang sieng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ka en leh, logam hoi teng senel gam suoh sieng a, Topa mai le ama’ lungthahna mai-ah a khuopi zosie uh a kisie sieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Bang ding ahei cile Topa in tam bangci hi: Gam buppi kisie ding hi; hizongle ka susie sieng sam sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tam thu ziehin leitang kap ding a, vantung zong a miel ding hi; azieh pen keima in ka gensa ahi a, keima in ka khensatsa ahi hi; ka lungsim ka khelkia ta sih ding a, zong ka dawhkia ta sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Sakol tunga tuongte le thal tawite’ aw a kizah ciengin khuopi zosie a taimang sieng uhi; amate hamphul lahah lutin suong lahah a kato uhi. Khuopi zosie kinuasie-in a sungah koima teng lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Nang a kisiesa pa aw, puon ausan silin, kham tawh kizemin, na mit za na nu khu bang na deina ahei? Nang le nang a kimawhzep na hi a, na lawm ngaite in ang nuasie ta uhi; amate in na hinna a lah sawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Azieh pen numei nausuoh kuon a kiko bang khat ka za a, a tacil suoh dinga a tau bang khat, husam liengin Zion’ tanu kiko a, a khutte zah vazawhin, “Gimna thuoh lah ka hi ta’n! Ei that dingte mai-ah ka tha nem sam e!” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jerusalem gawlzing lahah suhtai totai unlen, en kawikawi-in ciemte un! A tuol-awng teng sui-in en unlen, a dih gamtat le thuman a sui mi khat na mu vua ahile keima in Jerusalem mawna ka maisah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“ Topa’ minin a kiciem vangun amate pen zuouthu tawh a kiciem ahi bo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa aw, nangma’ mit in thuman sui hi lo amah? Nang in amate na vuoh vangin amate in na a sa sih uhi; nang in amate na sat vangin a kibawlpha nuom tuon sih uhi. A maitang uh suongtum sanga a sahzaw-in a bawl uhi; amate a kisia nuom vawt sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ciengin keima in, “Tam mite mizawng ahi a, thu ngaisutna a nei sih uhi; azieh pen amate in Topa’ lampi le a Pasien uh’ thukham a thei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mihaute kungah va pei ta vangin amate va hopi ta vang; amate in Topa’ lampi a thei vua, a Pasien uh’ thukham zong a thei tahpi uhi,” ka ci hi. Hinanle amate in a unpi-un hahkol hliehtawngin, a kikhina khaute a botsat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ziehin gamlahah humpi in amate that ding a, senel gam sunga ngie in amate a susie ding hi. Kamkei in amau’ khuopite buh dap ding hi; tuate pana a pusuoh poma ehmal ding hi, azieh pen amau’ tatkhielna tam a, amau’ nuatolnate nasie luo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na mawnate uh kang bangci maisah thei ding ahei? Na tate un keima ei nuasie zo a, pasien ahi lopite po tawh kiciem zo uhi. Gilva tahin an ka va ciengin amate in ang a kawm vua, numei pahtatte’ inn-ah a honpei valuoi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A gilva sakoltang lante bangin a vengpa’ zi lunggulin a tau vahut uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Keima in tam teng ziehin amate dan thuohsah lo ding ka mah? Topa in ci hi. Hici bang minam tungah phu la loin om ding ka hi amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A lenggui guol lahah peito-in vasusie ta’nlen, hizongle a unpi-in suhmangpieh sieng sin; abate heusiengpieh in; azieh pen tuate Topa - a’ ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Azieh pen Israel innkuon le Judah innkuon-te kei tungah a muonhuoi vawt sih hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amate in Topa thu-ah zuouthu a gen vua, “Ama’n bangma bawl sam sih va. Eite tungah sietna tung loin, gal le sa le kiel le ta zong i tuoh sih ding hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kamsangte lah hui a bang leltah uhi, azieh pen amau’ sungah thu a om sih hi. Amau’ thugen bangin a tung vuah kibawl ding hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ziehin Vanglien Topa Pasien in tam bangin a gen hi: Amate in tam thu gen zo uh ahi ziehin na kam sung vuah ka thute meikuong ka bangsah ding a, sing tawh a kibang tam mite meikuong in a katum ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Israel innkuonte aw, a gamlapi panin na kung vuah minam khat kang puoh ding hi, Topa in ci hi. Tua khu a thahat minam, tangmaleh lai-a a om ta bo, a ham na thei lo uh, a thugen zong na thei lo uh minam khat ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A thal-um uh pen a kihongsa han tawh kibang a, amate a unpi-un galhang thahat vive ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Amate in na anlahsate ule na ante uh ang khawnpieh ding a, na tanu na tapate uh zong ang thagampieh ding hi; amate in na tuuhon, na bawnghonte uh ang khawnpieh ding hi; na lengguite ule na theikungte uzong ang nehmangpieh ding hi; amate in kul tawh a ki-im na muon mama uh noma’ khuopite namsau tawh ang suhsietpieh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ahi vangin keima in tua ni cieng nangawnin zong note kang cigamsah sih ding hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na mite in, “Bang dinga Topa i Pasien in tam teng zosiepi eite tunga ang bawl a ta diei?” ang ci ciengun nangma in amate kungah, “Kei ei nuasie-in, na gam sung vuah gamdang pasien-te’ na na sep bangun, na gam uh ahi lo gam khatah gamdang mite’ na na sem ding uhi,” na ci ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Jacob innkuon sungah tami thu genzah unlen, Judah sungah zong tami thu phuongzah un:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />No mimaw thu ngaisun thei lo mite, mit nei napi khuomu lote, bil nei napi khuo za lo mite aw, tami thu khu za un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kei nei giing sih uh amah, Topa in ci hi. Ka mai-ah na citun sih uh amah? Keima in tuipi gamgi dingin senel ka koi a, tua khu kantan zawh lo dinga a dalna-a zah zing ding ahi hi; tuihuolte a kile valuh vangin amate in a zo zo sih vua, a gin vapual vangin a kantan zo tuom sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ahi vangin tam mite a lungtang uh khauhin, ledo nopna lungtang a nei vua, kilehei-in a peimang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Amate in a lungsim sung vuah, a huna guote ang zusah, tua guo le khal guo ei pie le eite dinga anlah hun ei sepieh pa, “ Topa i Pasien zatah vai,” a ci vawt sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Na khielnate un tami na hoite a khahtan ta a, na mawnate un tua na hoite ang taansah ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Azieh pen ka mite lahah mi ginalote kimu hi; amate in midangte’ neisate a lahpieh uhi. Amate in vathangsie bangin thang sie-in mite a man uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Va khumna bawng ah vate a dim ma bangin solna tawh a nga uh van teng tawh a inn uh kidim hi; tua ahi ziehin amate hau-in ang vanglien ta vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />ang thau milmelin ang zol sipsep ta uhi. Amate in gitlo gamtatna lamah tawp hun kici a thei sih uhi; pa nei lote nopsah nadingin a thu uh thutangin khenpieh loin, tasamte nga ding thute-ah a panpi sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tam teng ziehin amate dan tuohsah lo ding ka mah, Topa in ci hi. Tam bang minam khat tungah phu la lo ding ka mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A dipkuothuoi, a zauhuoi thu khat gam sungah pieng zo hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Kamsangte in zuouthu a gen vua, kamsangte’ thupieh bangin siempute vaihawm hi. Ka mite in tua bang dante a dei lai vaset vua, hinanle a tawpna ang tun ciengin bang na bawl ta ding vuoi?
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Benjamin’ suonte aw, na suotah nadingun Jerusalem laikim panin tai un. Tekeo- ah pengkul mut unlen, Beth-haccherem ah lim khat khai un. Bangzieh ahei cile leilu lam panin gimna le sietna lienpi ang tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Keima in Zion tanu khu a deihuoi pen lonona gam tawh ka tekah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuucingte a tuuhon utawh ama sim dingin a kuon ding vua, a kimvel vuah a puonbuhte uh lamin a unpi-un a mun ciet vuah ganhonte a vah ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Tua nu tawh kido dingin kithawi un. Tho un, sunlai-in sim va vui!” a ci uhi. “A da i hi ta uhi, azieh pen ni lah kiemsuhsuh ta, nitah lam a hlimliep zong ang sau tehteh ta!” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Tho un, zan ciengin simin, a kumpi innte uh susie vai!” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Azieh pen Vanglien Topa in tam bangin ci hi: A singte phua sieng unlen, Jerusalem sim nadingin leicien cieng un. Daan tuoh valon ding khu tami khuopi ahi hi. A sungah bawlsietna ci simlo bangma dang om lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuikhuh sungah tuiciim a vei kihkiah bangin ama in a gitlona tuiciim bangin a khol hi. A sungah tatsietna le kisuhsietna kiza den a, ka masangah natna le liem le bai om zing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jerusalem aw, kidawm in, na kidop sih leh nang hing kidahin kang nua heisan ding a, gamkhing le koima ten lona gam kang suohsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Vanglien Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Lengga kungah a sangh teng a kikhon sieng bangin Israel a omlai teng zong khon sieng vet in. Lengga khon pa bangin a bate tungah na khut zamsah kia in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amate in a zah thei nadingin koi hopi-in koi galgih ding ka hei? En vawi, a bil uh bing a, khuo a za thei sih uhi. Amate dingin Topa’ kammal khu simmawna-a kizang ahi a, tua sungah nuom a sa sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahi vangin keima pen Topa’ thangpaina tawh ka kidim a, ka sunga ka khol ding zong ka cimtah ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amate, a inn uh, a lote ule a zite utawh midang kungah kipieton ding hi. Bangzieh ahei cile khum gama tengte langah ka khut ka zah ding hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile a neupen pan a lienpen dongin thumaan lo sum ngana lamah a koimapo a duhop uhi; kamsangte a kipan siempute dongin koimapo in zuou a phuoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amate in ka mite’ liemma a thop bawlpieh vua, kilemna om vawt lopi, “Kilemna, kilemna,” a ci mawhmawh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Zumhuoi tahin gamta-in a kidahhuoi nate a bawl vua, hinanle amate maizum loin, kisuonna dan zong a thei sih uhi. Tua ahi ziehin a puate lahah amate zong a pua ding uhi. Amate dan ka pieh hun ciengin a kilawnkhie ding uhi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Topa in tam bangin a gen hi: Lamka bawm-ah ding inlen khuodah un. Lam hoi ahi lampi luite dong unlen, tua lampi khu zui un. Tua hile note in toidamna na mu ding uhi. Ahi vangin amate in, “Ka zui sih ding uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Note dingin galvil ding mite ka koi hi: Keima in “Pengkul gin ngai un!” ka ci hi. Ahi vangin , “Ngai sih va ung,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin minamte aw, za un. Mihonpite aw, amate kunga tung ding thu thei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Leitung aw, za in. Amate in ka thute khawhsa loin ka thuhilte a nuol ziehun tam mite tungah a gelna ga uh ahi, gimna ka tungsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Sheba pana ang pei panamtui hile, gamlapi pana ang pei sing namtuite hile, ken bangin mang ding ka hei? Na meihal biehnate uh kisang thei lo a, na biehpiehnate un ei lungdamsah lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Topa in tam bangin gen hi: En un, amate a pua nadingin keima in tam mite mai-ah a kipal thei ding uh nate ka koi ding a, pate le tate, innvengte le lawm le guolte tawh a kisie ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Topa in tam bangin gen hi: En un, leilu lam gam panin minam khat ang pei ding a, leimong a gamla pen panin minam lien khat gal sim dingin a kithawithawi ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Amate in thal le teipi a tawi vua, gilo-in hepina a nei sih vua, a huging uzong tuipi hawh ging tawh kibang hi. Zion tanu aw, nang ang sim dingin sakol tungah a tuong vua, galkuon dinga a kisa galhang khat bangin a kivon uhi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Amau’ thute i za zo ta vua, i khutte uh a zaw sieng ta hi. Lungkhamna in ei tukon a, numei nausuoh bangin na i sa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Galte in namsau a tawi vua, i kimvel zosie a zauhuoi ziehin, gam lahah pei sih unlen, lampi-ah zong pei sih un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ka mite aw, la-ip puon sil unlen, vut lahah kilawmlia un. Tapa tang khat a kikaa bangin mau-in nahpi tahin kap vapo un. Azieh pen ei susie ding pa thakhatin eite tungah ang tung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Amau’ lampite thei-in note in na ze-et thei nadingin, ka mite lahah a ze-et pa le a siengsah pa dingin nang kang bawlzo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Amate ahile a unpi-un a lungkhau mi ledote ahi vua, mi daisahin vah kawikawi uhi. Sumngo le siatang bangin a sah vua, a unpi-un a sie lamin a gamta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Pum hazapin kizap a, mei in hanawh tang a tuisah sieng hi. Tua puma a kizapzap khu a mawhnapi ahi bo hi. Bangzieh ahei cile migilote a kizap sieng zo sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Amate “a kinuol ngun” kici ding hi. Azieh pen Topa in amate nuol zo hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jeremiah kunga a tung Topa’ kammal tam bang ahi hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa’ biehinn kotpi-ah ding inlen, tua munah tami thu phuongzah in: Topa a bie dinga kotpi sunga ang lut no Judah mite zosie aw, Topa’ kammal ngai un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Vanglien Topa Israel’ Pasien in tam bangin ci hi: Na lampite ule na gamtatnate uh puopha unlen, tam munah note tawh ei tengtonsah un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tam bang zuouthute tahsang sih un: “Tami Topa’ biehinn ahi hi, Topa’ biehinn ahi hi, Topa’ biehinn ahi hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile note in na lampi ule na gamtatnate uh na puophat tahtah vua, khatlekhat tungah thutanga thu na vaihawm tahtah uleh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />pemtate, pa nei lote, le meigongte gawt loin, ahi sihle tam munah midihte sisan luongsah loin na siet nadingun pasien dangte nua na zui sih uleh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />tanglai-a na pu na pate uh tungah a nei zing ding vua ka pieh tam gam sungah note tawh kang tengton ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />En un, kimanna a nei lo zuouthu kigente na tahsang talawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Note guta-in tuol thatin, ang kawmin, a manlopi-in kiciemin, Baal kungah biehna pie-in na thei ngai lo uh pasien dangte nuazui-in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />tua ciengin hing pei-in ka min tawh kilo tami biehinn sunga ka mai-ah dingin, “Kote suohta ta ung!” na cizaw ciengun a kidahhuoi tami nate zosie pi ma bawlkia zel ding na hi uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka min tawh a kilo tami biehinn nohaw’ muna-ah misuomte’ kibuhna mun a suoh ta amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tu-in a cila ka min ka tensahna Shiloh-a keima’ munah va pei ta unlen, ka mi Israel-te gitlona zieha ka silbawl va en ta un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tu-in zong tam silte zosie na bawl vua, na kung vuah kang gengen vangin ngai tuon loin kang hlat hlat vangin ei dawng lo na hi ziehun
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />ka mina a kilo, na muon uh tami biehinn le note tung le na pu na pate uh tunga kang pieh tami mun khu Shiloh-a ka bawl bangin ka bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Keima in na sanggamte uh Ephraim’ suonlehlah zosie ka nawmang bangin keima’ mun panin note zong kang notmang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tam mite adingin thu ngetpieh sin, amate adingin kap sinlen, zong thumpieh sin. Bangzieh ahei cile keima in na thungetna kang ngaipieh sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Judah gam sunga khuopite sung le Jerusalem gawlzingte lahah a silbawl uh mu lo na hi uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Naupangte in sing tomin pate in mei a taw vua, nupite in vantung kumpinu’ moh bawl nadingin annel pawi-in ka thangpai thei nadingin pasien dangte kungah dawn thei biehnate a sung uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amau’ thangpaisah pen kei ka hi amah?” Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Topa in tam bangin gen hi: Tam mun, mihingte le ganhingte tung, lolai-a singkungte le lei lah singgate tungah ka lungthahna le ka thangpaina ka sung ding a, tua khu kuongin kiphel zo lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Vanglien Topa , Israel’ Pasien in tam bangin ci hi: Na biehpiehnate vuah na meihal biehnate uh gawmin a sa ne un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Egypt gam panin na pu na pate uh ka peipi lai-in meihal biehnate le biehpiehnate tawh kisai-in amate ka hopi sih a, thu zong ka pie sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hizongle amate tungah, “Ka thu mang un, tua hile keima note’ Pasien ka hi ding a, note zong keima’ mite na hi ding uhi; note na nopsah thei nadingun kang thupieh lampi beh zui un,” ci-in thu ka pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ahi vangin amate in ka thu ei mang loin a bil uh ei ngat sih uhi. Amate in a lungtang gitlona uh khausahin amau’ deina lam zui-in a gamta zawsop vua, mainawt loin a nuatawn uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Egypt gam panin na pu na pate uh a pei ni-a kipanin tuni cieng dong, amate kungah ka nasem kamsangte ni khat zaw ni khat ka sawl zing hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />hizongle amate in ka thu ei ngai loin zong ei thuse sih vua, a ngawng uh a khausah zawsop uhi. A pu a pate uh sangin a siezaw-in a gamta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuaci’n tam thute zosie amate kungah na gen ding a, ahi vangin amate in na thu a ngai sih ding uhi. Amate na hlan ding a, ahi vangin ang dawng sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Nangma in amate kungah tam bangin na gen ding hi: Tam minamte pen Topa a Pasien uh’ thu a mang lo minam ahi vua, thuhilna a sang nuom sih uhi; thuman thutah kisie zo hi; amau’ kam panin zong a kisattan ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Na sam uh met unlen paimang un; muolpawn sangte tungah kaala awi in, bangzieh ahei cile Topa in ama a thangpaisah khang mite nuolin nuasie zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Judah mite in ka muna-ah sil hoi lo bawl zo uhi, ci-in Topa in a gen hi. Amate in ka min tawh a kilo ka inn sungah a kidahhuoi nate koi-in a buasah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ka lungsim sunga ka gel ngai lo, zong thu ka pieh ngai lopi-in amate in a tapate ule a tanute uh mei-a a haltum nadingin Hinom tapa’ Kuom sungah Topheth a kici munsang a lam uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Topa in kang ci-in, tua mun pen Topheth a kici nawn lo ni le Hinnom tapa’ Kuom a kici nawn lo ding ni ang tung valon ding a, Kigawna kuom kicizaw ta ding hi; azieh pen Topheth ah misi vui nading mun a op nawn lo dongin a vui ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tam misi luongte vana leng vate le lei-a om gamsate’ an suoh ding a, koima in tuate a heumang zo sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tuale Judah khuopite le Jerusalem gawlzingte-ah kipah thanop awging le motha nu le zi neipa’ awging ka tawpsah ding hi; azieh pen tua gam kinuasie ta ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khum hun ciengin Judah kumpite’ gu le tangte, uliente’ gu le tangte, siempute’ gu le tangte, kamsangte’ gu le tangte, le Jerusalem-a a teng mite’ gu le tangte a hankhuh uh panin kiladawh ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />tuale amate in a it uh, a na a seppieh uh, a nua a zui uh, a sui ule a bieh uh nipi le hlapi le vana om na zosie’ mai-ah a kithezah ding hi; tua gu le tangte kikhawm loin zong kivui lo ding hi; amate pen lei lahah a kinuasie eh tawh a kibang lel ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amate ka delmangna mun zosie-ah tam a gilo innkuonte zosie sung panin a omlai teng in nuntatna sangin sina a teelzaw ding uhi, Vanglien Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa in tam bangin a gen hi, ci-in amate kungah va gen ta’n: Mite a pua ciengin thokia sam uh hi lo amah? Mite lam a piel uleh kinualekia sam hi lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ahile bang dinga tam mite kiheimangin, nuatol zing ta uh ahei? Amate in solna a tudet vua, a kinuale nuom ta sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Keima in hoi tahin ka ngaipieh a, ahi vangin dihtahin a gen sih uhi; a gitlona uh panin koima kisia lo a, “Bang ahei ka bawl?” ci lel uhi. Galsim dinga a tai sakol bangin a unpi-un a lampi ciet a zui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Vana a leng gun vapi nangawn in a lal hun ding thei buong sam hi; vakhu, sielpaleng, le tui vatawtte in zong a tun hun ding uh thei sam uhi; ahi vangin ka mite in Topa’ thupiehte a thei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bangci bangin note in, “Ko ka pil vua, kote tawh Topa’ thukham a om hi,” ci thei na hi uh ahei? A zuouthei laitheite’ laikung in bang hunin tua thukham khu zuouthu suohsah ta uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mipilte kizumsah ding a, amate lungkie-in kiman ding hi. Amate in Topa’ thu a nuol ta uhi. Amate in bang pilna nei uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin a zite uh midangte ka pie ding a, a logamte uzong galzote ka pie ding hi. Azieh pen mi zosie a neupen pan a lienpen dongin thuman lo-a sum ngana lamah a duhop ciet uhi. Kamsangte a kipan siempute dongin mi zosie zuouthu-in a gamta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amate in ka mite’ liemma a thop bawlpieh vua, kilemna om vawt lopi, “Kilemna, kilemna,” a mawh ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amate zumhuoi tahin gamta-in a kidahhuoi nate a bawl vua, hizongle maizum vawt loin kisuonna dan zong a thei sih uhi. Tua ahi ziehin a puate lahah amate zong a pua ding vua, amate dan ka pieh hun ciengin a kilawnkhie ding uhi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuate ka khop nuom ciengin, lenggui-ah lengga a om sih a, thei kungah zong a ga om loin a nate nasan vul sieng a, amate ka piehte amate kung panin peimang ta hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bang dinga toto lai i hi uh ahei? Kikhawm vai-in, kulpi tawh a ki-im khuopi sungah lutin, tua munah va si ta beh vai. Azieh pen Topa’ tunga i khiel ziehin Topa i Pasien un a mangthai dingin ei na se zo a, eite’ dawn dingin gutui ei pie zo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kilemna i sui vangun sil hoi i mu sih uhi. Cidamna ding hun i sui vangun zauna i tuoh zawsop uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Dan khuo panin a sakolte uh’ nahging kiza a, a sakol lante uh’ ham ging in gam buppi kilingsah hi. Amate pei-in tua gam le a sunga om zosie, khuopi le a sunga teng zosie, a valtum sieng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />En un, na lah vuah gulte le a kihlimzo lo gulsiete kang hla ding a, tuate in note ang tu ding uhi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka kipahna tawpin ka tungah dana om a, ka lungsim a na hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ngai vawi, gam sung cin tenga ka mite kikona awging khu: “Zion ah Topa om lo ahi amah? A sungah a kumpipa om lo ahi amah?” a ci uhi. (“Bang dinga a milimte ule a gamdang milimte utawh kei ei thangpaisah uh ahei?” a ci hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“An lah hun in ei hleng ta a, khuokhal hun zong tawp zo ta hi, eite lah ei kihundam nai lo hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka mite’ liemma khu keima liemma zong ahi a, ka kapkap a, lunggimna in ei kanbawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Gilead ah zatui om lo amah? Tua munah zato siem om lo amah? Bang dinga ka mite dam thei lo uh ahei?
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw, a kithat ka mite ziehin a sun a zana ka kaa thei nadingin ka lu khu ciatui hi hinlen, ka mitte khu hlitui’ nah hi le izaw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aw, ka mite nuasie-in amate kung panin ka taimang thei nadingin, senel gamah zintun buh ding mun khat nei leng izaw! Azieh pen amate angkawm le mi leheh honte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amate in zuouthu gen nadingin a lei uh thalpi bangin a kuoi uhi; amate in thutah ahi lo zuouthu beh tawh gam sungah thunei-in a pang uhi; bangzieh ahei cile amate in sietna khatzaw khat a manaw tehteh vua, keima ei thei ta sih uhi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na innvengte uh kidawm unlen, na sanggamte khatpo zong muong sih un; azieh pen na sanggamte zosie zuou phuoh ahi bo vua, innvengte zosie zong mi daisahte bangin a kawiva uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amate zosie in a innvengte a sol ciet vua, thuman gen koima a om sih hi; amate in zuouthu gen dingin a lei uh a cil uhi; amate in khielna a bawl ziehun kisia ding gimhuoi a sa uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bawlsietna khat zaw gawtna khat, zuouna khat zaw zuouna khat a bawl bebe vua, kei ei thei nuom sih uhi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ziehin Vanglien Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Tu-in amate siengthosahin ka encien ding a, mawnei ka mite adingin bang dang bawl thei ding ka hei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A lei uh si theina thaltang ahi hi; a kam panun zuouthu a gen uhi. Amate a unpi-un a vengte tungah a thusiem hiuhiau vangun, a lungsim tawng vuah a si nading uh a dap gel veve uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tam teng ziehin keima in amate dan pie lo ding ka mah? Topa in ci hi. Tam bang minam khat tungah phu la lo ding ka mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Muolte adingin kapin tau unlen, senel gam lonona munte adingin kaala awi un, bangzieh ahei cile tuate katum sieng a, koima in nawh kha nawn loin, bawnghon ham zong a kiza nawn sih a, vana a leng vate le gamsate a taimang sieng ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jerusalem buathah kholna le si-alte’ tenna ka suohsah ding a, Judah gam khuopite zong mi ten lona gamkhing ka suohsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tam thu a theisiem ding mipil koi om ahei? Amate in tam thu a pulah thei nadingun koi kungah Topa in thu gen ahei? Koima in a nawh thei lo nadingin bang ziehin tam gam kisie-in senel gam bangin katum ta ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Azieh pen amate in a mai vua ka koi ka thukham nuasie-in ka thu ngai loin tua thukham bangin a gamta sih vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />tuale mahin a lungsim deina uh zui tentunin a pu a pate uh hilna bangin Baal pasien-te’ nua a zui sieng ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Vanglien Topa , Israel’ Pasien in tam bangin ci hi: Tam mite gamsai tawh ka va ding a, a dawn dingun gutui ka pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amate le a pu a pate’ thei khah lo minamte lahah ka thezah ding a, amate ka tha sieng dongin namsau in ka nuadelsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Vanglien Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Ngaisun un, numei a kapte ang pei nadingin hlan unlen, kaa a siem numeite ang pei nadingin va ciel ta un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka mit vuah hlitui luongin ka mitkhu vuah tui banga a pul nadingin amate in kote adingin kaala khat mallang tahin sa uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Zion panin tauna aw khat kiza hi: “Eite bangci kisiet i ta diei! Zum citahin i zum uhi, bangzieh ahei cile amate in i tenna ei suhsietpiehin eite in zong i gam i nuasie zieh uh ahi hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Numeite aw, Topa’ kammal za unlen, a kam pana ang ging thu na bil vuah lutsah un. Na tanute kaala hil unlen, na vengte ciet uh kaa dan ding hil un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“I tawlet vangah sina ang kato a, gawldung-a naupangte le mipi tuol-awngte om tangvalte a sumaimang dingin kumpi’ inn sungah ang lut zo ta hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Gen in! Topa in tam bangin ci hi: “Gamlahah misi luongte eh bangin kinuasie ding a, bu-at pa in bulom a nuasie bangin koima in khawmkia nawn lo ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Mipilte in a pilna uh kisahtheipi sih uh hinlen, mi hatte in a hatna uh kisahtheipi loin mihaute in zong a hauna uh kisahtheipi sih uheh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />a kisatheite in keima, Topa leitungah itna kip, thutang, le thuman a zang ka hina ei theitelna vuah kisathei zaw uheh, azieh pen tamte ah kipahin ka lung a kim hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Topa in a vuntep beha kitante zosie ka gawt ni ang tung valon ding hi, a ci hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Egypt, Judah, Edom, Ammon, Moab, le a sam a heukieu senel gama tengte zosie ka gawt ding hi. Azieh pen tam minam zosie in tep tan loin, Israel innkuonte zosie zong lungsim tep kitan lo ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel innkuonte aw, na kung vua Topa ang thugen khu ngai vawi un:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Minamte’ omdan sin sih unlen, vana limte ziehin lungkie sih un; azieh pen minamte in tuate a lungkiehpi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile tam mite’ tawndante khu zuouthu ahi bo hi: Gamlahah sing khat kiphua a, tuale singsiem pa in hei khat tawh a suizol hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />mite in tua khu kham le ngun tawh a zem uhi; a kilah dawh thei lo nadingin siakil le sehta tawh a khencip uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A milimte uh, tangmai lei-a lo hunna milimte tawh kibangin a ham thei sih a, lam zong a pei thei lo ziehin puoh kawikawi a kul hi; Tuate giing sih un; bangzieh ahei cile tuate in sietna bawl thei loin, tuate sungah a hoi bawl thei nading zong om lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Topa aw, nang tawh a kibang koima a om sih hi; nang na lien a, na min vanglienin a thahat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Minamte kumpipa aw, koi in nang hing giing lo ding ahei? Azieh pen tua khu nang’ tanh ahi hi; azieh pen namcin mipil zosiete lah le a kumpi gam sung zosie vuah nang bang koima om lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amate mimaw le mingol ahi uhi; tua milimte thuhil zong sing sangin hoizaw tuon lo hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tarshish panin ngun kikhengsa kipuo a, Uphaz panin kham kipuo hi. Tuate khu khutsiemte le kham khengte’ khutsuo ahi hi; a puonsil uh pen a dum le a ausan ahi hi; tuate a unpi-in khutsiemte’ khutsuo ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hinanle Topa pen a man Pasien ahi hi; ama ahing Pasien le tawntung kumpipa ahi hi. A lungthah ciengin leitung kilawh a, minamte in ama’ lungthahna a thuoh zo sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amate kungah, “Vantung le leitung a siem lo pasien-te pen leitung pan le vanneite panin a mangthai ding uhi,” ci-in na gen ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A vanglietna tawh leitung a siem pa, a pilna tawh leitung a phutdet pa ama ahi a, ama in a theitelna tawh vante a zah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama a ham ciengin vantunga tuite ging vapuoh a, leimong tengah meiilumte a zamtosah hi. Ama in guo a zuh nadingin tun phesah a, a vankoinate panin hui langsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mi zosie a mawlawm vua, theina a nei sih uhi; milimte ziehin kham khengte zosie a maizum uhi; bangzieh ahei cile a milimte uh zuou ahi bo a, amau’ sungah naahu a om sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuate pen kimanna a nei lo, kipumsolna hi lel a, dan a kipieh ni ciengin tuate a kisie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Jacob’ tanh Topa pen tamte bang ahi sih hi, azieh pen na zosie a siem pa ama ahi a, Israel pen ama’ gouluo minam ahi hi; ama’ min pen Vanglien Topa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Galte’ imtawm a thuoh mite aw, lei-a na puonlom uh ziel un!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Tu petpetin tam gam sunga tengte ka lawnmang ding a, amate in a thei nadingun a tung vuah lunggimna ka tungsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka kisuhkhah ziehin gim nga lah ka hi ta’n! Ka liemma a nasie mama hi. Hinanle, “Tami ka thuoh valon ding danpiehna hi a, tuale ka thuoh kul ding hi,” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka puonbuh kisie ta a, a khau teng tatsan zo hi; keima kung panin ka tate taimang siengin a om nawn sih uhi. Ka puonbuh ei lampiehkia ding le ka dalna puonte ei khaipieh ding koima a om ta sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Azieh pen tuucingte a mawlawm vua, Topa a dong sih uhi; tua ahi ziehin amate mazang loin a tuuhonte uh a kithethang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Za vawi, awging khat khu! Ngai vawi, Judah khuopite gamkhing a suo nading le si-alte busah nadingin leilu lam panin husa ging vapuoh khat ang pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Topa aw, mihingte’ hinkhuo pen amau’ thu ahi lo lam ka thei a, mihingte lam a pei uh ciengin a kalsuon nading uh a gel thei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Topa aw, a hoi bepno khatin ei puopha in; hing thangpai mawh lacin bangma lo nei suo ta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ang thei lo minamte le na min ang lo ngai lo mite tungah na lungthahna sungsuh in; azieh pen amate in Jacob a netum uhi; amate in ama netumin a that vua, tuale a tenna gam a susie sieng uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jeremiah kungah a tung Topa’ thu tam bang ahi hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Tami thuciemna thute za inlen, Judah mite le Jerusalem-a tengte kungah gen in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nangma in amate kungah, Israel’ Pasien Topa in tam bangci hi, ci-in gen in: Tami thuciemna a mang lo poma samsiet nga taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tami thuciemna pen na pu na pate uh, sia haltuina meikhuh ahi Egypt gam panin ka peipi lai-a ka thupieh ahi ta bo hi. Ka thu ngai unlen kang thupieh zosie sem un, ci-in gen in. Tuaci’n note pen keima’ mi hi-in kei pen note’ Pasien ka hi ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />tuni-a a om bangin bawngnawi le khuoizu luonna gam kang pie ding hi, ci-a na pu na pate uh kungah ka kamciemna ka tangtunsah nading ahi hi,” a ci hi. Tua ciengin, “Hi taheh, Topa ,” ci-in ka dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Topa in keima kungah tam bangin ei gen hi: Tam thu zosie Judah khuopite le Jerusalem gawlzing lahah va phuongzah ta’n: Tam thuciemna kammalte za unlen tuate bangin sem un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Egypt gam panin ka peipi lai-in na pu na pate uh nasietahin ka na hugiih a, tuni cieng nangawnin ka thu mang un, ci-in ka hugiih ngitnget hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hinanle amate in ka thu ei mang loin a bil uzong ei ngat sih vua, mi zosie in a gitlona lungsim khaupi ma uh a zui tentun zawsop uhi. Tuaci’n keima in a zui dingun tam thuciemna ka pieh vangin amate in a zui lo ziehun tua sunga thute a unpi-in amate tungah ka tungsah ta hi,” ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuale Topa in keima kungah, “Judah mite le Jerusalem-a tengte lahah sawmdapna a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amate in ka thu gente don loin tang lai-a a pu a pate uh’ khielna lamah a kinuahei kia uhi; amate in a nasem dingin pasien dangte’ nua a zui sieng uhi; Israel innkuonte le Judah innkuonte in a pu a pate utawh ka thuciem bawl a palsat zo ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Topa in tam bangin gen a, amate tungah a pel thei lo uh gimna ka tungsah valon ding hi; keima kungah amate ang tau vangun ka dawng sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ciengin Judah khuopite le Jerusalem khuo-a tengte in biehpiehna a bawlna uh a pasien-te uh kungah pei-in a va kap ta ding vua, ahi vangin a genthei hun ciengun tua pasien-te in amate a hundam thei ngai sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Azieh pen Judah aw, nang in khuopi na nei zaza pasien-te na nei va-ia hi; tuale note in maizum nading bepin Jerusalem khuo-a gawlzing om zaza ma, Baal pasien kungah biehna pieh nadingin maitamte na lam zo ta mel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nang na hi leh tam mite adingin thu ngetpieh sinlen, ahi sihle amau’ tangin zong kap loin zong thumpieh sin, azieh pen amate in gimna thuohin ei hlat uh ciengin ka dawng sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka it mite in na hoi lo a bawl zaw ciengun ka inn sungah bang thu nei thei ding uh ahei? Kiciemnate le biehpiehna sate in na kisietna ding uh ang kipelsah thei ding amah? Tua ciengin lungdamin na kipah thei ding uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hun khat lai-in Topa in nang pen, “A hing dildel ga hoi a ga olive singkung,” ang na ci ngai a, ahi vangin ama in huipi ging bangin tua khu mei tawh hal ding a, a bate a katum sieng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Israel innkuon le Judah innkuon in gitlona bawlin Baal kungah biehnate a piehna utawh keima ei lungthahsah uh ahi ziehin, nang ang suon pa Vanglien Topa in na tungah sietna a tunna ding a genzo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Keima ei theisah khu Topa ahi a, keima in zong ka thei ta a, tua ciengin nang in amau’ gamtat hoi lote nei musah ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ahi vangin kei pen tha dinga a kipeipi a nunnem tuuno tawh ka kibang hi. Amate in, “Singkung a ga pumin phua dawh vai-in, a min a kiphaw nawn lo nadingin ama that dawh ta vai,” ci-a ka tunga a hoilo gelna a nei lam uh ka thei kha sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ahi vangin thu mantaha a khen, mihing’ lungsim le ngaisutna a encien Vanglien Topa aw, amate na thuhkiana ei musah in, bangzieh ahei cile ka vai zosie nangma kang ap zo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin tha dinga ang sui, “ Topa min tawh thu hil sin, na hil leh kote’ khut lum tawh na si ding hi,” ang ci Anathoth mite tawh kisai-in, Topa in tam bangin a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Vanglien Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Amate dan ka pie ding hi; tangvalte namsau tawh si ding uhi; a tanute le a tapate uh zong kielpi tawh a si ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />tuale a omlai teng nangawn a suohta sih ding uhi. Bangzieh ahei cile ka dan pieh kum ciengin keima in Anathoth mite tungah gimna ka tungsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa aw, kang mawsah ciengin nang a dih na hi ding hi; ahi vangin nangma kungah ka thu ei tutsah in. Bang ziehin migilote dau pei-in, upna nei lote nuomsa uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nangma in amate na suon a, amate zunghla uhi; tuale amate khangin ga ang ga uhi; a kam vuah nang na nai om a, hinanle amau’ lungsim tawh na kigamla hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahi vangin Topa aw, nang in kei nei thei hi; nang in kei nei mu a, nei ze-et hi, nang tawh ka lungsim a om hi. Amate, gaw dinga a kikoi tuu bangin kai dawh inlen, a kigaw ni ding uh ngahin a tuomin koi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Gam sung bang tanvei kapin, lolai cin tenga lopate vul ding ahei? A sunga tengte’ gitlona ziehin gamsate le vate mangthai sieng uhi. Bangzieh ahei cile mite in, “I gamtatnate Pasien in ei mu sih,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kenga a peite tawh tai kidemin ang gimsah zo uleh, nang in sakol bangci demzawh ding na hei? Gam nuom bawn-a na pua leh Jordan hamphul lahah bang na suoh ta diei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Azieh pen na sanggamte le na innkuonpite nangawn in ang leheh uhi; amate in nahpi-in ang awhsan uhi; na tungah kam siem nan ule amahaw tahsang malmal sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka inn ka lo ka nuasie ta a, ka gouluo zong ka nuasie ta hi. Ka lungsim sunga ka it pen khu a galte khutah ka pie ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka gouluo ding pen kei adingin gamlaha humpi tawh kibang hi; ama in ka lang khatah pangin ei hawhsan hi, tua ahi ziehin ama ka muda hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka thupiehna tawh gam-ui in ka gouluo a dugaw amah? Sasiel ne vate in ama kimvelah bawmin a tu valuoi uh amah? Pei unlen gamsa zosie va khawm ta un; ama a netum dingin tuate hing zawpi un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuucing tampite in ka lengga lo a susie zo vua, amate in keima’ tanh a tuoncil gawp uhi. Amate in a deihuoi keima’ tanh pen pawnlah le gamlah a suo ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amate in tua pen pawnlah a suo zo uhi; gamdai suohin kei kungah da-in a kap uhi. Gam sung zosie pawnlah suoh zo ta a, hinanle koima’n a thudon sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Senel gam sunga a om muolpawn sang zosie tungah mi sumang dingte ang pei ta uhi; gammong khat pan gammong khat dongin Topa’ namsau in a vatmai ziehin koima a suohta a om sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amate in mangbu a tu vua, lingkung a at uhi. A thagim mama vangun bangma lemlaw a nei sih uhi. A giinhuoi Topa’ lungthahna ziehin amau’ anlah a zumpi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka mi Israel-te luo dinga ka piehsa gouluo a khoipieh a gilo ka innvengte tawh kisai-in Topa in tam bangin a gen hi: A gam uh panin amate ka botzuon ding a, amate lah panin Judah innkuonte ka hunkhie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka baw zuon zaw ciengin amate tungah lainatna ka neikia ding a, a gouluo gam ciet vuah ka peipikia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ciengin Baal’ min tawh a kiciem dingin ka mite a sinsah ma bangun, amate in “ Topa a hing ahi ma bangin,” ci-in keima’ min tawh a kiciem dingin ka mite’ omdante kintahin a sin uleh, ka mite lahah amate kiptahin a om ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahi vangin minam khat popo in ka thu a ngai nuom sih uleh, keima in tua minam phungkalin ka sumaimang ding hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in keima kungah, “Pei-in puon kawngten khat va lei ta’nlen, tua khu na kawngah gah in, hinanle tui sungah phum sin,” ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuaci’n kei zong Topa’ kammal dung zui-in puon kawngten khat ka lei a, ka teng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuale Topa’ thu ka kungah a ni veina ang tungkia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Na kawnga na ten, na puon kawngten lei pen la inlen, tu mama-in Euphrates gunah pei-in tua sunga suongpi pawhkeh kawmah vaphuol ta’n,” ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuaci’n kei zong pei-in, Topa ei thupieh bangin Euphrates gun gei-ah ka phuol hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuale ni tampi zaw ciengin Topa in keima kungah, “Tu-in Euphrates gunah va pei ta’nlen, tua sunga puon kawngten kang phuolsah pen va lakia ta’n,” ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ciengin kei zong Euphrates gunah pei-in puon kawngten ka phuolna mun khuotin ka lakia hi. Hizongle tua puon kawngten na sepat gawp ta hi; bangma-in kizang thei nawn lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ciengin keima kungah Topa’ thu ang tung a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa in tam bangin ci hi: tua bang lien ma-in keima in Judah’ kiphatsahna le Jerusalem’ ki-engphatsahna ka susie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka thu ei ngai nuom lo, a deina bang beh vua a gamta nuom tentun, le pasien dangte’ na a sem ding le a bie dinga a nuadel tam migilote pen kimanna a nei vawt lo, tami puon kawngten tawh kibang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile mite’ kawngah tua puon kawngten a beh cihteh bangin, keima’ mi ding, keima’ minthanna ding, keima ei kiphat nading, le keima’ thupi nadingin keima tungah Israel innkuon bup le Judah innkuon buppi ka behsah cihteh ding hi, Topa in ci hi. Ahi vangin amate in ka thu a ngai sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amate kungah tam thu na gen ding hi: Israel’ Pasien Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Zubeel poma zu na dim ding hi. Amate in nangma kungah, ‘Zubeel zosie zu dip ding a thei lo-a nei tuot amah?” ang ci ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ciengin amate kungah na gen ding hi: Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Keima in tam gam sunga teng zosie, David’ kumpi topha tunga a to kumpite, siempute, kamsangte, le Jerusalem-a a teng zosie, zu tawh kidimsahin ka khamsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuale amate khatlekhat, pate le tate ka kisusah ding hi, Topa in ei ci hi. Amate ka suhsiet ciengin khuotuo, hinkhawi, le lainat cite ka nei sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ngai-in na bil daw unlen, ki-uongsah sih un. Bangzieh ahei cile Topa in thu gen zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama in khuo ang mielsah masang, khuomulah muol tungah na keng suikha-in na pua masangun, Topa na Pasien uh’ min thangsah un. Khuovah na sui laitahun khuomu king dingin hing heipiehin, miel thuhpi a suohsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hinanle ka thu na ngai nuom sih uleh na kilietsahna ziehin ka dapkaa ding a, hlitui luongin nahpi tahin ka kap ding hi. Bangzieh ahei cile Topa’ tuuhonte salin kikaimang zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Kumpipa le kumpinu kungah, “Topha niem ah to un. Bangzieh ahei cile a etlawm na kumpi lukhu uh na lutung uh panin kiesuh zo hi,” va ci ta’n:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Negeb gam khuopite kikha a, a hong ding koima a om sih hi. Judah zosie salin kiman a, a unpi-un sal a suoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Khuodah inlen leilu lam pana hing peite en in. Nangma ang kipie a hoi mama na tuuhonte hei-ah om ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Na pawl dinga na pantah mite in na tungah thu ang nei ciengun nang in bang na gen diei? Numei naukei natna thuoh bangin natna in ang man gawp sih ding amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Bang zieha ka tunga tam thute hing tung a ta diei?” ci-a na ngaisut leh tua khu na mawna a lietseng zieh ahi hi. Tua thu ziehin na nih hing kilemto piehin, ang kibuon gawp ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ethiopia-te in a vun uh khel thei-in, kamkei in a giel a khel thei amah? A khel thei uleh sietna bawl ding a zongsang note in zong a hoi na bawl thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Senel pana ang lang hui in buvai a tawmang bangin keima in note kang thethang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tam pen nang dinga ka tesa satanh, nangma’ tanh ahi hi, Topa in ci hi. Azieh pen kei nei mangngil ta a, zuouthute na um ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Kei mama-in na maitang dongin na nih ka lemto ding a, na zumsel a kimu ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Keima in gamlah muoltangte tunga na angkawmna, na huatau vahutnate, zumzie thei lo-a na pahtatnate ahi, a kidahhuoi na silbawlte ka mu zo hi. Jerusalem aw, gimna na thuoh ding hi! Ang kisiensah nadingin bang tanvei sawt ding ahei?
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Guotui kan ding tawh kisai Jeremiah kunga a tung Topa’ thu tam bang ahi hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Judah kap a, a kul tunkotte maimang kuon ta hi; lungzuong khuongai-in amate tuolah a bawh vua, a tung lamah Jerusalem-te’ kaana awging kato hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A uliente in tui tawi dingin a nasemte a sawl uhi; tuikhuh ah pei-in amate in tui a mu sih uhi. A beelhawm utawh a kilekia vua, amate maizumin cimaw-in puon a kilukhu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />azieh pen gam sungah guo zu loin leitang a gawta ziehin, lohlote cimaw-in puon a kilukhu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lopa om ta lo ahi ziehin, sazuh pi nangawnin a tasen a nuasie ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Muolpawn sangte tungah gam sakolte a ding vua, si-alte bangin hui dihin a naw na uhi; Lopa om lo ahi ziehin a mit uh a hah zo sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka khielnate un kote langah teci hing pang nanle, na min zalin na hing sem in, Topa aw. Ka nuatolnate uh a tam seng ta a, na tungah kang khiel zo ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Israel’ kinepna, hahsat hun cienga amau’ hundam pa aw, bang dingin ka gam sung vuah gamdang mi bangin hing omin, khuolzin zan khat beh a taam bangin hing om na hei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bang dingin mi lungbuoi bangin omin, a hun zo lo galhang thahat pa bangin om na hei? Hizongle Topa aw, kohaw lahah nang na om a, na mina ei kilote ka hi uhi; kote ei nuasie malmal sin!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tam mite tawh kisai-in Topa in tam bang ci hi: amate a vahthap nuom vua, a kengte a tu zo sih uhi; tua ziehin Topa in amate a pom sih a, tu-in a tawnkhielnate uh phawhin a khielnate ziehun dan a pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa in kei kungah tam bangin ci hi: tam mite nopsah nadingin thu hing ngen sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amate in an a tan vangun amau’ thumna ka zahpieh sih a, amate in meihal biehna le an tawh biehna ang tawi vangun zong tuate ka sanpieh tuon sih hi; tuale mahin keima in namsau, kielpi, le pulnatna tawh amate ka sisah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ciengin keima in, “Ah, Topa Pasien! Kamsangte in amate kungah, ‘Namsau mu kha loin kielpi zong na thuoh kha sih ding vua, tam munah lungnopna tahtah note kang pie ding hi,’ a ci uhi,” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Topa in keima kungah tam bang ci hi: kamsangte in keima’ min suongin zuouthu a gen uhi; amate ka sawl kha sih a, thu zong pie loin zong ka hopi kha sih hi. Amate in note tungah a manlo mangmuna, kimanna a nei lo aisanna, le a ngaisuttawm uh zuouthute ang gen uh ahi bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin ka sawl lopi-a, “Tam gam sungah namsau le kielpi hing tung sih va,” ci-in ka min suonga thugen kamsangte tawh kisai-in Topa in tam bangin gen hi: Tua kamsangte namsau le kielin a sigam ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amau’ thugenna mite zong namsau le kiel thuohin Jerusalem gawlzingah kipaithang ding hi. Amate le a zite, a tate, le a tanute a vui ding koima a om sih ding hi. Bangzieh ahei cile keima in amate tungah a gitlona uh ka sungsuh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Amate kungah tam thu na gen ding hi: A sun a zanin ka hlitui luong den hinlen, kan hun nei sih heh. Azieh pen keima’ mite, ka tanu ngahnu siengtho nu nahpi-in kisat gawp a, a liemma sie huoi mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Gam lahah pei leng, en vawi namsau a kithat mite! Khuopi sungah lut leng, en vawi, kielpi zieha a cinate! Gam sung muncin tengah siempute le kamsangte summet bawlin a vahkawikawi vua, theina a nei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Judah khu na pum nuol ahi ta amah? Zion khu kidahhuoi na sa amah? Damsah thei lo ding lienga bang dinga nang in kote nei liemsah ahei? Kote in lungnopna ka lamen uhi; hinanle sil hoi kici ka mu sih vua, dam ding hun ka lamet vangun zauhuoina vive ka mu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Topa aw, ka gitlona ule ka pu ka pate uh’ gitlonate kang pulah uhi. Bangzieh ahei cile na tungah kote kang khiel zo ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Na min na khuolna-in kote ei nol sin; a minthang na kumpi topha mindaisah vawt sin; kote tawh na thuciemna hing phawh inlen, ciem hing pel sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Minamte’ milimte lahah guo zusah thei khat beh a om amah? Ahi sihle vante in guo a zusah thei uh amah? Topa kote’ Pasien aw, tua khu nangma hi lo na mah? Tami sil zosie nangma’ bawl ahi ziehin kote in nangma tungah kinepna ka nei uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa in keima kungah tam bangin a gen hi: Ka mai-ah Moses le Samuel hing ding nan uleh tam mite lamah ka lungtang a kihei tuom sih ding hi. Ka muna panin amate del dawh unlen peimangsah ta un!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuale amate in nang kungah, “Hei-a pei ding ka hi uh ahei,” ang ci ciengun amate kungah tam bangin na gen ding hi: Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Pul natna tawh si dinga kisesate pulnatna tawh si ding a, namsau tawh si dinga kisesate namsau tawh si ding uhi; kiel tawh a pulsi dingte kiel tawh pulsi ding a, saltang dinga kisesate zong salin kikai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuale keima in amate tungah mi susie thei nam li ka tungsah ding hi, Topa in ci hi: A kitha nading uh namsau, a bottel ding ui, a valtum ding le a susie ding huilah vate le leitunga gamsate ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Judah kumpi Hezekiah’ tapa Manasseh in Jerusalem-a a bawl thute ziehin leitunga kumpi gam zosie in mulkin huoi a sah dingun tuate ka bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jerusalem aw, koi in nang hing khuotuo ding a, koi in nang hing hlasietpi ding ahei? Dam le dam lo a dong dingin koi hing lambaang ding ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nang in kei nei nuol zo ta a, nei elngatsan ta hi, Topa in ci hi. Tuaci’n ka khut zahin nang kang susie hi. Ka lungthahna ka ip na lamin ka cimgawp ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Gam sung tunkot tengah ansi zapna ciengkaa tawh amate ka zap zo hi; amate ta nei loin ka koi a, ka mite ka susie zo hi; a lampi panun amate ang kinuahei tuom sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A nupi meigongte uh tuipi-a senel sangin a tamzaw uhi; sunkim lai-in tangvalte’ nute sim dingin a susie thei pa ka peipi hi; ama tungah lungkhamna le zauna thakhatin ka tungsah zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ta sagi a nei numei nu hlalam vei-in a sibup hi; sunkim lai ahi vangin ama’ ni a tum zo hi. Ama in zum le mindai teng a thuoh hi. A omlai teng namsau tawh tha dingin a galte khut sungah ka pie ding hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka nu aw, kei gim nga ka hi ta hi. Gambup-a om micin teng tawh kihau kisel dinga nei hin ka hi sese izaw! Mi sum leitawisah loin mi sum zong palah lo napi, a unpi-un kei ei sampawm lai veve uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa in tam bangin gen hi: Nangma hoi nadingin na hinkhuo ah kang kisungthaw valon ding a, hahsat hun le lungdon hunin na galte in nangma kungah kang thumsah valon ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sia le sumngo in leilu lama sia a hliehtawng zo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na gam sung uh muncing tenga na bawl uh mawna zosiete ziehin note in na hauna ule na goute uh man nga loin galvan lahin ka pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na thei khah lo uh gam khatah na galte uh’ na kang semsah ding hi, azieh pen ka lungthahna mei bangin kitawkuong a, mit ngai nawn lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Topa aw, nang na thei hi; kei ei phawh inlen ei ve bo in. Kei ei bawlsiete tungah phu ei lahpieh inlen, na thuohzawhna ziehin kei ei sisah sin; nangma zieha hosietna thuoh ka hilam ei thei in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na thute kimu a, keima in tuate ka ne hi, kei adingin na thute kipahna le lungdamna ahi hi; azieh pen Vanglien Topa Pasien aw, nangma’ min tawh ei kihlan ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Guolnop bawlte lahah ka to sih a, ka guolnuom ton sih hi; lungthahna tawh nei dimsah ziehin a gih na khut nei-ah kei guohin ka to hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Adam nuom lote bangin bang dingin ka natna dai thei lo a, ka liemma dam thei lo ahei? A tahtahin nang pen kei adingin tui a kangzel luidung le misol thei tui tawh na kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Nang kilekia leh kang lakia ding a, ka na na semkia ding hi. Kimanna nei lo thute gen loin thu manphate na gen leh, ka kamsang na hi ding hi. Na kunga ang pei ding pen amate ahi vua, amate kunga a pei ding pen nang na hi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tam mite adingin sumngo kulpi-in kang bawl ding hi; amate in ang do vangun ang zo sih ding uhi. Azieh pen ang hundam ding le ang hunkhie dingin keima in nangma kang ompi hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Migilote’ khut sung panin kang hunkhie ding a, mi gawgamte khut sung panin kang tankhie ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Keima tungah Topa’ thu ang tung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tam munah zi la sinlen, tanu tapa zong nei sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile tami muna pieng tanu tapate le tami gama a nu a pate uh tungtangah Topa in tam bangin gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Si natna vei-in a si ding vua, koima’ kaa lo le koima’ vui loin a om ding uhi; amate pen lei lahah a kitha eh a bang bep lel ding uhi. Namsau le kielin a si ding vua, a luonghawmte uh hui lahah a leng vate le leitunga gamsate’ an hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Misi inn ah lut sinlen, a kaa dingin zong pei sin, zong hlasietpi da in; azieh pen tam mite kung panin ka lungnopna, ka itna kip, le ka hepinate ka la zo hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tam gamah milien mineu a si ciet ding uhi; amate kivui loin koima in zong kaa lo ding hi; amate ziehin koima kikuiliem loin a sam uzong a heukieu sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Misite ziehin a kapte hlai nadingin koima in khomun phalsuo loin koima in a nu ahi sihle a pa dawn dingin henepna hai tul lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pawi bawlna inn ah na pei sih ding a, amate tawh neton dawnton dingin na to sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Azieh pen Vanglien Topa , Israel’ Pasien in tam bangin ci hi: Note’ mu tehtehin, na hin sung ma-un tam mun panin guolnopna awgingte, lungdamna awgingte, le zinei pa le monu’ awgingte kisipsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tam mite kungah tam thute zosie na gen ciengin amate in, “Bang ziehin Topa in eite tungah tam gimna lienpi ang tunsah tah lawm ahei? I khielna uh bang ahei? Topa i Pasien uh tungah bang mawna i bawl uh ahei?” ang ci uleh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />nangma in amate kungah tam bang na ci ding hi: Na pu na pate un keima ei taisanin, pasien dangte nuadelin a na a sem vua, keima ei nuasie-in ka thukhamte a zui lo zieh uh leh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />note, na pu na pate uh sangin a siezaw-in na gamta vua, na unpi-un na gitlo lungtang uh zui tentunin ka thu na man nuom lo zieh uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin tam gam panin note le na pu na pate un a thei ngai lona gam khatah kang notmang ding a, tua munah a sun a zanin pasien dangte’ na na sem ding uhi, azieh pen keima in note kang angvan ta sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin mite in, “Egypt gam panin Israel mite a peipi Topa a hing ahi ma bangin,” ci-in keima’ minin a kiciem nawn lo uh hun ang tung valon ding hi,” Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Leilu lam gam pan le amate a hawlkhietna gam zosie panin Israel mite ang peipi Topa a hing ahi ma bangin,” kicizaw ta ding hi. Azieh pen keima in a pu a pate uh ka na piehsa a gam vuah amate ka peipikia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Topa in a cina ah, keima in tu-in ngabeng mi tampi sawlin amate ka mansah ding hi; tua zaw ciengin keima in sabeng mi tampi sawlin amate in muol le tang le suonghawmte lahah sa a beng ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile keima in a peina uh lampi zosie ka en hi; ka kung panin amate a kibu thei sih vua, a gitlonate uzong ka muna-ah a kisel thei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuale keima in amau’ khielna le amau’ mawna a za ni-in ka thuhkia ding hi. Azieh pen a muthadahuoi siluong hawmte tawh a kibang milimte tawh ka gam a buasah zo ta vua, a sil kidahhuoite utawh ka gouluo a kidimsah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aw Topa , ka hatna le ka kulpi, lungkham hun cienga ka kibuhna pa aw, leimong panin na kungah minamte hing pei-in tam bangin gen ding uhi: Ka pu ka pate un zuouthu le bangma-a kimang lo, phattuomna ei pie thei lo milimte cilo, bangma dang a na luo sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mihingte in amau adingin pasien-te a bawltawm thei amah? Khumte pasien ahi sih hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Tua ahi ziehin keima in amate thu ka hil valon ding hi. Tutungin ka vanglietna le ka hatna ka theisah ding a, tuaci’n amate in keima’ min Topa ahi lam ei thei ta ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Sia laikung tawh Judah’ mawna kigiel hi; a lungtang peh tung ule maitam kite tungah suong manpha dawnhiem tawh zihin kigiel a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />a tate un singna dawng gei cinteng le muolsangte tunga om a maitamte ule a khuom siengthote a phawh veve vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />gam-awng lai-a muolsang teng tungah zong a phawh veve uhi. Na gam sung zosie vua na bawl uh mawna manh dingin na neisa ule na gou zosie uh galvan lahin ka pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Noma’ bawlin kang piehsa na gouluo na tan ding vua, tuale keima in na thei ngai lo uh gam khatah na galte uh’ na semin kang koi ding hi, azieh pen keima’ lungthahna khu mei bangin kikuontaw-in a kuong zing ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Mi maimaite muongin cilesa hatna maimai suong a, Topa kung pana a lungsim kiheite pen samsiet thuoh ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amate senel gama a po sawlbawh a bang ding vua, panpina ang pei ciengin a mu kha sih ding uhi. Koima’ ten lona ci gam ahi senel gam gawta ah a teng ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa sunga muonna a neite, a muonna uh Topa ahi sahte thupha nga ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amate pen tui gei-a kisuon, lui gei-a zunghla singkung a bang ding uhi. Amate pen khuo a lum ciengin zau loin, a nate a hing zing ding hi; guo a zuh lo kumin zong amate in khawh sa loin ga a ga zing uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Adang na zosiete lahah lungsim khu a kawi pen ahi hi; kinahsiet mama hi - tua khu koi in thei zo ding ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Keima Topa in amau’ gamtatna le amau’ sep thaman zui-a a pie dingin lungsim ka sittel a, lungtang zong ka sui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thuman lopi tawh hauna a sui mi zosie pen ama’ tui hi lopi a keuhsah dinga a op valaa tawh kibang hi; a khan kimtan ciengin a neisa teng taan ding a, a tawpkhahna ah a mot lam uh a kipholah ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A cila panin a kitawisang, a minthang mang topha khu i mun siengtho sung vua om biehbuhno ahi hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aw Topa ! Israel’ kinepna pa aw! nangma kung panin a tai mite zosie a maizum ding uhi; na kung pana a kihei poma leinei gamah a min uh kikhum ding hi, azieh pen amate in hinna ciatui ahi Topa a taisan zo ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Topa aw, ei damsah in, tua hile kei ka dam ding hi; ei hundam in, tua hile kei hutdamin ka om ta ding hi; bangzieh ahei cile kang phat pa khu nangma na hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amate in keima kungah, “ Topa’ thu hei-a om ahei? Tua khu hing tung taheh!” ci-in ei bangci gen uh ci ei thei in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hinanle na nasepna ah tuucing hina panin ka taimang sih a, sietna ni ang tun ding zong lah ka dei tuom sih hi. Ka nephu panin bang pusuoh ci na thei hi; tua khu na mai-ah a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka dipkuot nadingin hing om sin; gimna hun cienga ka kibuhna na hi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />ei bawlsiete maizumsah inlen, ahi vangin kei ei maizumsah sin; amate lungkiesah inlen, ahi vangin kei ei lungkiesah sin; amate tungah gimna ni tungsah in; a za ni kisietna tawh amate susie in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Topa in keima kungah tam bang ci hi: Pei-in, Judah kumpite’ sungtumna le a pusuona uh ahi Mite’ Tunkot le Jerusalem khuo-a tunkotte zosie ah va ding ta’nlen,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />tuale amate kungah tam bangin gen in: Tami tunkot sunga ang lut no Judah kumpite, Judah mi zosie, le Jerusalem-a a tengte zosie aw, Topa’ kammal za un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Topa in tam bang ci hi: Na hin nadingun Sabbath ni-in van na puoh lo nading ule Jerusalem tunkotte ah tuate na lutpi lo nadingun kidawm un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Sabbath ni-in na inn panun van khatpopo puo loin, na khatpopo zong sem sih unlen, keima in na pu na pate thu ka piehsa bangin Sabbath ni siengthosah un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hizongle amate in ngai nuom loin a bil ei daw sih uhi; amate in a ngawng uh a khausah vua, thuhilna ngai nuom loin zong a sang nuom sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ahi vangin ka thu na ngai vua, Sabbath ni-in tam khuopi tunkotte ah bangma van puo loin, Sabbath ni na sienthosah vua, khum ni-in na na sep sih uleh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />David’ mang topha tunga a to ahi kumpite, amate le a uliente, Judah mite le Jerusalem-a tengte in sakol leeng le sakol tungah tuongin tam khuopi tunkotte ah ang lut ding uhi; tuale tam khuopi sungah mi a teng zing ta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Judah khuopite le Jerusalem kimvel panin hi tale, Benjamin gam, Shephelah gam, muoltung gam, le Negeb gam panin hi tale Topa’ biehinn ah mite ang pei-in, meihal biehnate le biehpiehnate, an tawh biehnate le panamtuite, le lungdamko biehnate ang peipi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ahi vangin Sabbath ni sienthosah ding le Sabbath ni-in Jerusalem tunkotte ah van puo-in lutpi lo ding hi, ci thute ah ka thu na man sih uleh keima in a tunkotte ah mei ka tawkuong ding hi; tua mei in Jerusalem kumpi innte katumin kiphel zo nawn lo ding hi, Topa in ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jeremiah kunga a tung Topa’ kammal tam bang ahi hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Hing pei in, beelkhengpa’ inn ah peisuh inlen tua munah ka thu kang theisah ding hi,” ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuaci’n beelkheng pa’ inn ah ka peisuh a, tuale a beel khen laitah ka va tuohkha ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama’ khut sungah tungman tawh a bawl a beel kisie a, tuale ama in hoi a sah bangin beel dang khatin a kheng phakia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ciengin keima kungah Topa’ thu ang tung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Israel innkuon aw, tam beelkheng pa bawl bangin no zong hing bawl thei hi lo ka mah? Topa in ci hi. Israel innkuon aw, beelkheng pa’ khut sunga a om tungman bangin note zong keima’ khut sungah na om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Keima in hun khat lai-in minam khat ahi sihle kumpi gam khat botzuonin, phelkhie-in ka suhsiet ding tawh kisai-in ka na pulah kha mai thei ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />hizongle ama’ tungtang thu ka pholah ziehin a gitlona panin tua minam ang kihei leh, ka lungsim khelkia-in ama tunga tunsah dinga ka gelsa gimna ka tungsah nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuale keima in adang hun khat lai-in minam khat ahi sihle gam khat’ tungtangthu ah lam ding le suon dingin ka na pulah mai thei ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />hizongle tua minam in ka thu ei ngai nuom loin, ka muna-ah sil hoi lo a bawl leh, ka lungsim khelkia-in ama tunga sil hoi bawl dinga ka gelsa pen khu ka bawl nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin tu-in Judah mite le Jerusalem-a tengte kungah tam bangin gen in: Topa in tam bangin ci hi: En un, kei pen note tunga sietna tunsah ding gelna a nei beelkheng pa ka hi hi. Tu-in na unpi-un na gitlona panun kiheikia unlen, na omdan ule na gamtatnate uh bawlpha un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahi vangin amate in, “Khum khu a mawhna hi bo! Koma’ gelna bangin om lel va ung, koma khat ciet in ka gitlo lungsim khauna uh ma bangin gamta lel va ung,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Minamte lahah dong un: Koi in tam bang thu za kha ahei? Ngahnu siengtho Israel in a mulkinhuoi pen na khat bawl zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lebanon vuakhal in Sirion kentawng a nuasie ngai amah? Muol tung pana ang luong luitui vot kihkiahte a kang ngai amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahi vangin ka mite in kei ei mangngil zo ta vua, amate in kisolna tungah meihal biehnate a hal uhi; tanglai lampite ahi amau’ lampite ah a kipalpua vua, a lamlienpi uh zui nawn loin lampelte a zui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amate in a gam uh a cizat huoi le mite’ ehneh ho zing dingin a bawl uhi. Khum gam a kantan mi zosie ciza-in a lu a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nisuona lam huipi bangin galte mai-ah amate ka thethang ding hi. A tuosiet ni ciengun amate ka elngat ding a, ka maingat sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ciengin amate in, “Hing pei un, Jeremiah sawmsim va vui, azieh pen thu ei hil ding siempu, i thu dawh ding mipil le Pasien’ kammal ei gen ding kamsang i kitasam sih ding uhi. Hing pei un, ama mawsiet vai-in a thugen khat mama zong mang sih vai,” ei ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Topa aw, ka thugen ei ngai inlen, ka galte’ thugente zong ngai in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Sil hoi pen sil hoi lo tawh thuh ding ma amah? Hizongle amate in ka si nadingin dum a to uhi. Amate kung panin na lungthahna na heimang nading le amate dinga thuhoi a gen dingin na mai-a ka din khu ei phawh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin kiel tawh a tate uh pulsisah inlen, namsau-in sisah sieng in. A zite uh ta nei loin meigongsah in. A pasalte uh pul natna tawh si uh hinlen, a tangvalte uh gal sungah namsau tawh si uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Amate tungah thakhatin mi susiete na sawl ciengin, amau’ inn panin kaana awging kizasah in! Azieh pen kei ei mat nadingun dum a to vua, ka kenga ka aw nadingin thang a sie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hinanle Topa aw, kei tha ei sawmnate uh na thei hi. Amau’ khielnate maisah sinlen, na muna panin amau’ mawna phietmang sin. Na mai-ah amate puasah sieng in; na lungthah laitah ma-in amate thuohsah pai in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Pei inlen beelkheng pa’ leibeel khat va lei ta’n. Mite lahah upa pawlkhat le khangham siempu pawlkhat zawpi inlen,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />beelkeh Tunkot lutna-a om Hinnom tapa’ kuomah pei inlen, kang thu gente khumnah va tangko ta’n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nangma in tam bangin na gen ding hi: Judah kumpite le Jerusalem-a tengte aw, Topa’ kammal za un. Vanglien Topa , Israel’ Pasien in tam bang ci hi: Keima in tua thu a za mi zosie’ bil a khen giap dingin tam munah tam bang gimna ka tungsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile mite in keima ei nuasie zo a, amate, a pu a pate ule Judah kumpite in a thei ngai lo uh pasien dangte kungah biehnate pie-in tam mun a buasah ta uhi; azieh pen amate in mawna a nei lo mite’ sisan tawh tam mun a kidimsah zo ta vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />tuale ka thupieh ahi vawt lo, ka lungsim sunga zong a om ngai vawt lo, Baal kungah meihal biehna dinga a pieh ding uh ahi a tapate uh hal nadingin amate in Baal munsangte a banbanin a lam uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Topa in a cina-ah, tam mun pen Topheth ahi a, Hinnom tapa’ Kuom ahi zongin a kici nawn lo hun ang tung valon ding a, Kithana kuom kicizaw ta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Keima in tam munah Judah le Jerusalem’ gelnate a mawhna ka suohsah ding a, a galte uh mai-ah namsau tawh puasahin tha dinga a suite’ khutlum tawh amate ka sisah ding hi. A luong hawmte uh hui lahah vate le leitunga gamsate’ an dingin ka pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tam khuopi pen a cimulthaw huoi, a ehneh hohuoi-in ka bawl ding a, a suoh kha mi zosie in ama’ gimna zosiete ziehin cimultho-in tua khuopi a ehneh ho ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A galte le amate a tha sawm mite in imtawmin a lungkhamsah ciengin keima in a tanute ule a tapate uh’ sa ka nesah ding a, a unpi-un a innvengte’ sa a ne ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ciengin na zawpite muna-ah na beel na sukeh ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />amate kungah tam bangin na gen ding hi: Vanglien Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Mite in beelkheng pa’ beel sukehin bawlphat thei a op lo bang ma-in keima in tam mite le tam khuopi ka sukeh ding hi. Si vui nading mun a om nawn lo za dongin amate in Topheth ah si a vui ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tam mun le a sunga tengte tungah tu-a bangin ka bawl ding a, tam khuopi pen Topheth ka bangsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Jerusalem innte le Judah kumpite’ innte, innkhum zanga vantung nate zosie tungah biehna-a a kipiehna inn zosie le pasien dangte tungah dawn thei biehna a kibuohna innte zosie a unpi-in Topheth mun bangin kibuasah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Topa in thu gen dinga a sawlna Topheth panin Jeremiah a pei ciengin, Topa’ biehinn leituol ah ama dingin mi zosie tungah tam bangin a gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Vanglien Topa , Israel’ Pasien in tam bang ci hi: Tam khuopi le a khuoneute tungah ka gensa gimna zosie ka tungsah ding hi, azieh pen amate in a lungsim uh khausahin ka thu gente a ngai sih uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tu-in Jeremiah in a gen tami thute, Topa’ biehinn uhpi pa ahi Immer’ tapa, siempu Pashhur in a za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua ciengin Pashhur in kamsang Jeremiah sat gawp a, Topa’ biehinn sunga Benjamin Tunkot tungnung ah kol a bul hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A zing ciengin Pashhur in Jeremiah a kol a sutpieh ciengin ama kungah Topa in na min pen Pashhur ci-in na phuo loin, “Muncin tengah Zauna” ci-in na phuozaw hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Azieh pen Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Keima in nang le na guol teng zosie’ zauna ahi dingin nang kang bawl ding hi; tuale nang in na et lai tahin a galte uh’ namsau tawh amate a pua ding uhi. Tuale keima in Babylon kumpipa khut sungah Judah gam zosie ka pie ding hi; ama in sal dingin Babylon ah amate peipi-in namsau tawh a that sieng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Keima in tam khuopi’ hauna zosie, a sui a lam teng zosie, a na manpha zosie le Judah kumpite’ gou teng zosie amate a bulu a galte uh’ khut sungah ka pie ding a, amate in sutin manin Babylon ah a peipi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuale nang, Pashhur le na inn sunga omte zosie Babylon khuo-ah salin na pei ding uhi; khum munah note na si ding vua, zuou kamsanna tawh thu na hil na guol teng zosie tawh khum munah ang kivuiton ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa aw, nang in kei nei sol a, tuaci’n solin ka om ta hi; kei sangin nang na hatzaw a, tuaci’n kei nei zo ta hi. Sun tungtawnin nuizat nopna-in ei kinei hi; mi zosie in ei zako uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile ka thugen simin kiko-in, “Tatsietna le kisietna!” ci-in ka awng vapuoh ding hi,” a ci hi. Bangzieh ahei cile Topa’ kammal ka gen ziehin sun tungtawnin simmawna le zapina ka thuohlaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Keima in, “A min ka gen sih ding a, ama’ min ka lo nawn sih ding hi,” ci nanleng zong, ka lungsim sungah meikuong bangin a om a, ka gu sung ei zen hi; ka ki-ip na lamin ka gim a, lah ka ki-ip zo tuom sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile mite’ kidap hona tampi ka za a, “Muncin teng zauhuoi hi! Ama heh un! Ama heh va vui,” a ci uhi. Ka lawm itte zosie in ka pua ding ei buh vua, “Ama kizawl zo kha na va, eite in ama zo na va vui, tuaci’n eite in ama tungah phu la zo na vai,” a kici uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahi vangin galhang pa bangin kei tawh Topa ang om hi; tua ziehin ei bawlsiete a kipai ding vua, ei zo sih ding uhi. Amate in a muolsuo zawh lo ding ziehun nahpi tahin maizum ding uhi. Kumtawnin a mindaina uh kimangngil ngai lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Vanglien Topa aw, nangma in midihte na sittel a, nangma in mihing’ lungtang le a lungsim na mu hi; nangma in amate tunga na thuhkiana ei musah in, azieh pen nangma tungah ka vaite kang ap zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Topa tungah la sa un; Topa phat un! Azieh pen ama in migilote’ khut sung panin mi cimawte’ hinna a hunkhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka suo ni samsietin om taheh! Ka nu in keima ei suosah ni in thupha nga sih taheh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka pa kungah, “Tapa na nei ta hi,” ci-in thu va ko-in, ama a lungdamsah pa khu samsietin om taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua mipa pen Topa in a khuotuo vawt lo, a lumlet khuopite bang taheh; ama in zingmawngin kaana awging za hinlen, sunkim ciengin zong patauna awging za taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile ama in naubu sungah ei na that sih hi; ei na that hi leh ka nu khu ka hankhuh hi pai ngel ding a, a gil in kumtawnin ei paai den mai ding hiven.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Gimna tawlna le dana teng sin ding le zalat muolphona tawh hinkhuo mang ding bep a, bang dinga naubu sung pana na suoh kha khelkhel ka hei?
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kumpi Zedekiah in Jeremiah kungah Malchiah’ tapa Pashhur le Maaseiah’ tapa siempu Zephaniah a sawl ciengin ama kunga a tung Topa’ kammal tam bang ahi hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Hepina tawh Topa kungah kote tangin thu ei dawh pieh in, azieh pen Babylon kumpipa Nebuchadnezzar in kote ei sim hi; ama in a sepsa bangin ko adingin Topa in na lamdang khat hing bawlin ko kung panin ama hing kilesahkia thei kha ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jeremiah in amate kungah tam bangin ci hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Zedekiah kungah tam bangin na gen ding hi: Israel’ Pasien Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Kulpi pulamah note ang imtawm Babylon kumpipa le Chaldea-te na dona uh ahi, na khut sung vua om galvante nualam sena-in ka nei ding hi; tuale keima in tam khuopi laikimah amate ka kaikhawm ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kei mama in lungthahna, lungsona le thangpaina lienpi tawh ka khut zahin ka banhat tawh note kang do ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuale keima in tam khuopi sunga tengte a mi a sa pumin ka satlia ding a, pulnatna lienpi tawh amate a si sieng ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua zaw ciengin Topa in kang ci-in, keima in Judah Kumpipa Zedekiah, ama’ nasemte, le tam khuopi sunga teng mite- pul natna, namsau, le kielpi pana a suohta lai teng tawh a hinna uh tha dinga a sui Babylon kumpi Nebuchadnezzar’ khut sung le a galte khut sungah ka pie ding hi. Ama in a hiem namsau tawh amate a satlia ding hi; ama in amate khuotuo loin zong hinkhawi lo ding a, lainatna kici zong nei lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuale nang in tam mite kungah tam bangin na gen ding hi: En un, keima in na mai vuah sina lampi le hinna lampi ka koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tam khuo sunga om mi poma namsau, kiel, le pulnatna tawh a si ding uhi; ahi vangin pusuoh dawhin note ang imtawm Chaldea-te kunga a lut poma gal vanlah bangin a hinna a suotatpi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile keima in tam khuopi hoi nading hi lo, a sietna dingin ka mai ka ngat zo ta hi: Tua khu Babylon kumpipa’ khut sungah ka pie ding a, ama in mei tawh a hal ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Judah kumpite’ innkuon tungah tam bangin gen in: Topa’ kammal za un,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />David’ innkuon aw! Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Zingmawngin thutangin khen unlen, mi bawlsiepa’ khut sung panin a kisuompa hlakhie un. Ahi sihle na bawl sietnate ziehin ka thangpaina mei bangin ang kuongin koima in phel zo lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />En un, kuom zanga a teng le zanglei tunga om suongtum aw, nangma kang langpang hi, Topa in ci hi; nang in “Koi ahiei eite ei do-a ang kumsuh zo ding, koi ahiei eite kibuhna muna ang lut zo ding?” na ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na sepna ga tawh kituohin dan kang pie ding hi, Topa in ci hi; ama’ gamlahah mei ka hal ding a, a kimvel zosie ka sieng ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Judah kumpipa’ inn ah va peisuh inlen, tam thu khumnah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />tam bangin va gen ta’n: David topha tunga a to Judah kumpipa aw, nang, na nasemte le tam tunkotte-a ang lut na mite in Topa’ kammal za un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Thutang le thudih tawh gamta unlen, mi bawlsie pa’ khut sung panin a kisuom khat popo hlakhie un. Pemtate, pa nei lote le meigongte tungah khielna bawl loin tatsietna zong zang sih unlen, ahi sihle mawna a nei lo mite’ sisan tam munah luongsah sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile note in tam thute na man tahtah uleh, David’ topha tunga a to kumpite in sakol leengte le sakolte tungah tuongin amate, a nasemte le a mite tawh tami inn tunkotte tawnin ang lut ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahi vangin tam thute na thuse sih uleh tami inn pen gamdai a suoh dingin kei mama ka kiciem hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Azieh pen Judah kumpipa’ inn tungtangah Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Nang pen kei adingin Gilead le Lebanon muolvum bang na hi hi; hinanle keima in nang pen mi ten lona khuopi senel gam ang suosah dingin ka kiciem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nang langkhatah a galvan teng tawh ang susie ding mite ka kithawisah ding hi; amate in na taamtah sing hoipente hing phuapiehin mei-ah pai ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuale minam tampite in tam khuo nawhin a unpi-un, “ Topa in bang dinga tami khuopi lien a hici bawl ta adiei,” ci-in khatlekhat kiho ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuale amate in, “A Pasien uh Topa’ thuciemna a taisan vua, pasien dangte bie-in a na a sep zieh uh ahi hi,” ci-in a dawng ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A sisa mipa kaa sih unlen, zong hlasietpi sih un; A kipeipi pa kaazaw un, bangzieh ahei cile a pienna gam a mu dingin ama ang kilekia nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Azieh pen a pa Josiah’ za a luo, tam mun pana a peidawh Judah Kumpi Josiah’ tapa Shallum tungtang thu Topa in tam bangin a gen hi: Tam sungah ama ang kinuale nawn sih ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />sal tang dinga a kikaina munah si-in tam gam a mukia nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Dihtat lona tawh a inn a lam, thutang lo tawh a inndan tungnung a lam pa; a mawhna-in a innvengte na a semsah, a thaman a pie lo pa in gimna thuoh ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Inn golpi khat lam vangin innkhan tungnung tampi neisah vang,” ci-in tawlet vangte bawlin, taamtah sing thuopsawn a, zasan tawh a zut mi in gimna thuoh ding hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Taamtah sing tawh inn na lam ziehin kumpi kisa na hi amah? Na pa in an ne tui dawnin thutang le thudih tawh na sem hi lo amah? Tua ciengin ama a dau a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama in mizawngte le mi cimawte’ vai thutang tawh a khenpieh hi; tuaci’n ama a khutlam a zang hi. Tam khu kei nei thei nading uh hi lo amah, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hinanle a manlo-a nga nading, maw nei lote’ sisan luonsah nading le, bawlsietna le ngongtatna dingin na mit ule na lungsim uh na zang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Judah Kumpipa Josiah’ tapa Jehoiakim tungtang thu Topa in tam bangin a gen hi: Amate in ama adingin, “Kadei, ka sanggam pa! Kadei, sanggam nu!” ci-in a kaa sih ding uhi. Amate in ama adingin, “Kadei, ka pupa! Kadei, a thupina!,”ci-in zong a kaa sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ama pen laa si a kivui khat bang lelin kivui ding a, Jerusalem tunkot pulamah kikai phitin kipai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lebanon ah kato-in awng unlen, Bashan ah na aw sangsah un; Abarim panin awngzah un, azieh pen na guolngaite zosie kisu maimang zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Na dau uh a pei laitahin kang hopi a, ahi vangin, “Na thu ngai sih vang,” nei ci hi. Na neu lai-a kipanin a tuaci den na hi hi. Azieh pen nang in ka thu na mang sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hui in na tuucingte zosie uh lenmang sieng ding a, na guolngai teng uzong salin kiman ding hi; tua ciengin na gitlona zosie uh ziehin mai zumin na lungkie ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Lebanon ah tengin taamtah sing lahah bu a bawlte aw, note tungah gimna ang tun ciengin numei nausuoh nat bangin bang na ci tau vagua ding vuoi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Topa in, keima a hing ka hi ma bangin, nang Judah Kumpipa Jehoiakim’ tapa Coniah pen ka zietlam khuta kang but ka suoikaina khutsip na hi phiel ta zongin tua panin kang sutdawh ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />nang ang thasawm na giin mama Babylon Kumpipa le Chaldea-te’ khut sungah kang pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Na suona mun ahi lo gamdang khatah nang le na pienna na nu kang paidawh ding a, khumnah na si ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ahi vangin a kilekia nopna uh gamah amate kilekia nawn lo ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tam pa, koima in a dei lo, a kisimmaw beelkehsa, Coniah hi lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ka gam, ka gam, ka gam aw, Topa’ kammal ngai ven!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Tam mipa, ta nei lo pa, a khan tawntunga khuosuoh ngai lo ding pa, ci-in ciemte in; azieh pen ama’ suonlehlah khat beh David’ topha tungah to lo ding a, Judah gam zong uhkia lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka gantatna munah tuuhonte a susie, a kithezahsah tuucingte in gimna thuoh ding uhi! Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Topa , Israel’ Pasien in ka mite a kem tuucingte tungtang thu tam bangin gen hi: Note in ka tuuhonte thezahin na delmang vua, amate na cing sih uhi. Tuaci’n na gitlo gamtatnate ziehun keima in note kang cing ding hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ciengin kei mama in amate ka delmangna gam zosie panin a omlai ka tuuhon teng ka kaikhawm ding a, a huong sung vuah amate peipikia-in amate pungin a khang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amate a cing dingin tuucingte ka koi ding a, zau nawn lo, lungkham nawn loin khat beh zong mang nawn lo ding hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa in kang ci-in, keima in David adingin a thudih a bazam khat ka tundawh ding hun ang tung valon ding a, ama kumpi bangin maang ding a, pilvang tahin vai hawmin gam sungah thudih thutang tawh thu a khen ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama’ hun sungin Judah kihundam ding a, Israel lungmuong tahin a teng ding hi. Ama a kihlat nading min in: “ Topa eite’ Dihtanna,” ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Topa in kang ci-in, “Egypt gam pana Israel mite a peipi Topa a hing ahi ma bangin,” ci-in kiciem nawn loin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Ama in a delmangna leilu lam gam le gam zosie panin Israel innkuon’ suonte a mapui Topa a hing ahi ma bangin,” ci-in a kiciemzaw ta ding uhi,” a ci hi. Tua ciengin a gam ciet vuah amate a teng ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kamsangte tawh kisai-in: Topa zieh le a kammal siengthote ziehin keima sungah ka lungsim zanciim a, ka gu ka tang zosie a kithing hi; kei pen zu in a zawgawp zu kham pa tawh ka kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile gam sungah angkawmte a dim hi; samsietna ziehin gam sung kap a, gamlah lonona munte gawta sieng hi. Amau’ lampi a hoi sih a, amau’ thahatna zong maan lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kamsangte le siempute in a ni gelin Pasien a zatah sih uhi; ka biehinn sung nangawnah a gitlona uh ka mu hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ziehin amau’ lampi pen khuomiel lamnal bang hi ding a, khumnah kidelmangin amate a pua ding uhi; azieh pen amau’ gimthuoh ding hun a tun ciengin amate tungah gimna ka tungsah ding hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Samaria kamsangte lahah a muthadahuoi khat ka mu hi: Amate in Baal minin thu a hil vua, ka mi Israel-te a puikhiel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hinanle Jerusalem kamsangte sungah a mulkinhuoizaw lai na khat ka mu zo hi: Amate in angkawmin zuouthu a gen uhi; a gitlona uh panin koima a kilekia lo nadingin amate in na hoi lo a bawl mite’ khut a khausah uhi. Kei adingin amate a unpi-un Sodom a bang sieng ta vua, a sunga teng mi zosie zong Gomorrah a bang ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin kamsangte tawh kisai-in Vanglien Topa in tam bangin gen hi: “Keima in amate gamsai ka nesah ding a, keima in a dawn dingun gutui ka pie ding hi; bangzieh ahei cile Jerusalem kamsangte panin gamsung muncin tengah Pasien zatah lona kizel zo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Vanglien Topa in tam bangin gen hi: Na kung vuah thu hing genin note ang sol kamsangte’ thugente ngai sih un; amate in a lungsim sung vua a geltawm uh thute ang gen uh ahi bo a, Topa’ kam sung pan hi lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Amate in Topa’ kammal a simmawte kungah, “Note adingin hing hoi na va,” a ci den mielmuol uhi; amau’ lungtang khauna banga khau taha a zui mi zosie kungah amate in, “Note tungah tuosietna ang tung sih ding hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Azieh pen Topa’ kikhopna ah koi ding ngai a, a thugente va thei ngai, va za ngai ahi ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />En un, Topa’ huipi khu! A thangpaina pumpei kihiapi ang pusuoh zo hi; migilo pa’ lutung a mutgawp ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A lungtup teng semin a tangtunsah masangsie, Topa’ lungthahna a kilekia sih ding hi. Ang tung ding nite ah note in kicien tahin na thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka sawl lopi-in kamsangte a tai uhi; amate kungah ka gen lopi thu a songen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hinanle amate ka kikhopna ah ang to uh hi leh, amate in ka mite kungah ka kammalte a tangko thei ding vua, a lampi hoi lote ule a gamtat hoi lote uh panin amate kinuahei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kei pen a naina muna a om Pasien ka hi amah? A gamlapi-a zong a om Pasien hi lo ka mah? Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ka mu thei lo nadingin koi in phuolsel munah amate phuol thei ding ahei? Topa in ci hi. Vantung le leitung dim hi lo ka mah? Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Keima in, “Mang man zo ing, mang man zo ing!” ci-in keima’ min tawh zuouthu a gen kamsangte’ thugente ka za zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Zuouthute hilin a lungsim sung vua a suoh misolna po a gen kamsangte ang kiheikia nading bang tanvei sawt ding ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A pu a pate un Baal a bieh ziehun ka min a mangngil bangun khatlekhat a mang uh kigenin ka mite keima’ min a mangngilsah sawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Mang man kamsangpa in a mangmat gen hinlen, hizongle ka kammal a nei pa in muonhuoi tahin ka kammal gen taheh. Butu le butang bangci kibah thei ding ahei, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ka kammal mei tawh kibang a, suongte a satguoi thei sehta tawh zong kibang hi lo amah, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin en un, khatlekhat keima’ kammal a kiguhpieh kamsangte ka langpang hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />En un, a phuotawm uh thu gen hi napi, “ Topa in ci hi,” a ci kamsangte ka langpang hi,” Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />En un, Topa in kang ci-in, ka sawl lopi le thu ka pieh lopi-in zuou mang genin amate thu hil a, a zuouna ule khawhsah ci a nei lona uh ziehin ka mite lam a puikhiel kamsangte ka langpang hi; tuaci’n tam mite in amate a phattuompi vawt sih uhi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tam mite, ahi sihle kamsang khat, ahi sihle siempu khat in, “ Topa’ vangih bang ahei?” ci-in nang ang dawh uh ciengin nang in amate kungah, “Tua vangih nangma na hi a, nang kang paimang ding hi, Topa in ci hi,” na ci ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Kamsang, siempu, ahi sihle ka mite khatpo in, “ Topa’ vangih,” a ci leh ama le a innkuonpite gim ka pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Note lahah, “ Topa in bangin ang dawng ei? “ahi sihle, “ Topa in bang ang gen ei?” khatlekhat na kici ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Ahi vangin, “ Topa’ vangih,” ci-in na gen nawn poma sih ding uhi. Bangzieh ahei cile Topa’ vangih na ci uh pen note’ thugen ahi bo a, tuaci’n note in eite’ Pasien ahi a hing zing Pasien, Vanglien Topa’ kammalte na leheipieh ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Note in kamsangpa kungah, “ Topa in bangin ang dawng ei?” ahi sihle, “ Topa in bang ang gen ei?” ci-in tua bangin na dong ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ahi vangin, “ Topa’ vangih” na ci uleh Topa in tam bangin ci hi: “ Topa’ vangih,” na ci sih ding uhi, ci-in kang sawl vangin note in “ Topa’ vangih,” ci kammalte gen zo ta na hi ziehun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />tuaci’n note hing domto-in note le na pu na pate uh tunga ka piehsa khuopi pen ka opna panin ka paimang valon ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Kumtawn simmawna le maizumna kang thuohsah ding vua, tua khu bangma cih hunin a kimangngil ngai nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa’ biehinnpi mai-a a kikoi theiga lawdim ni Topa in ei musah a, tam pen Babylon Kumpi Nebuchadnezzer in Jerusalem panin Judah Kumpi Jehoiakim’ tapa Kumpi Jeconiah le Judah uliente, khutsiemte le siakheng siemte tawh manin Babylon ah sal dinga a peipi zaw ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Law khatah a min masate tawh a kibang theiga hoite om a, ahi vangin adang law khatah neh thei lo ding za donga a hoi lo theigate a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa in keima kungah, “Jeremiah aw, bang na mu ei?” ei ci hi. Kei zong, “Theiga ka mu hi, a hoite hoi mama a, a hoi lote lah a hoimaw sengin kine thei lo hi,” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ciengin keima kungah Topa’ kammal ang tung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Israel’ Pasien Topa in tam bangin a gen hi: Tam mun panin Chaldea-te gama ka sawldawh Judah gam pana saltangte pen tam theiga hoite bangin ka ngaisun ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amate a hoi nadingun keima in mit tuhna-in ka nei ding a, tam gamah ka peipikia ding hi. Keima in amate ka lam ding a, ka phelmang sih ding hi; amate ka phut ding a, amate ka botzuon sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Keima Topa ka hi lam theitheina lungsim amate ka pie ding hi; ka kungah a lungtang zosie utawh ang kilekia ding uh ahi ziehin amate keima’ mi ahi ding vua, kei zong amau’ Pasien ka hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahi vangin Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Judah kumpipa Zedekiah, a uliente, tam gama a om den Jerusalem-a a omlai teng le Egypt gama a tengte pen a hoimaw senga a kine thei lo theiga bangin ka bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Leitung kumpi gam zosie adingin a mulkinhuoi le a siehuoi-in amate ka bawl ding a, ka delmang nading muncin tengah mite’ simmawna, thusie gentena, zakona le awsie lawna ka thuohsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amate le a pu a pate uh ka piehsa gam panin ka suhmaimang masangsie amate lahah namsau, kielpi le pul natna ka tungsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Judah Kumpipa Josiah’ tapa Jehoiakim kumpi a suozaw a kum li cin kumin Judah mite zosie tawh kisai-in Jeremiah kungah Topa’ thu a tung hi. (Tua hun pen Babylon ah Nebuchadnezzar kumpi a suo a kum khatna kum ahi hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kamsang Jeremiah in Judah mi zosie le Jerusalem-a a teng zosie kunga a gen ahi hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Judah kumpi Amon’ tapa Kumpi Josiah a kumpi suo zaw a kum sawm le thum pan tuni dongin kum sawmni le kum thum sung vilvel Topa’ thu ka kungah ang tung a, na kung vuah kang gengen vangin na ngai nuom sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa in na kung vuah a nasem kamsangte zosie ang sawl den vangin note in ngai loin na bil zong na daw sih vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />tuale amate in, “Tu-in na unpi-un na gitlona ule na gamtat sietna panun na kihei uleh Topa in note le tanglai-a na pu na pate uh tungah kumtawn nei dinga ang pieh gam sungah na om suoh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A na sem ding le a bie dingin pasien dangte’ nua zui sih unlen, na khut utawh na bawl uh milimte ziehin kei ei lungthahsah sih un. Tua hile ke’n zong note bangma kang law sih ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahi vangin note in ka thu na ngai sih vua, na gim nga nadingun na khut utawh milim bawlin nei lungthahsah uhi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Vanglien Topa in tam bangin gen hi: Note in ka thu na man nuom lo ziehun
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />leilu lam gama om minam zosie le ka nasempa Babylon Kumpipa Nebuchadnezzar nangawn ka thuta ding a, tam gam le a sunga teng mi zosie le tam kimvela om minam zosie a do dingin ka kuonsah ding hi; keima in amate ka sumaimang ding a, a cimulthawhuoi, a ehneh hohuoi le kumtawnin mite’ simmaw-in amate ka bawl ding hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amate kung panin kipah thanopna awging, motha nu le zi nei pa’ awgingte ka tawpsah ding a, an gawina gingte le meivah tangte ka sumit ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tam gambup kisie-in koima’ ten lona gamkhing suoh ding a, tua minamte in kum sawmsagi sung Babylon kumpipa’ na a sem ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kum sawmsagi a cinzaw ciengin amau’ khielna ziehin keima in Babylon kumpipa le a gam dan ka pie ding a, a gam uh kumtawn gamdai ka suohsah ding hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amate tungah tua gam ka dona ka thu gensa zosie, Jeremiah in minam zosie a dona a genkholsa zosie, le tami laibu sunga kigielsa zosie ka tungsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile minam tampite le kumpi liente in zong amate salin a nei ding uhi; keima in amau’ gamtatsate le a khut utawh a bawlsa uh nasepna dung zui-in amate tungah ka thuhkia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Israel’ Pasien Topa in kei kungah tam bangin gen hi: Ka khut tung panin tam lungthahna zuhai la inlen, kang sawlna minam zosie dawnsah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amate in dawn ding a, keima in amate lahah ka sawl ding namsau ziehin amate hawi vadoi-in a motlaw ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuaci’n keima in Topa’ khut panin tua hai ka la a, Topa ei sawlna minam zosie ka dawnsah hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Jerusalem le Judah khuopite, a kumpite ule a uliente uh pen tuni-a ma bangin mi ten lona gamkhing suoh a, a ehnehhuoi le samsiethuoi ahi ta uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Egypt kumpipa Pharaoh le a nasemte, a uliente le a mite zosie;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />nam kisawhal mite zosie; Uz gam sunga kumpi zosie; Philistia gam sunga kumpi zosie - Ashkelon, Gaza, Ekron, le Ashdod-a a omlai teng;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Edom, Moab, le Amon-te;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tyre kumpite zosie, Sidon kumpite zosie, le tuipi panga om kumpi zosie;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Dedan, Tema, Buz khuopite le a sam a heukieu zosiete;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Arabia kumpite zosie le senel gam sunga teng nam kisawhal mite’ kumpite zosie;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Zimri kumpite zosie, Elam kumpite zosie le Media kumpite zosie;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />a nai a gamla-a om leilu lam kumpite zosie le lei maitanga a om leitung kumpi gam zosie khat zaw khat keima in ka dawnsah hi. Tuale amate zaw ciengin Sheshach kumpipa in dawn ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua ciengin Israel’ Pasien Vanglien Topa in amate kungah tam bangin a gen hi, na ci ding hi: Dawn un, kham unlen luo un. Note lahah namsau hing sawl ding ka hi ziehin pua unlen thokia nawn sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuale amate in na khut tung panin dawn ding hai a lah nuom sih uleh amate kungah tam bangin ci in: Vanglien Topa in tam bangin a gen hi: Na dawn teitei ding uh ahi hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />En in, keima’ min tawh a kilo khuopi sungah gimna tunsah ka kipan ta ding hi, tua ahile dan thuohna tawh note bangci kipel thei ding na uh ahei? Keima in leitunga teng mi zosie langkhatah namsau khat sawl ding ka hi ziehin dan thuoh loin na om sih ding uhi, Vanglien Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin, nang in amate ka langpanna tam thute zosie hil inlen, amate kungah tam bangin gen in: A sangna mun panin Topa ang hawh ding a, a siengtho ama’ tenna panin ama ang ham ding hi; a mite langkhatah ama nahpi tahin hawh ding a, lengga cil mite bangin leitung mi zosie langpangin a awng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Topa in minamte tungah thu phul ding ahi ziehin, ama’ awging in leimong dong a thawn ding hi. Ama in mi zosie thu sit ding a, namsau tawh mawneite that ding hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Vanglien Topa in tam bangin ci hi: En un, gam khat pan gam khatah gimna a kizel ta a, leitung a gamla pen mun panin huipi lien khat in nuoigawp ta hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tua ni-a Topa in a thalia mite leimong khat panin mong khat dongah kithezah ding uhi. Koima in amate ki kaa loin a luong uh kikhawm lo ding a, zong kivui lo ding hi; lei lahah amate eh nuasie-in kinuasie lel ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />No tuucingte aw, kap unlen mau un; no tuuhon lamkaite aw, vut lahah kilawmlia un, azieh pen ang kithalia ni ding ule note ang kithethang ni ding ang tung zo a, a kituomteel beel bangin note na pua ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tuucingte adingin tai nading mun om lo ding a, tuuhon lamkaite adingin suotah thei nading om lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Ngai vawi un! tuucingte kaana aw, le tuuhon lamkaite mauna aw khu! Azieh pen Topa in amau’ lonona mun suhsietpieh zo a, a giinhuoi mama Topa’ lungthahna ziehin
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />a galmuonna uh gam kisiecip hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Migilo pa’ a thahat namsau le a giinhuoi a lungthahna ziehin humpi in a kibuhna mun a nuasie bangin amau’ gam pen gamkhing a suoh zo hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Judah Kumpipa Josiah’ tapa Jehoiakim kumpi a suo cil lai-in Topa kung panin tam thu a tung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Topa’ biehinn huong sungah va ding ta’nlen Topa’ biehinn sungah a bie dinga ang pei Judah khuopite zosie va hopi in; gen dinga kang sawl zosie amate tungah gen in; kam khat zong hen nei sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amate in a unpi-un na thugen ngai-in a gitlona panun ang kihei thei kha ding uhi. Tua hile amau’ bawl gitlonate ziehin amate tunga ka tunsah sawm gimna ka khelkia thei kha ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nangma in amate kungah tam bangin na gen ding hi: Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Note in ka thu ngai loin na mai-vua kang koipiehsa ka thukham bangin na gamtat sih vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />note kungah kin taha kang sawl - a thu na ngai lo vangun - ka nasem ka kamsangte’ thugen na ngai sih uleh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />tam biehinnpi pen Shiloh bangin ka bawl ding a, tam khuopi pen leitunga minam zosie’ kisamsietna-in ka bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Siempute, kamsangte, le mi zosie in Topa’ biehinn sunga Jeremiah in a gen tam thute a za uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mi zosie tungah Topa in gen dinga a sawl zosie Jeremiah in a gen zaw ciengin siempute, kamsangte, le mi zosie in ama manin, “Nang na si ding hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bang dingin, ‘Tam biehinn pen Shiloh tawh kibang ding a, tam khuopi ah a teng koima om loin gamdai a suoh ding hi,’ ci-in Topa’ min tawh thu hil na hei?” a ci uhi. Tuale Topa’ biehinn sunga a om mi zosie in Jeremiah a imtawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Judah uliente in tam thute a zah ciengun kumpipa’ inn sung panin Topa’ biehinn sungah peito-in Topa’ biehinn lutna Tunkot Tha ah a to uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ciengin siempute le kamsangte in uliente le mi zosie kungah, “Tam mipa in sina a thuoh ding kilawm hi, azieh pen na bil ciet utawh na zahsa ma bangun ama in tami khuopi lang pangin thu a gen zo hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jeremiah in ulien zosie le mi zosie kungah, “Note in na zahsa uh tam biehinn le tam khuopi lang khatah thu gen dinga ei sawl pa pen Topa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin tu-in na omdan ule na gamtatnate uh puopha unlen, Topa na Pasien uh’ thu mang un. Tua hile Topa in note tungah tunsah dinga a gelsa gimna a khelkia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hinanle kei ka hi leh tam mun na khut sung vua om ka hi hi. Hoi na sah uleh dih na sah bangun kei tungah ei bawl un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kei nei tha vua ahile, note in no mama tung, tam khuopi, le a sunga teng zosie tungah maw nei lo sisan a tungsah ding na hi lam uh kitelcien beh ta un, bangzieh ahei cile note in na bil mama utawh na zah dingun tam thute mantaha a gen dinga Topa in keima ei sawl ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ciengin uliente le mi zosie in siempute le kamsangte kungah, “Tam pa in Topa i Pasien’ min tawh eite kunga thu ang gen ahi bo ziehin sina a thuoh ding kilawm lo hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Gam sung upa pawlkhat zong dingin a kikhawm mipite kungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Judah Kumpi Hezekiah’ uh hun sungin Moreshheth-a Micah in Judah mi zosie kungah tam bangin a gen hi: ‘Lo dingin Zion kihlo ding hi; Jerusalem pen buathahlom suoh ding a, tuale biehinn muol pen gamlah munsang a suoh ding hi, Topa in ci hi,’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Judah Kumpipa Hezekiah le Judah zosie in ama a that tahtah sam uh amah? Ama in Topa zatahin, Topa maipha ngen a, tuale Topa in zong amate tungah gimna tunsah ding a gensa pen khelkia zaw hi lo amah? Ahi vangin eite in eima’ tungah gimna lienpi i tungsah dihtah uhi!” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kiriath-jearim panin Topa’ min tawh thu a hil Shemaiah’ tapa Uriah a kici midang khat zong a om hi. Jeremiah’ gen bangma-in ama in tam khuopi le tam gam lang khatah thu a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuale Kumpi Jehoiakim, a galhang zosie le ulien zosie in ama’ thugen a zah ciengun kumpipa in ama tha dingin a sui hi; hizongle Uriah in tua thu a zah ciengin zau-in Egypt gamah a tai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua ciengin Kumpi Jehoiakim in Egypt gamah Achbor’ tapa Elnathan le a mite sawl a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />tuale amate in Egypt gam panin Uriah manin Kumpi Jehoiakim kungah a puoh vua, ama in namsau tawh tua pa satlia-in mi maimaite’ kivuina munah a luonghawm a pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ahi vangin Shaphan’ tapa Ahikam in Jeremiah a panpi ziehin tha dingin mite’ khut sungah kipie lo hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Judah kumpi Josiah’ tapa Zedekiah kumpi a suo cilin Topa kung panin Jeremiah kungah tami thu a tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Keima kungah Topa in tam bangin a gen hi: Khau kivaw hahkol khat bawl inlen na ngawngah bul in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Judah kumpi Zedekiah tawh kimu dinga Jerusalem khuo-a a haw palaite khut tung panin Edom kumpipa, Amon kumpipa, Tyre kumpipa, le Sidon kumpipa kungah thu zasah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amau’ pute adingin tam thu gen in: Israel Pasien, Vanglien Topa in tam bangin a gen hi: Na pute kunga na gen ding uh thu tami ahi hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Keima in ka vanglienpi le a kizah ka khut tawh leitung le a mite le leitunga om ganhingte ka bawl a, ka pieh nuom khatpo tungah ka pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tu-in keima’ nasempa Babylon Kumpi Nebuchadnezzar’ khut sungah tam gamte zosie ka pie zo a, ama’ na sem dingin a gamsate nangawn ka pie zo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama’ gam a kisiet ding hun a tun masangin minam zosie in ama le a tapa le a tupa’ na a sem ding uhi; tua ciengin minam tampite le kumpi liente in ama salin a neikia ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahi vangin minam khat ahi sihle kumpi gam khatpo in tam Babylon kumpi Nebuchadnezzar’ na sem nuom loin Babylon kumpipa’ hahkol a ngawnga a puoh nop sih leh ama’ khut tawh ama’ kisuhsietna ka mansiengsah masangsie namsau tawh, kielpi tawh, pul natna tawh tua minam dan ka pie ding hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ziehin na kung vuah, “ Babylon kumpipa’ na na sem sih ding uhi,” ci-a ang gen na kamsangte uh, na aisante uh, na mangman theite uh, na sihla ho theite ule na bum aitawite uh’ thugente na um sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Azieh pen amate in na kungah zuouthu a gen vua, tua ziehin na gam panun a gamlapi ah ang kihem dawh ding uhi. Keima in note kang notdawh ding a, tuaci’n na mangthai ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hinanle minam khat in a ngawngah Babylon kumpipa’ hahkol puo-in ama’ na a sep leh, lo hlo-in a ten thei nadingin ama’ gam sung ma ah ka omsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Judah kumpipa Zedekiah kungah tua bang ma-in ka gen hi: Babylon kumpipa’ hahkol puo-in ama le a mite’ na semin hing in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Babylon kumpipa’ na a sem lo ding minam poma tawh kisai-in Topa in a gensa ma bangin bang dingin namsau, kielpi, le pul natna tawh nangma le na mite si ding na hi uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Babylon kumpipa’ na na sem sih un, ci-a na kung vua thu ang gen kamsangte’ thugen ngai sih un, bangzieh ahei cile amate pen na kung vua zuothu gen ahi bo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Keima in amate ka sawl kha sih hi; hizongle keima’ min tawh a man lopi-in thu a hil vua, tua ziehin keima in note le na kung vua thu ang hil kamsangte kang notmang ding a, na mangthai ding uhi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ciengin siempute le mi zosiete kungah Topa in tam bangin a gen hi: “Babylon panin Topa’ biehinn sunga beelte kilakia bai ta ding hi,” ci-a na kung vua thu ang hil na kamsangte uh’ thugente ngai sih un, bangzieh ahei cile amate pen na kung vua zuouthu gen ahi bo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Amau’ thugen ngai sih un; Babylon kumpipa’ na sem inlen hing un. Bang dingin tami khuopi gamdai suoh laizang ding ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amate pen kamsangte ahi vua, amate kungah Topa kammal a op tahtah leh Topa’ biehinnpi sung, Judah kumpipa’ innpi sung, le Jerusalem khuopi sunga a kinuasie lai beelte, Babylon khuo-a a kipuohkia nawn lo nadingin Vanglien Topa kungah thum uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Azieh pen Judah kumpipa Jehoiakim’ tapa Jeconiah le Judah gam le Jerusalem khuo sunga uliente zosie, Jerusalem panin Babylon ah sala a peipi laitahin ama in a nuasie lai khuompite, tuikuongpite, a ngahnate, le adang beelte tawh kisai-in ahi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Topa’ biehinn sung, le Jerusalem khuo sunga a kinuasie lai beelte tawh kisai-in Vanglien Topa Israel Pasien in tam bangin a gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Babylon ah tuate kipuokia ding a, ka kankia masangsie tuatahah a omsuoh ding hi. Tua ciengin keima in tuate ka lakia ding a, tam munah ka koikia ding hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khum kum sung ma-in, Judah Kumpi Zedekiah kumpi-a a maan zaw kum li le hla nga a cin kumin, Gibeon panin Azzur’ tapa kamsang Hananiah in Topa’ biehinn sunga siempute le mi zosie mai-ah keima ei hopi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Vanglien Topa Israel’ Pasien in tam bangin a gen hi: Keima in Babylon kumpipa’ hahkol ka tawngsansah ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Keima in kum ni sungin Babylon Kumpipa Nebuchadnezzar in tam mun pana a lah Babylon khuo-a a peipi, Topa’ biehinn sunga vanzah zosie tam munah ka tutkia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Keima in Judah kumpi Jehoiakim’ tapa Kumpi Jeconiah le Judah gam pana Babylon ah sala a peite zosie tam munah ka peipi kia ding hi, Topa in ei ci hi. Azieh pen Babylon kumpipa’ hahkol ka tawngsah ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa’ biehinn sunga a ding siempute le mi zosie mai-ah kamsang Jeremiah in kamsang Hananiah hopi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />kamsang Jeremiah in, “Amen! Topa in khum bangin hing bawl taheh. Topa in na thugenkholna bangin hing tungsah ta hinlen, Babylon panin Topa’ biehinn sunga vanzahte le sala kiman zosie tam munah hing tutkia tapo heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hizongle tu-in nang le mi zosie’ zaha kang gen tam thu na ngai ta un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kei le nang masanga tanglai kamsangte in gam tampi le kumpi gam liente’ tungah gal, kielpi le pulnatnate ang tung ding hi, ci-in na genkhol zo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kilemna om ding hi, ci-in a gen kamsangpa ahile Topa in ang sawl kamsang tahtah ma amah, ci pen tua kamsangpa’ thugen ang tangtun ciengin kithei pan ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ciengin kamsang Hananiah in kamsang Jeremiah’ ngawng panin a hahkol sutpiehin a kuoitan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuale Hananiah in mi zosie mai-ah thu gen a, “ Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Tu-a bangin kum ni sungin minam zosie’ ngawng panin Babylon Kumpipa Nebuchadnezzar’ hahkol ka tawngsansah ding hi,” a ci hi. Khuci’n kamsangpa Jeremiah a pei ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kamsangpa Hananiah in kamsangpa Jeremiah ngawng panin hahkol a sattanpieh zaw hun phabep khat ciengin Jeremiah kungah Topa’ thu a tung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pei inlen Hananiah kungah, Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Nangma in sing hahkolte na tawngsah ta a, khumte tangin sia hahkol ka bawl zo ta hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Israel’ Pasien Vanglien Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Babylon Kumpipa Nebuchadnezzar’ na a sep thei nadingun minam zosie’ ngawng ah sia hahkol ka puosah zo a, amate in ama’ na a sem tahtah ding uhi; keima in ama tungah gamsate nangawn ka pie zo hi, a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kamsang Jeremiah in kamsang Hananiah kungah, “Ngai vawi, Hananiah, Topa in nang ang sawl lopi, tam mite zuouthu na umsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Keima in lei maitang panin kang hemmang ding hi. Nang in Topa langpanna thu na gen zo tah ziehin kum ni sungin na si ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Khumi kum ma a hla sagi hla-in kamsangpa Hananiah a si mintah hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tam teng pen Jerusalem panin Babylon ah Nebuchadnezzar in sala a peipite lahah a omlai upate, siempute, kamsangte, le mi zosie tungah Jerusalem pana Jeremiah’ laihlah ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tami lai a hlah hun pen Kumpi Jeconiah le kumpipa’ nu, kumpi innsung uliente, Judah le Jerusalem makaite, khutsiemte le siakhengte, Jerusalem pana a pei nua uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua laihlah pen Judah Kumpi Zedekiah in Babylon gam ah Babylon Kumpipa Nebuchadnezzar kunga a sawl ahi Shaphan’ tapa Elasah le Hilkiah’ tapa Gemariah-te’ khut tung pana kihlah sawn ahi hi. Tua sungah tam bang kici hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jerusalem panin Babylon ah sala ka puoh zosie tungah Israel’ Pasien Vanglien Topa in tam bangin ci hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Inn lam unlen a sungah teng un; umte bawl unlen na um sunga gate kineh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zi nei unlen tanu le tapate tawi un; tanu tapa tampi a tawi thei nadingun na tapate a zi ding uh suipieh unlen, na tanute uh mohlah un; khum munah kiem loin pung semsem un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahi vangin note sala kang koina khuopi’ phattuomna ding sui unlen, tua khuopi adingin Topa kungah thu ngetpieh un, azieh pen tua khuopi in phattuomna a nga ziehin note in zong phattuomna na mu ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Israel’ Pasien, Vanglien Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Note lahah a om kamsangte le aisan theite kisolsah sih unlen, mangmat ang gente uzong ngaipieh sih un,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />azieh pen ka min tawh na kung vua ang gen uh thute zuouthu ahi bo a, amate ken ka sawl kha sih hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Babylon hun sung kum sawmsagi a cin cieng behin keima in note kang ve ding a, na kung vua ka thuciemsa tangtungsahin tam munah kang peipikia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Azieh pen keima in mai lamah note lametna kang pieh nading, note’ sietna ding hi lo, na phattuomna dingun gelna ka neite teltahin ka thei hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ciengin note in keima ei hlanin keima kungah hing pei-in thu nang nget ciengun, keima in na thungetna uh kang ngaipieh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Note in keima nei sui ciengun, na lungsim zosie utawh nei sui uleh nei mu ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Note’ mu-in ka om ding hi, Topa in ci hi. Tuale na gam uh kang piekia ding a, note kang delmangna gam zosie le mun zosie panin kang kaikhawm kia ding a, sala kang matsahna mun ma-ah kang tutkia ding hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“ Topa in eite dingin Babylon ah kamsangte ei koipieh zo hi,” note in ci na hi ziehun
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />David kumpi topha tunga a to kumpipa tawh kisai thu le tami khuopi sunga teng mi zosie le saltang dinga note tawh a zawhton lo na sanggamte utawh kisai-in, Topa in tam bangin ci hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Vanglien Topa in tam bangin a gen hi. Amate tungah namsau, kielpi, le pulnatna ka hla ding a, amate pen a kine thei lo theiga muot ka bangsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Namsau, kielpi, le pulnatnate tawh amate ka nuadel ding a, leitung kumpi gam zosie lahah a cimulthaw huoi-in bawlin, ka delmangna minam zosie lahah amate kisamsie, kilipkhap, ki-ehneh ho-in kizako ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amate in ka thu thupisim lo uh ahi ziehin amate kungah ka nasemte ka sawl ngitnget vangin amate in a ngai nuom sih uhi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ahi vangin Jerusalem panin Babylon khuo-a kang sawl no saltang zosie aw, tu-in Topa’ thu ngai un:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Keima’ min tawh note kunga zuouthu ang hil Kolaiah’ tapa Ahab le Maaseiah’ tapa Zedekiah-te tawh kisai-in Israel’ Pasien, Vanglien Topa in tam bangin a gen hi: Babylon Kumpipa Nebuchadnezzar’ khutah amate ka pie ding a, ama in na muna vuah amate that ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuale amate ziehin Judah panin Babylon-a saltang mi zosie in: “Babylon Kumpi Nebuchadnezzar in mei tawh a hangaw Zedekiah le Ahab-te bangin Topa in nang hing bawl taheh,” ci-in kisamsietna-in a zang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Azieh pen Israel gamah amate a mot gamtat vua, a innvengte’ zite mawpi-in thu ka pieh lopi ka min tawh zuouthu a gen uhi; keima a thei pa le tecipang pa ka hi hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Nehelam khuomite Shemaiah kungah tam bangin na gen ding hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Vanglien Topa Israel’ Pasien in tam bangin ci hi: Nangma in na min tawh Jerusalem-a om mi zosie, Maaseiah’ tapa siempu Zephaniah le siempute zosie tungah lai na hlah a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Topa’ mama in kamsanga kinei mimaw kici poma kol bulin thong sunga a khum ding uliente a koi dingin Topa mama in siempu Jehoiada tangin nang siempui-in ang koi zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua hi a, bang dingin note tunga kamsanga ang kinei Anathoth-te ahi Jeremiah khu na phawhsiet lo ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Azieh pen ama in Babylon gama kote tungah lai ang hlah a, “Sawt veipi saltang lai ding na hi uhi; inn lamin a sungah teng ulen, um zong bawlin a sunga piengte ne un,” ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Siempu Zephaniah in kamsangpa Jeremiah’ zahin tami laihlah a sim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jeremiah tungah Topa’ thu a tung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Saltang zosie kungah Nehelam khuomi Shemaiah tawh kisai-in Topa’ thugenna tam bangin zasah in: Ka sawl vawt lopi Shemaiah in note kungah thu hing hilin zuouthu ang upsah ziehin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Keima in Nehelam khuomi Shemaiah le a suonlehlahte dan ka pie ding hi; ama in Topa langpanna thu gen zo ahi ziehin tam mite lahah a hinglai mi khat beh in ka mite tunga ka sil hoi bawl dingte a mu sih ding uhi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa kung panin Jeremiah kungah thu ang tung pen khu tami ahi hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel’ Pasien, Vanglien Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Na kunga kang gensa thute zosie laibu khat sungah khum in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Azieh pen Topa in a genna-ah, ka mite ahi Israel le Judah tungah a gam uh ka piehkia nading nite ang tung valon ding a, tuale a pu a pate uh kunga ka piehsa gamah amate peipikia-in tua gam a luo ding uhi, a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tam teng pen Israel le Judah tawh kisai-in Topa in a gen thute ahi hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Eite in zauna, le patauna aw i za zo vua, lungnopna aw ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tu-in kan unlen encien vawi un. Pasal in nau a pai thei amah? Tua ahile bang ziehin pasal zosie in numei nausuoh nat banga a khut utawh a tai uh a hum mu ka hei? Bang dingin a maite uh kangdang ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka nu ei! Khum ni pen a nasie sengin tua bang ni a om ngai sih hi; tam pen Jacob adingin lungkham hun hi ding a, hinanle khum panin ama kihunkhie veve ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Khum ni ciengin keima in ama’ ngawnga hahkol kuoitawngin, ama’ kihenna khaute ka bottan ding a, tuale ama pen namdangte in salin khawi nawn lo ding hi, Vanglien Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahi vangin amate in Topa a Pasien uh’ na le a kumpi uh David’ na a sem ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hinanle ka nasempa Jacob aw, nang na hi leh zau vawt sin, Israel aw, lungkham sin, Topa in ci hi. bangzieh ahei cile a gamlapi panin note kang hundam ding a, keima in a saltanna uh panin na suonlehlahte ka hundam ding hi. Jacob’ suonte ang kilekia ding a, amate sip dide le nuomtahin omin, koima in a zausah nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Azieh pen kang hutdam thei nadingin nang tawh kang omton hi, Topa in ci hi; amate lahah nang kang thethangna minam zosie ka susie ding a, ahi vangin keima in nangma kang susie sih ding hi. A kituoh bep khatin thu kang hil ding a, dan pieh loin lah kang mawh koi sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Azieh pen Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Na liemna dam thei lo a, na hima nasie mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na vai puo ding koima a om sih a, na hima adingin zatui om loin, na dam nading zong bangma a om sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na lawm it zosie in ang mangngil sieng a, amate in nang ang don nuom ta sih uhi; azieh pen na khielna lien luo-in na mawna tam luo ahi ziehin, khuotuona a nei lo galte khat dan ka pieh bang le galte khat satin ka liemsah bangin, nang kang bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Na liemna ziehin bang dingin kapkap na hi ahei? Nang natna pen damsah thei ahi sih hi. Na khielna lien luo-in na mawna a tam seng ziehin, keima in na tungah tam teng kang bawl ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ziehin nangma ang valte ken zong kivaltum ding a, na galte zosie a unpi-un salin kipeipi ding hi. Nang ang bulute kibulu ding a, galmata nangma ang mante galmatin kiman ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Azieh pen amate in mi kipampai hing ci-in “Koima’ don lo Zion na hi hi,” ang ci ziehun na tungah damna kang piekia ding a, na liemmate ka damsah kia ding hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Jacob suonte’ buhte a ngaingai ka bangsah kia ding a, amau’ tenna mun tungah lainatna ka nei ding hi. A muol tungah khuopi kilamkia ding a, a om ngaina mun ma-ah kumpi inn omkia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Khumte sung panin lungdamkona la sahna le guolnopna awging ang pusuoh ding hi. Amate ka pungsah ding a, a tawmtham ahi sih ding uhi; mi zatah dingin amate ka bawl ding a, amate a kineu-et sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A tate uh pen hun lui lai bang ding a, a mihonpite uh ka mai-ah kiphutdet ding hi. Amate a gawt mi zosie dan ka pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A kumpi ding uh pen amate khat ma hi ding a, a vaihawm lamkai ding uh amate sung pan ma-in ang pieng ding hi; Keima in a nai ah ama ka kai ding a, ama in ka kung ei zuon ding hi. Tua hi sihle koi in ka kung ei zuon ngam ding ahei, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuale note ka mite na hi ding vua, kei na Pasien uh ka hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />En un, Topa’ khuopi huipi khu! Thangpaina ang pusuoh ta a, pumpei kihiapi in migilo pa’ lutung mutgawp ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ama’ lungtup teng semin, a tangtun masangsie, a giinhuoi Topa’ lungthahna a kilekia sih ding hi. Ang tung ding nite-ah note in tami na telsiem ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khum hun ciengin Israel innkuonte zosie’ Pasien ka hi ding a, amate ka mi ahi ding uhi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Namsau-a suohtate in senel gamah hepina mu uhi. Israel in toidamna a sui ciengin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />ama kungah a gamlapi panin Topa kilang hi. Keima in a tul thei lo itna tawh nangma kang it hi; tua ahi ziehin keima in na tungah kang thumanna ka zomsuoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ngahnu siengtho Israel! Keima in kang lamkia ding a, nang na kilampha ding hi. Nangma in na tawmte na la ding a, a guolnuomte’ lamna-ah na va pei ta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Samaria muoltung tengah lenggui na suonkia ding a, um bawlte in suonin, a ga ne-in a nuomsa ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bang ding ahei cile Ephraim muoltung panin galvilte in, “Hing pei un, Topa i Pasien uh kung Zion ah peito vai,” ci-in a hlat nading uh ni khat ang tung ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Azieh pen Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Jacob ading kipahna tawh a gingin la sa unlen, minamte lahah a lienpente adingin kiko-in awng un; “A omlai na mi Israel-te hundam in, Topa aw,” ci-in kiko-in phat un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />En un, leilu lam gam panin amate ka peipi ding a, leitung a gamla pen mun panin ka kaikhawm ding hi. Amate lahah mittaw, khelbai, numei gaite le nausuoh natna a nei numeite, mihon tampite tawh a kilekia ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A kaa kawmun amate ang pei ding a, keima in henepna tawh amate ka puikia ding hi. Tui a opna lui gei-ah amate peisahin lamzang ka zawtpi ding a, a pua sih ding uhi. Bangzieh ahei cile kei pen Israel’ pa ka hi a, Ephraim, ka tapa ta pen ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Minamte aw, Topa’ thu ngai un. A gamla tuipi panglamah va gen ta un. “Israel a thezah pa in ama kaikhawm ding a, tuucingpa in a tuute a cin bangin ama a cing ding hi,” va ci ta un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Topa in Jacob tan zo a, ama dinga a hat mama khutte panin ama hunkhie zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amate ang pei ding vua, Zion muolsang tungah nahpi-in la sa-in, Topa’ hoina ahi, an, lenggazu, sathau, tuuno honte le ganta note ziehin a mai uh a tang ding hi. A hinkhuo uh tui kibuoh um bang ding a, a lunggim nawn sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ciengin ngahnute lamin a kipah ding vua, tangvalte le papite zong guolnuom ding uhi. Keima in a kaanate uh kipahna-in ka heipieh ding a, amate henemin a danate uh lungdamna ka suohsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Antui pen tawh siempute niengtahin ka va ding a, keima’ hauna ziehin ka mite lungtai ding uhi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Ramah ah nahpi kaana le mauna awging kiza hi. Rachel, a tate adingin kap hi; amate a op tah lo ziehin kihlai zo lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Kapkap nawn sin len, na hlitui sia dawh in; azieh pen na sepna ziehin thaman na nga hi, Topa in ci hi. A galte uh’ gam panin amate ang peikia ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na mailam adingin lametna a om hi. Topa in ci hi: Ama in na tate zong amau’ gam ma-ah ang peikia ding uhi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ephraim’ thumna ka za tahtah ta a: “A kisin lo bawngno thu nei hil a, nei thuhilna ka mang hi. Ei puikia inlen ei peisahkia in. Azieh pen nang Topa ka Pasien na hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Bang ding ahei cile ka peizaw ciengin ka kisiakia hi; keima ka kitheitel zaw ciengin ka phei ka beng hi; ka neu lai-a ka minsietna teng ka puoh den ziehin maizumin ka lung amgawp hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ephraim, ka it mama ka tapa ahi amah? Ama keima’ lungkimna tapa ahi amah? Ama langpangin thu ka gen sielin ama ka phawh lai veve hi. Tua ziehin ka lungsim sungah ama teng den hi; ama ka hepi tahtah ding hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Lampi ciemtenate phut unlen, lamlahnate bawl un; na peina uh lamlienpi limtahin ngaisun un, ngahnu siengtho Israel aw, hing kilekia unlen, tam na khuopite vuah hing kilekia un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A muonhuoi lo ka tanu aw, bang tanvei lungkaa ding na hei? Azieh pen leitungah Topa in a tha na khat a bawl hi: Numei in pasal a kimvel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Israel’ Pasien, Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Keima in a gam uh ka piehkia ciengin Judah gam sung le a khuopite uh sungah amate in, “A dih tenna aw, muol siengtho aw! Topa in thupha hing pie taheh,” ci-in tam kammalte khatvei a zangkia ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Judah gam le a khuopite uh sungah lohlote le a tuuhonte utawh a vah kawikawite a tengton ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Keima in a gimte ka tawldamsah ding a, a baate’ tha ka dimkia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua ciengin khangloin ka khuodah leh kei adingin ka kimut a nuom mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Keima in Israel innkuonte le Judah innkuonte tungah mihing cihlah le ganhing’ cihlah ka tu ding ni ang tung valon ding hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuale amate botdawhin phelkhie a, paimangin suhsiet ding le sietna tunsah dingin ka buh ma bangin, a lamkia ding le a phutkia dingin amate ka vil ding hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Khum ni ciengin amate in: “Pate in lengga thua a ne vua, a tate uh’ ha a za hi,” a ci nawn sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ahi vangin a mawnate uh ziehin mi zosie si ding uhi; lengga thua a nete zosie a ha uh za ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Keima in Israel innkuonte le Judah innkuonte tawh thuciemna tha khat ka bawl ding ni ang tung valon ding hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tua pen Egypt gam panin ka peipi thei nadingin amau’ khut tawh ka kaih hun lai-a a pu a pate utawh ka na bawl thuciemna tawh kibang nawn lo ding hi. Kei amau’ pasal ka hi vangin amate in tua thuciemna a palsat uhi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Khum hun zaw cienga Israel innkuonte tawh ka bawl ding thuciemna tami hi zaw ta ding hi, Topa in ci hi: Amate sungah ka thukham ka koi ding a, amau’ lungtang tungah ka giel ding hi; tuale kei amau’ Pasien ka hi ding a, amate keima’ mite ahi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Koima in, “ Topa thei in,” ci-in amate khatlekhat kihil nawn loin, khatlekhat zong kigen nawn lo ding uhi, bangzieh ahei cile amate in a neupen panin a golpen dongin a unpi-un keima ei thei ding uhi, Topa in ci hi. Azieh pen keima in amau’ khielna ka maisah ding a, a mawna uzong phawkhahin ka nei nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tam bangin Topa in a gen hi, sun a vahsah dingin ni ei pie a, zan a vahsah dingin hlapi le aasite’ ngaina kipte ei gelpiehin, tuihuolte a gin valuh nadingin tuipi a lawh pa - ama’ min pen Vanglien Topa ahi hi, a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tami ngaina kipte ka mai-a a manthai leh, Israel’ suonlehlahte zong ka mai panin minam khat ahina uh mangthai pan beh ding hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Tung lama vante kite thei hinlen, leinei-a leitung kitunna zungpi mudawh thei-a a op leh, Israel’ suonlehlahte zosie, amau’ gamtatnasate ziehin ka nuol pan beh ding hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Hananel tausang panin Kiu Tunkot dongin Topa adingin khuopi a kibawlphat ding hun ang tung valon ding hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />A tena khau pen Gareb muol dongin tangtahin kikai ding a, Goah lamah kihei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Misi luongte le vut buohna kuom bup le Kidron Lui cieng donga a om lo teng zosie, nisuona lama Sakol Tunkot cieng dong, Topa adingin mun siengtho a suoh ding hi. Bangma cih hunin tua khuopi kiphungkal loin zong kipaimang ngai nawn lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nebuchadnezzar kumpi a suo zaw kum sawm le kum gietna kum, Judah Kumpipa Zedekiah kumpi a suo zaw a kum sawmna kumin Topa kung panin Jeremiah kungah thu tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Khum hunin Babylon kumpipa’ galkapte in Jerusalem a imtawm laitah uh ahi a, kamsangpa Jeremiah zong Judah kumpipa’ inn huong sunga thong sungah a kikhumcip laitah ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama pen Judah kumpipa Zedekiah in tua muna a na khum cimit ahi hi. Zedekiah in, “Bang dingin nang in kamsangin: Topa in tam bangci hi: Keima in Babylon kumpipa’ khut sungah tam khuopi ka pie ding a, ama in a la ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chaldea-te’ khut sung panin Judah kumpipa Zedekiah suohta lo ding a, ahi vangin Babylon kumpipa’ khutah kipie tahtah ding a, tuale ama tawh kimaituo-in kiholimin a mit utawh a ki-entuoh ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />tuale ama in Babylon ah Zedekiah peipi ding a, keima in ama ka ve masangsie khum munnah omden ding hi, Topa in ci hi; Chaldea-te do nan locin na zo sih ding uhi, ci-a thu na hil mawh ahei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Jeremiah in, “Keima kungah Topa’ thu ang tung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nangma kungah na pano Shallum’ tapa Hanamel ang pei ding a, ama in, “Anathoth khuo-a ka lo kilei in, azieh pen sum tawh lei-in tatkiatheina thu nei khu nangma na hi hi,” ang ci ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa’ ang gen dung zui-in inn huong sunga ka opna thong sungah ka innlah sanggampa ang pei-in, “Benjamin gam Anathoth khuo-a ka lo lei in, bang ding ahei cile gam neina le tatkiatheina thu na nei hi; nangma adingin kilei in,” ei ci hi. Tua ciengin keima in tam pen Topa’ thu ahi lam ka thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuale keima in ka pano Hanamel kung panin Anathoth khuo-a lo ka lei a, ama adingin ngun shekel sawm le sagi ka tekhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Keima in thukimna lai tungah min ka thu a, gip tawh matin teci ding hlanin tawi khaina-ah sum ka te hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ciengin ka thukimna ule a thu teng a kigielna, gip tawh a kimat ka kileina uh lai le gip tawh a kimat lo laite ka la a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />ka innlah sanggampa Hanamel, ka kileina uh lai tunga minthu tecite, le thong huong sunga a to Judah mi zosie’ mai-ah Mahseiah’ tapa Neriah, a tapa Baruch kungah tua lai ka pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Keima in amate mai-ah tam bangin Baruch thu ka pie a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Israel’ Pasien, Vanglien Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Tami kileina laite, gip tawh a kimat le gip tawh a kimat lolai tegel la inlen, kisie loin sawt veipi a op thei nadingin leibeel sung khatah koi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Azieh pen Israel’ Pasien, Vanglien Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Tami gam sunga innte, lote le lengga lote ang kileikia ding hi, ci-in ka gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Neriah’ tapa Baruch kungah kileina lai ka pieh zaw ciengin Topa kungah thu ka ngen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kasai, Topa Pasien! Na khut zahin na vanglienpi tawh vanpi le leipi a bawl pa nangma na hi hi! Nang adingin a hamsa bangma khat beh om lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nangma in a khang tul khatna dongin na itna kip na lah a, hinanle pate’ khielna amau’ nua-a tate tungah na thuh hi. Vanglien Topa a kici a lien mama le a thahat mama Pasien aw,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />na thugelte hoi mama a, na sepnate thupi mama hi; nang in mihingte’ opdan zosie na musuoh a, a opdante ule a sepna gate uh dung zui-in mi zosie tungah thaman na pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nangma in Egypt gamah lim le na lamdangte na lah a, tuni dongin zong Israel gam le mi zosie tungah lahin, tuni cieng dongin na min a thangsah peisuoh pa na hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nangma in na mi Israel-te Egypt gam panin lim le na lamdangte tawh ahi a, a kizah nangma’ banhat tawh ahi a, mulkin huoitah tawh ahi zongin na ladawh hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />a pu a pate uh kungah pieh dinga na ciemsa, bawngnawi le khuoizu a luonna tami gam amate na pie hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />tuale amate lutin tam gam a luo uhi. Ahi vangin amate in na thu mang loin na thukham zong zui loin, bawl dinga na thupiehte zosie a bawl sih uhi. Tua ahi ziehin nangma in amate tungah tam gimna zosie na tungsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />En un, khuopi a kilah nadingin leiciente kicieng zo a, namsau, kielpi, le pulnatnate a thuohna ziehin amate a do Chaldea-te’ khut sungah tua khuopi a kipie ta hi. Na gensa bangin ang pieng zo hi, ci nang mama-in na mitin na mu thei ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ahi mawh vangin Topa Pasien aw, tam khuopi pen Chaldea-te’ khut sungah kipie zo nanle nang in kei kungah, “Na teci ding mi ciel inlen tua lo sum tawh lei in,” nei ci zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Jeremiah kungah Topa’ thu a tung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />En in, kei pen mi zosie’ Pasien, Topa ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Chaldea-te’ khut sung le Babylon Kumpi Nebuchadnezzar’ khut sungah tam khuopi ka pie ding a, ama in a la ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tam khuopi a sim Chaldea-te pei-in mei tawh khuopi a hal ding vua, ka lungthah nadingin innkhum tung tengah Baal ading biehnate lui zo-in, pasien dangte adingin dawn thei biehnate zong a sung zo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Azieh pen Israel mite le Judah mite in a neu lai vua kipanin ka muna-ah bangma bawl loin a sie beh a gamta uhi; Israel mite in bangma dang bawl loin, a khut utawh a bawlte uh ziehin keima ei lungthahsah uhi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tam khuopi in a kisat cila kipanin tuni cieng dongin keima ei lungthahsahin ei thangpaisah ahi ziehin ka muna panin ka hemmang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Israel mite le Judah mite - amate, a kumpite ule a uliente uh, a siempute ule a kamsangte uh, Judah mite le Jerusalem khuo-a a teng mite in a bawl uh sietna zosiete ziehin keima ei lungthahsah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Amate in kei ei maingat loin ei nuangat uhi; amate thu hilhil nanleng ngai nuom loin thuhilna a sang nuom sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Amate in ka min kilawna biehinn sungah a kidahhuoite koi-in a buasah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Amate in Molech tungah a tanute, a tapate uh a pieh nadingun Hinnom’ tapa kuomah Baal biehna munsangte a bawl uhi. Keima in Judah mite a khielsah tami a kidahhuoi a bawl dingin amate thu ka pie ngai sih a, zong ka ngaisun kha beh sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin tu-in, “Namsau, kielpi, le pulnatna ziehin Babylon kumpipa’ khut sunga kipie ahi ta hi,” na ci uh tam khuopi tawh kisai-in Israel’ Pasien, Topa in tam bangin ci hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />En vawi, ka lunghangin ka lungso a, ka nah thangpai seng ziehin ka delmangna gam zosie panin amate ka khawmtuo kia ding a, tam munah tutkia-in amate lungmuong tahin ka omsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Amate keima’ mi hi ding a, kei zong amau’ Pasien ka hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Amate hoi nading, a nua cieng vua a tate uh’ hoi nading le a lungtang vuah kum tawnin ei giin thei nadingun lungtang khat le tawndan khat amate ka pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Amate tungah sil hoi bawlna ka khawl ngai lo nadingin amate tawh tawntung thuciemna khat ka bawl ding hi. Keima kung panin a kiheimang lo nadingun amau’ lungtang sungah keima giinna ka guon ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Amate tungah na hoi ka bawl ziehin ka kipah ding a, ka lungtang zosie le ka hinna zosie tawh thuman tahin tam gamah amate ka phutdet ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Azieh pen Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Tam mite tungah tam gimna zosie ka tunsah ma bangin, amate tungah tu-a ka ciem na hoi zosie ka tungsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tami gam pen mihingte le ganhingte a ten lona gamkhing hi a, Chaldea-te’ khut sungah kipie zo ta hi, note in na ci uh tami gamah lote kileikia ta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Benjamin gam sung, Jerusalem kimvela munte, le Judah gam sunga khuopite, muoltung gam sunga khuopite, Shephelah gam sunga khuopite, le Negeb gam sunga khuopite ah lote sum tawh kilei ding a, tecite tawh thukimna lai tungah letmat thu-in gip tawh kimat ding hi; azieh pen keima in a gam uh ka piekia ding hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Thong huong sungah a kikhumcip laitahin Jeremiah kungah Topa’ thu a ni veina a tung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Leitung bawlin a kipsah Topa, a min Topa a kici Topa in tam bangin ci hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Keima ei hlan un, kang dawng ding a, na thei ngai lo uh phuolsel thulienpite kang gen ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Azieh pen galte’ leicien cienna zieh le gal dona ziehin namsau mai-ah a kisusie ding ahi tami khuopi sunga innte le Judah kumpite’ innte tawh kisai-in, Israel-te’ Pasien, Topa in tam bangin ci hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka lungthahna le ka thangpaina ziehin keima in ka thalia ding misi luongte tawh a kidimsah dingin gal sim dingin Chaldea-te ang pei ding hi, azieh pen a gitlona zosiete ziehin tami khuopi panin ka mai ka phuol zo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tami khuopi tungah noptuomna le cidamna tungsahin amate ka damsah ding a, amate tungah a kicing hauna le lungmuonna ka lah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Keima in a saltanna panun Judah le Israel ka lakia ding a, a op masah lai bangun ka omsah kia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Keima tunga ang bawl uh a mawna uh zosie panin amate ka siengsah ding a, ka tunga ang mawnate ule ei langpanna zosiete uh ka maisah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuale keima in tami khuopi pen amate adinga ka bawl na hoi zosie a za ding ahi leitung minam zosie’ mai-ah lungdamna, patawina, le vanglietna hi ding hi; ama adinga ka pieh hoina le nopsahna zosie ziehin amate zau-in a citun ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Note in, “Tam munah mi lah om lo, ganhing lah om lo, a hawmpi-a om hi bo, na ci ma bangun, Judah khuopite le Jerusalem gawlzingte hawmsuoh a, mihing ganhing koima teng ta sih, ci-a na genna mun vuah awging ang kizakia ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />kipah thanopna awging, zinei pa le motha nu’ awging le Topa’ biehinn sunga lungdamko biehna awging ahi, Vanglien Topa tungah lungdamna ko un, azieh pen Topa hoi a, ama’ itna kip tawntung hi!” ci-a lasahna awgingte a kizakia ding hi. Bangzieh ahei cile keima in a masa lai bangin a gam uh hamphatna ka piekia ding hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Vanglien Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Mihing le ganhing om lo a hawmsuoh ahi tami mun le a khuopi zosie ah tuucingte ading lonona mun le a tuuhonte toi om nading mun omkia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Muoltung khuopite, Shephalah khuopite le Negeb gam khuopite, Benjamin gam, Jerusalem khuo kimvel munte le Judah gam khuopite ah tuuhon phaza a sim pa’ khut sungah tuuhonte a vah kawi kawi ding uhi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Israel innkuonte le Judah innkuonte kungah ka kamciem ka tangtunsah ding ni ang tung valon ding hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Khum ni le khum hun ciengin David adingin a dihtat Bazam khat ka zamsah ding a, ama in gam sungah thutang le thudih tawh thu a khen ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Khum ni ciengin Judah khu a kihundam ta ding a, Jerusalem lungmuong tahin a teng ding hi. Tuale ama a kihlat nading a min: “ Topa, Eite’ Dihtatna,” kici ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Topa in tam bangin ci hi: David’ suon sung panin Israel innkuonte’ kumpi topha tungah a to ding mi kitasam ngai lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Levi siempute zong ka mai-a meihal biehna a lui ding, an tawh biehna a tawi ding, le biehpiehnate a bawl zing ding mi a kitasam ngai sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Jeremiah kungah Topa’ thu a tung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Note khatpo in a hun kiciengtan banga sun le zan a tun lo nadingin sun tawh ka thuciemna le zan tawh ka thuciemna na phel thei vua ahile,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />tua cieng behin ka nasempa David tawh ka thuciemna a kisie hi pan ding a, tuaci’n David in ama’ kumpi topha tungah a to ding tapa nei loin, ka nasem Levi mite tawh ka thuciemna zong a kisie ahi pan ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Van mihonte a kisim zo lo le tuipi gei-a senelte a kite zo lo bangin keima in ka nasempa David’ suonte le ka nasem Levi-te ka pungsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Jeremiah kungah Topa’ thu a tung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tam mite in, “ Topa in a teelsa innkuon nite nuol zo ta hi, ci-in a gen uh na phawh kha ta sih amah? Tuale amate in ka mite tua bangin simmaw-in minam khat a zong a sim tah lo uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Sun le zan tawh ka thuciemna kipsah nai loin, van le lei tawh ngaina kipte a bawl zo nai lo khat hi poma leng,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Jacob’ suonte le ka nasempa David’ suonte ka nuol ding a, Abraham, Isaac, le Jacob’ suonte tungah a uh dingin ama’ suonlehlahte lahah khat zong ka teel sih ding hi. Azieh pen tu-in tua bang hi loin a gam uh ka piekia ding a, amate tungah hepina ka nei ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Babylon Kumpipa Nebuchadnezzar in a galkap zosie, leitunga kumpi gam zosie le ama’ uh sunga a om mi zosie tawh Jerusalem le a khuopi zosie a sim laitahin Topa kung panin Jeremiah kungah thu a tung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Israel’ Pasien, Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Pei-in Judah kumpipa Zedekiah hopi inlen ama kungah tam bangin gen in: Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Babylon kumpipa’ khut sungah tam khuopi ka pie ding a, ama in mei tawh a hal ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuale nang mama zong ama’ khut sung panin suohta loin ang kiman ding a, ama’ khut sungah ang kipie tahtah ding hi; na mit tawh Babylon kumpipa mu-in ama tawh kimaituo-in na kiho ding uhi; tuale nang Babylon ah na pei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hinanle Judah Kumpipa Zedekiah aw, Topa’ thu ngai phot tadi’n! Nangma tawh kisai-in Topa thugen tam bang ahi hi: Namsau tawh na si sih ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />lungmuongin na si ding hi. Tuale na mai-ah kumpi a sem na pu na pate adingin panamtui a kihal bangin nang adingin zong panamtuite kihal ding a, ‘Kadei aw, pu aw!’ ci-in ang kikaa ding hi. Bangzieh ahei cile keima in kang gen zo ta hi,” Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jeremiah in Jerusalem-a a om Judah kumpipa Zedekiah kungah tam thu zosie a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khum hun pen Babylon kumpipa in Jerusalem le a omlai Judah khuopite ahi Lachish le Azekah a sim laitah uh ahi hi; bangzieh ahei cile Judah khuopite lahah kulpi a nei khuopi tam gel beh om ta bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Zedekiah Kumpipa in amate tungah Jerusalem-a mi zosie tawh suotahna thu a tangko nading thuciemna a bawl zaw ciengun, Topa kung panin Jeremiah tungah thu tung a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />mi zosie in a Hebrew silate uh, numei le pasal, hlakhie ding a, koima in Judea-te salin a hen nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuale mi zosie in a salte uh numei hile pasal hile hlakhie-in salin kikhawikia thei nawn lo ding hi, ci-a thuciemna a nei ulien zosie-a kipan mi zosie in a mang pai uhi; amate in thu a mang vua, amate a hla sieng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahi vangin khum zaw ciengin a lungsim uh kikhelin a hlasa uh pasal le numei salte mankia-in a khut sung vuah salin a khawikia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa kung panin Jeremiah kungah thu a tung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Israel’ Pasien, Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Kei mama in saltanna Egypt gam panin na pu na pate uh ka peipi lai-in amate tawh thuciemna khat ka bawl a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“No kunga ang kizua, na na uh kum guh sung a semsa Hebrew mi kici poma kum sagina a cin sielin na hla ding uhi; noma’ na a sepna uh panin amate na hla valon ding uhi,” a ci hi. Ahi vangin na pu na pate un ka thu ngai loin a bil ei daw sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A sawt loin noma mama na kisiakia vua, noma khatlekhat tungah suotahna thu tangko-in ka muna-ah na hoi bawlin ka min kilawna biehinn sunga keima mai-ah thuciemna na bawl zo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahi vangin note in na lungsim uh khelkia-in ka min na daisah vua, amau’ deina banga na hlasa uh sila numei le pasalte mankia-in na khut sung vuah na semsahin sal bangin a na koikia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Note in na innvengte ule na guolte uh suotahna pie un, ci-a kang thugen nei mang sih uhi; keima in note tungah suotahna kang pie ding a, tua khu namsau, pul natna le kielpi tawh si dinga suotahna hi ding hi, Topa in ci hi. Keima in leitung kumpi gam zosie’ cizat dingin note kang bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuale ka thuciemna palsatin, ka mai-a a bawl uh thuciemna sunga om thute a zui lote pen keima in bawngno phal ni suo-in a kikala a peina uh bawngno bangin ka bawl ding hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Bawngno phalsuo-in tua bawngno kikala a peisa Judah uliente, Jerusalem uliente, numeite a uh cilgesa pasalte, siempute le bawngno phal kikala a peisa gam sung mi zosie,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />a galte ule amate a thasawm mite’ khut sungah ka pie ding hi. A luonghawmte uh vana vate le leitunga gamsate’ an a suoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Judah Kumpipa Zedekiah le a uliente ahi uleh, a galte uh’ khut sung, amate a thasawm mite khut sung, le note kung pana ang kilekia Babylon kumpipa galkapte’ khut sungah ka pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Keima in thu ka pie ding a, tam khuopi ah amate ka peisahkia ding hi; tuale amate in tua khuopi simin tuale la-in mei tawh a hal ding uhi. Judah khuopite koima’ ten lona gamdai ka suohsah ding hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Judah kumpipa Josiah’ tapa Kumpi Jehoiakim hun sungin Topa kung panin Jeremiah kungah thu a tung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Rechab-te’ inn ah pei-in va hopi ta’nlen, Topa’ biehinn sunga innkhan khatah amate zawpi in; tua ciengin a dawn dingun zu pie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuaci’n keima in Habazziniah’ tapa Jeremiah, a tapa Jaazaniah le a sanggamte, a tapate zosie le Rechab’ innkuon zosie ka zawpi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa’ biehinn sung, kotpi cing pa Shallum’ tapa Maaseiah’ innkhan tung lam, uliente’ innkhan nai-a om Pasien’ mi ahi Igdaliah’ tapa, Hanan tapate’ innkhan sungah amate ka zawpi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ciengin Rechab-te’ mai-ah lenggazu a dima kikoi beelte le haite ka lui a, keima in amate kungah, “Lenggazu dawn un,” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahi vangin amate in, “Lenggazu dawn malmal sih va ung; bang ding ahei cile Rechab’ tapa ka pu uh Jonadab in thu ei pie a, ‘Note na hi vua, na tapate uh ahi zongin lenggazu na dawn ngai poma sih ding vua, noma le na suonte un zong a dawn ngai poma sih ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />note in inn zong lam loin khai zong na tu sih ding uhi; lengga lo zong bawl loin khat na ngawn na nei sih ding uhi; ahi vangin na tenna uh gam sungah kum sawt na hin thei nadingun na khan tungtawnun puonbuh sungah na teng ding uhi,’ ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kote in Rachab’ tapa ka pu uh Jonadab’ ei thupieh zosie ka mang zo ta vua, ka hin sungun kote le ka zite, ka tate ule ka tanute un lenggazu dawn loin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />ten nading inn zong ka lam sih uhi. Kote in lengga um ahi a, lo ahi a, khaici ahi zongin bangma ka nei sih uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />kote ka hi ule puon buhte ah ka tengzaw vua, ka pu uh Jonadab’ ei sawl bangbang mangin ka gamta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahi vangin tam gam sim dingin Babylon Kumpipa Nebuchadnezzar ang peito ciengin, ‘Hing pei un, Chaldea galkapte le Syria galkapte giing i hi ziehun Jerusalem ah pei vai,’ ka kici uhi. Tua ahi ziehin Jerusalem khuo-a na teng ka hi uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jeremiah kungah Topa’ thu a tung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Israel’ Pasien, Vanglien Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Pei inlen Judah mite kung le Jerusalem-a tengte kungah, “Ka thu mangin thuhilna khat sin lo ding na hi uh amah?” Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Rechab’ tapa Jonadab in a suonlehlahte kungah lenggazu a dawn lo ding uh a thupiehna kizui hi; tuni dongin amate in bangma a dawn sih uhi, azieh pen amate in a pu uh’ thupieh a mang uhi. Ke’n na kung vuah kang gengen vangin ka thu na mang sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka nasem ka kamsang zosie na kung vuah kang sawl ngitnget a, ‘Tu-in na gitlona uh panin mi vannuoi kihei unlen, na gamtatnate uh kipuopha un. Amau’ na sem dingin pasien dangte nua zui sih un, tua hile noma le na pu na pate uh ka piehsa gamah note na teng ding uhi,’ a ci hi. Ahi vangin na bil nei daw sih vua, ka thu na ngai sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Rechab’ tapa Jonadab’ suonlehlahte in a pu uh’ thupieh a zui vangun tam mite in ka thu a mang sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Vanglien Topa Pasien in tam bangin ci hi: Keima in Judah gam le Jerusalem khuo-a teng mi zosie tungah amate kunga tunsah dinga ka gensa gimna zosie ka tungsah ding hi; bang zieh ahei cile amate kungah ka gen zo ta a, amate in a ngai nuom sih vua, amate ka hlan zo a, amate in ei dawng nuom sih uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ahi vangin Rechab’ innkuonte kungah Jeremiah in tam bangin gen hi: Israel’ Pasien, Vanglien Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Na pu uh Jonadab’ ang thupieh mangin ang thuhilnate zui-in, ang sawlna zosie na sem zo ta uhi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />tua ahi ziehin Israel’ Pasien, Vanglien Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Rechab’ tapa Jonadab in ka mai-a a ding zing ding suonlehlah a kitasam sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Judah Kumpipa Josiah’ tapa Jehoiakim kumpi a suo zaw a kum lina kumin tami Topa’ thu Jeremiah kungah a tung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Laiziel khat la inlen, tua sungah Josiah’ kumpi sep hun sung, nang kang hopi ni-a kipanin tuni cieng dong Israel gam, Judah gam le minam zosie langkhatah na kunga kang gen zosie giel in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Judah innkuonte in amate tunga ka tunsah sawm gimna zosie a zah ciengun amate a unpi-un a gitlona uh panin a kihei kha ding vua, keima in zong amau’ khielna le amau’ mawna ka maisah thei kha ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jeremiah in Neriah’ tapa Baruch hlan a, Topa in ama kunga a gensa thu zosie Baruch in Jeremiah’ sit bang lienin a unpi-in laiziel sungah giel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jeremiah in Baruch thupie a, “ Topa’ biehinnpi sungah kei ei kilutsah nawn lo hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />tua ahi ciengin nang mama va pei ta’nlen, antan ni khatin Topa’ biehinn sunga a om mi zosie’ zah dingin kang sit bangin laiziel sunga na gielsa Topa’ kammalte na va sim ta ding hi. Nangma in a khuopi uh pana ang peito Judah mi zosie’ zah dingin na sim ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua hile a tauna uh Topa mai-ah tungin, tuaci’n a unpi-un a gitlona uh panin a kihei thei kha ding uhi, bangzieh ahei cile Topa in tam mite tungah a tunsah dinga a gensa a lungthahna le a lungsona na sie mama hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kamsangpa Jeremiah in laiziel sunga Topa’ kammal sim dingin a sawl bangin Neriah’ tapa Baruch in Topa’ biehinn sungah a sim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Josiah’ tapa Judah Kumpipa Jehoiakim in kumpi a sep zaw a kum ngana, a hla kuona hla-in Jerusalem-a a om mi zosie le Judah gam khuopite panin Jerusalem-a ang pei mi zosie in Topa mai-ah an tan nading a phuongzah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa’ biehinn Tunkot Tha lutna, Topa’ biehinn sung, huong tungnunga om thuvanpi pa Shaphan’ tapa Gemariah’ innkhan sungah mi zosie’ zahin Baruch in laiziel sung panin Jeremiah’ thugente a simkhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Gemariah’ tapa, Shaphan’ tapa Micaiah in laiziel sung panin Topa’ kammalte a zah ciengin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />kumpipa’ inn sunga thuvanpi pa’ innkhan ah a peisuh hi; tuale khumtahah thuvanpi pa Elishama, Shemaiah’ tapa Delaiah, Achbor’ tapa Elnathan, Shaphan’ tapa Gemariah, le Hananiah’ tapa Zedekiah-te a kipan uliente a unpi-un a na to uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuale Micaiah in, mi zosie’ zahin Baruch in laiziel panin a simkhiet a zahsa thu zosie amate kungah a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ciengin ulien zosie in Baruch kungah Cushi’ tapa Shelemiah, a tapa Nethaniah, a tapa Jehudi a sawl vua, “Mite’ zahin na sim laiziel tawi-in hing pei in,” ci-in a hlansah uhi. Tuaci’n Neriah’ tapa Baruch in zong a khut sunga laiziel la-in amate kungah a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuale amate in ama kungah, “To inlen hing sim in,” a ci uhi. Tuaci’n Baruch in amate kungah a simkhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amate in tua kammal zosie a zah ciengun patauna tawh khatlekhat kihei-in a ki-en ciet vua, Baruch kungah, “Tami thute kumpipa kungah ka ko lo uh phamaw hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ciengin Baruch kungah, “Tami thu teng bang na ci giel ahei? Jeremiah’ ang sit banga na giel amah, ei gen in,” ci-in a dong uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Baruch in amate kungah, “Ama in tam thu zosie ei sit a, tua teng laitui tawh laiziel tunga ka giel ahi hi,” ci-in a dawngkia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ciengin uliente in Baruch kungah, “Nang le Jeremiah pei-in kiphuol unlen, na opna uh koima theisah sih un,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Amate in thuvanpi pa Elishama’ innkhan sungah laiziel nuasie-in kumpipa’ huong sungah lutin tua thu zosie kumpipa kungah a gen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ciengin kumpipa in tua laiziel a la dingin Jehudi sawl a, ama in zong thuvanpi pa Elishama’ innkhan panin a la hi; tuale Jehudi in kumpipa le ama’ gei-a a ding ulien teng mai-ah a sim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua laitahin kumpipa a phalbi inn sungah to a, (a hla kuona ahi hi) a mai-a meibung ah mei a kuong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Jehudi in khawh thum khawh li bang a sim zaw ciengin kumpipa in namta khat tawh tuate atsanin meibung sunga mei-ah hal a, tua laiziel buppi a kahvam dongin meikhuh sungah a paipai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hizongle kumpipa ahi a, tam kammal a za a nasemte ahi zongin koima khat beh patau tuon loin a puon uzong a balkeh beh sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Laiziel a hal lo nadingin Elnathan, Delaiah, le Gemariah-te nangawn in kumpipa a hlo vua, ama in a mang sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuale kumpipa in thuvanpi pa Baruch le Jeremiah-te man dingin kumpipa’ tapa Jerameel, Azriel’ tapa Seraiah le Abdeel’ tapa Shelemiah-te thu a pie hi. Ahi vangin Topa in ama gel a phuol hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua ciengin kumpipa in Jeremiah’ kamgen bangin Baruch in a giel tua laiziel, a kammalte tawh a haltum zaw ciengin Jeremiah kungah Topa’ thu a tung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Laiziel adang khat la inlen tua tungah Judah Kumpipa Jehoiakim haltumsa laiziel masa sunga thu zosie atkia in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuale Judah Kumpipa Jehoiakim tawh kisai-in tam bangin na gen ding hi: Tuale Topa in a genna ah, Babylon kumpipa ang pei tahtah ding a, tami gam susie-in mihing le ganhingte sumaimang ding hi, ci-in tami lai sungah bang ziehin giel na hei? ci-in na gen a, tua laiziel na haltum ngam giap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Kumpipa Jehoiakim tawh kisai-in Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Ama in David’ topha tungah a to ding mi koima khat beh a nei sih ding a, ama luonghawm sun lai-in nisa lah le zan lai-in vuasan lahah kipaimang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Keima in amau’ khielna ziehin ama le a suonlehlahte le a nasemte dan ka pie ding hi; keima in amate tung, Jerusalem-a tengte tung, le Judah mite tungah tunsah dinga ka galgih gimnate ka tungsah ding a, ahi vangin amate in ka thu a mang sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jeremiah in adang laiziel khat la a, Neriah’ tapa thuvanpi pa Baruch tungah Judah Kumpipa Jehoiakim in meikhuh sunga a haltumsa laiziel sunga Jeremiah’ sitsa banga a giel pen a pie hi; tuate sungah a kibang kammal tampi kiguonbe hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="37" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Babylon Kumpipa Nebuchadnezzar in Jehoiakim’ tapa Coniah’ zalaih dingin Judah gamah Josiah’ tapa Zedekiah kumpi semsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ahi vangin ama ahi a, a nasemte ahi a, gam sung mite ahi zongin, kamsangpa Jeremiah tung tawna Topa’ thugente a ngai sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kumpi Zedekiah in kamsangpa Jeremiah kungah Shelemiah’ tapa Jehucal le Maaseiah’ tapa siempu Zephaniah sawl a, “Kote adingin Topa ka Pasien uh kungah hepina tawh thu ei ngetpieh in,” cisah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua hunin Jeremiah thongkia nai lo ahi ziehin mite lahah sungtum pusuoh thei lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Khum hun laitahin Egypt panin Pharaoh’ galkapte kuonto zo uhi; tuale Jerusalem a busim Chaldea-te in amau’ thu a zah ciengun Jerusalem panin a kinuale uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ciengin kamsangpa Jeremiah kungah Topa’ thu tung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Israel’ Pasien, Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Kei kunga thu ang dongsah Judah kumpipa kungah, nang ang hu dinga ang pei Pharaoh’ galkapte amau’ gam Egypt ah a kilekia ding uhi, ci-in na ni gelin na va gen ta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuale Chaldea-te kilekia-in tam khuopi ang sim ding vua, tuaci’n amate in khuopi la-in mei tawh a hal ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa in tam bangin ci hi: “Eite kung panin Chaldea-te a taimang tahtah ding uhi,” ci-in noma le noma kisol sih un, azieh pen amate a taimang sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Note in ang sim Chaldea galkap bup zo siengin, a buh sung vua a liem teng beh suohtasah kha phiel nan locin, amate hing tho-in tam khuopi mei tawh ang halpieh veve ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pharaoh’ gakapte in a neh ziehin Jerusalem panin Chaldea’ galkapte a nuakin uh ciengin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Benjamin gama mipite lahah ama’ neisa a tanh ding teng a la dingin Jerusalem panin Jeremiah a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Benjamin’ Tunkot a tun ciengin Hananiah’ tapa Shelemiah, a tapa Irijah a kici tua sunga kot cingpa in kamsangpa Jeremiah na manin ama kungah, “Nang Chaldea-te lamah a taidap ding na hi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Jeremiah in, “Tua pen zuouthu ahi hi; Chaldea-te kungah ka taidap sih ding hi,” a ci hi. Ahi vangin Irijah in a thu gen ngai loin Jeremiah man a, uliente kungah a zawpi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Jeremiah tungah uliente a lungthah mama vua, tuale ama satin thuvanpi pa Jonathan’ inn sungah a khum uhi, a zieh pen khumi inn thonga kizang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua bangin tuikhuh inn sunga leinei dan sungah Jeremiah kikoi a, tua munah ni tampitah a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ciengin kumpi Zedekiah in ama hlansahin ama a kimupi hi. Kumpipa in a inn sungah thu dongdap a, tuale ama in, “ Topa tung panin thu khatpo a om ei mah?” ci hi. Jeremiah in, “ Om ma ei!” a ci hi. Tua ciengin ama in, “Nang pen Babylon kumpipa’ khut sungah ang kipie ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Jeremiah in zong kumpi Zedekiah kungah, “Kei thong nei khieh thei nadingin nang tung ahi a, na nasemte tung le tam mite tungah ahi zongin bang khielna ka bawl ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Note tungah, ‘Nang le tam gam sim dingin Babylon kumpipa ang kuon sih ding hi,’ ci-a thu ang gen na kamsangte uh hei-ah om uh ahei?’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka pu kumpipa, hepina tawh tu-in ka thugen ei ngaipieh in: Ka thum ka tauna ei ngaipieh dingin keima tungah hing hoi inlen, khum sunga a si dingin thuvanpi pa Jonathan’ inn ah ei puohkia malmal sin,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuaci’n Kumpipa Zedekiah in thupie a, amate in kumpi’ thong sungah Jeremiah a khum uhi; tuale khuopi sunga moh zosie a tawp masangin gawlzinga moh-emte tung panin ni sielin mo lumkhat ta ama kipie hi. Tuaci’n kumpi’ thong sungah Jeremiah a om suoh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="38" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tu-in Mattan’ tapa Shephatiah, Pashhur’ tapa Gedalaiah, Shelemiah’ tapa Jehucal, le Malchiah’ tapa Pashhur-te in Jeremiah in mi zosie tunga a gen thute a za vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa in a genna ah, tami khuopi sunga tengte namsau, kielpi, le pulnatna tawh a si ding uhi; hizongle Chaldea-te kunga a peite a hing ding uhi; amate in galvan lah bangin a nuntahna uh suotatpi-in a hing ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa in a genna ah, tami khuopi pen Babylon kumpipa’ galkapte khut sungah kipie valon ding a, kila ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ciengin uliente in kumpipa kungah, “Tam mipa tha dingin kilawm hi, azieh pen tam thute a gen ziehin ama in tami khuopi sunga a omlai galkapte le mi zosie a lungkiesah hi. Bangzieh ahei cile tam pa in tami mite’ phattuom nading sui loin a gim nga nading uh sui ahi zaw hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kumpi Zedekiah in, “Tanah ama a om hi; ama note’ khut sungah ama a om hi; azieh pen kumpipa in note ang langpang zo sih hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuaci’n amate in Jeremiah manin thong huong sunga om kumpipa’ tapa Malchiah’ tuikhuh sungah a paimang vua, khau huol tawh Jeremiah a khiesuh uhi. Tua tuikhuh sungah tui na om loin buon beh na om a, tuale buon lahah Jeremiah a tumsuh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amate in tuikhuh sungah Jeremiah a koi lam uh kumpipa’ inn sunga a om numeite a uh cilgesa pasal Ethiopia-te Ebed-melech in a za hi. Benjamin’ Tunkot ah kumpipa na to kha citciet hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuaci’n kumpipa’ inn panin Ebed-melech pei-in kumpipa hopi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Ka pu kumpipa aw, tam mite khuo sungah moh a op tah lo ziehin tuikhuh sungah a kielsi dingin kamsangpa Jeremiah khiesuhin ama tungah gitlona tawh a gamtatnate zosie uh pen a khiel uh ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ciengin kumpipa in Ethiopia-te Ebed-melech sawl a, “Tam sung panin mi thum zawpi inlen, kamsangpa Jeremiah a si masangin tuikhuh sung panin va kaito ta un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuaci’n Ebed-melech in a mite zawpi a, kumpipa’ inn ah pei-in vankholna inn sunga puon koina ah lutin tua sung panin puonah a ehsate le puon luite la-in Jeremiah’ opna tuikhuh sungah khau tawh a khiesuh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ciengin Ethiopia-te Ebed-melech in Jeremiah kungah, “Na zapbanei le khauhuolte kikalah puonsiete le puon-ah luite dap in,” a ci hi. Jeremiah in khum bangin a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ciengin amate in tuikhuh panin khauhuol tawh Jeremiah a kaito uhi. Tuale thong huong sungah Jeremiah a omsuoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kumpipa Zedekiah in kamsangpa Jeremiah thuta a, Topa’ biehinn sung lutna a thumna ah ama a kimupi hi. Kumpipa in Jeremiah kungah, “Thu khat kang dong ding hi; bangma ei im malmal sin,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Jeremiah in Zedekiah kungah, “Hing gen leng ei that lo ding na mah? Ngaisutna hing pie leng lah ngai ngap sih vateh,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuaci’n Kumpipa Zedekiah in Jeremiah kungah, “Eite hinna ei pie Topa a hing ahi ma bangin keima in nang kang that sih ding a, nang ang thasawm tam mite’ khut sungah zong kang pie sih ding hi,” ci-in a kiciemdap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jeremiah in Zedekiah kungah, “Israel’ Pasien, Vanglien Topa in ang genna-ah, Babylon kumpipa’ uliente kunga na lut leh beh ang kihinkhawi ding a, tam khuopi mei tawh kihal loin nangma le na innkuonpite na hing ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ahi vangin Babylon uliente kunga na lut sih leh Chalde-te’ khut sungah tam khuopi kipie ding a, amate in mei tawh halin nang zong amau’ khut sung panin na suohta sih ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kumpi Zedekiah in Jeremiah kungah, “Chaldea-te kunga a tai Judah-te ka giing hi, azieh pen a khut sung vuah ei kipie thei kha ding a, tuale amate in ei bawlsie ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Jeremiah in, “Tua bang pieng lo ding hi. Nangma kunga kang gen Topa’ thu mang phot lel in, tua hile nang adingin hoi ding a, ang kihinkhawi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahi vangin na lut nop vawt sih leh Topa in kei kunga ei lah mangmuna tami ahi hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Judah kumpipa’ inn sunga a kinuasie numei zosie Babylon kumpipa’ uliente kungah kipeipi-in tua numeite in, ‘Na lawm muonte in nang ang sol ta vua, ang zo ta uhi; tu-in buon lahah na keng tum ahi ziehin amate in ang taisan ta uhi,’ a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chaldea-te tungah na zite ule na tate zosie uh kipeipi ding a, amau’ khut sung panin nang mama zong na suohta sih ding hi. Babylon kumpipa in ang man ding hi; tuale tami khuopi mei tawh kihal ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua ciengin Zedekiah in Jeremiah kungah, “Tami i kiholimna koima dang theisah vawt sin, na theisah leh na si ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Uliente in nang kang hopi lam a zah khah vua, amate hing pei-in na kungah, ‘Kumpipa kunga na thugente hing gen in; bangma ei im sin, nei im leh kang that ding uhi. Kumpipa in nang kungah bang teng ang gen ei?’ ang ci uleh
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />amate kungah, ‘Jonathan inn ah a si den dinga ei sawlkia lo nadingin kumpipa kungah thumna lai a va pie ka hi bo hi,’ na ci ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Uliente zosie Jerusalem ah pei-in ama thu a dong uhi; tuale ama in kumpipa’ thuhil bang lien ma-in amate a dawng hi. Tuaci’n ka holimna uh a dapzah koima a op lo ziehun ei thudawh a khawl ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuale Jerusalem a kilah ni tan dongin Jeremiah thong huong sungah a omsuoh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="39" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Judah Kumpipa Zedekiah a kumpi suo zaw kum kuona a hla sawmna hla-in, Jerusalem sim dingin Babylon kumpipa Nebuchadnezzar le a galkap zosie kuonin Jerusalem a imtawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Zedekiah kumpi a suo zaw kum sawm le kum khat, a hla lina, a ni kuo ni-in khuopi’ kulpi kitovang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jerusalem khuopi a kilah ciengin Nergal-sharezer, Samgar-nebo, Rabsaris a kici Sarsechim, Rabmag a kici Nergal-sharezer-te a kipan Babylon kumpipa’ uliente zosie pei-in tunkot laita penah a to uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Judah Kumpipa Zedekiah le galkap zosie in amate a mu ciengun a taimang vua, zan lai-in kumpipa’ um peina lampi zui-in kul tegel kikala tunkot kantanin khuopi panin a pusuoh uhi; tuale amate Arabah lamah a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahi vangin Chaldea galkapte in amate a nuadel vua, Jericho zang lei-ah Zedekiah a pha uhi; tuale amate in ama a mat zaw ciengun Hamath gam sung Riblah khuo-a om Babylon Kumpipa Nebuchadnezzar kungah a peipi uhi; tuale ama tungah ama in thu a khen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Babylon kumpipa in Riblah khuo ah Zedekiah’ mitmu-in a tapate that hi; Babylon kumpipa in zong Judah uliente zosie that hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama in Zedekiah’ mittang kheipieh a, Babylon-a zawpi dingin siakhau tawh ama a hen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chaldea-te in kumpipa’ inn le mite’ inn a hal vua, Jerusalem kulpi a susie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ciengin kumpi cing galkapmangpa Nebuzaradan in khuopi sunga a kinuasie lai mite le ama bela a tai mite tawh, Babylon ah sal dingin a kai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kumpi cing galkapmangpa Nebuzaradan in Judah gam sungah bangma a nei lo mizawng pawlkhat nuasie a, ama in lengga um le lote amate a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Babylon kumpipa Nebuchadnezzar in Jeremiah tawh kisai-in kumpi cing galkapmangpa Nebuzaradan tungtawnin thu pie a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Ama ladawh inlen, hoitahin kemin genthei bawl sin, na kunga ang nget bangin na bawl in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuaci’n kumpi cing galkapmangpa Nebuzaradan, Rabsaris a kici Nebushazban, Rabmag a kici Nerga-lsharezer te le Babylon kumpipa’ uliente zosie in mi sawlin
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />thong huong sung panin Jeremiah a ladawh uhi. Amate in inn lama puohkia dingin Ahikam’ tapa Gedaliah a ap uhi. Tuaci’n a mipite tawh ama a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Thong huong sungah a kikhum laitahin Jeremiah kungah Topa’ thu a tung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pei inlen Ethiopia-te Ebed-melech kungah tam bangin va gen ta’n: Israel’ Pasien, Vanglien Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Tam khuopi hoi nading ahi lo, a siet nadinga ka gensa thute ka tungsah ding a, khumi ni ciengin na mai-ah tua thute ang tangtung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahi vangin khumi ni ciengin keima in nang kang hundam ding a, na giin mite tungah ang kipie sih ding hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile nang kang hundam valon ding a, namsau tawh si loin galvan lah bangin na hinna na suotahpi ding hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="40" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Babylon gamah saltang dingin Jerusalem le Judah gam sunga saltang zosiete tawh kol kibulin kumpi cing galkapmangpa Nebuzaradan in Ramah panin ama a peisah zaw ciengin Jeremiah kungah Topa’ thu a tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kumpi cing galkapmangpa in Jeremiah hlanin ama kungah, “ Topa na Pasien in tam munah tam gimna tunsah dingin ei galgih zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tu-in a thu mang loin Topa tungah maw zo na hi ziehun, Topa in tam thute tungsahin a gensa banga a bawl ahi hi. Tua ahi ziehin note tungah tam bang thu ang tung ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tu-in en in, na khuta ang kihenna siakhaute panin tuni-in nang kang hla zo ta hi. Babylon ah kei tawh nang pei nop leh hing pei in, tua hile keima in limtahin kang kem ding hi; ahi vangin Babylon ah keima tawh nang peiton nop sih leh lah hing pei da in. En in, gam zosie na mai-ah om hi; na pei nopna popo ah pei in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na op den dinga ahile Babylon kumpipa in Judah gam khuopi zosie ah a uhte dinga a koi Shaphan’ tapa, Ahikam, a tapa Gedaliah kungah kilekia inlen, ama tawh mite lahah teng in.; na ten nop sih leh lah na pei nopna popo ah kipei lel in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ciengin Ahikam’ tapa Gedaliah’ opna Mizpah ah Jeremiah pei a, ama tawh gam sunga kinuasie mite lahah a teng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Babylon kumpipa in gam uhpa dingin Ahikam’ tapa Gedaliah a koi thu le Babylon ah sala kipeipi lo pasalte, numeite, le gam sunga mizawng pente ama’ khutah a piehna thu, gam lahah a om galkapmangte le a galkap zosie in a zah ciengun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mizpah-a Gedaliah kungah amate a pei vua- Nethaniah’ tapa Ishmael, Kareah’ tapa Johanan, Tanhumeth’ tapa Seraiah, Netophah-te ahi Ephai’ tate ahi Maacath-te’ tapa Jezaniah-te le a galkapte a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Shaphan’ tapa Ahikam, a tapa Gedaliah in amate le a galkapte kungah kiciem a, “Chaldea-te’ na na sep ding uh pen zau tuon sih un. Gam sungah teng unlen, Babylon kumpipa’ na sem un, tua hile no adingin ang hoi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kei ka hi leh eite kunga ang pei ding Chaldea-te mai-ah note tanga a ding dingin Mizpah ah ka om ding hi; ahi vangin note na hi uleh lenggazu, khal singgate le sathaute khawmin na beel sung vuah koi unlen, na lahsa uh khuote ah teng un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ma bangin Moab gama a teng Judah mi zosie, Ammon mite lahah a tengte, Edom gama a tengte, le gam danga a omte in, Babylon kumpipa in Judah gamah a omlai mi pawlkhat nuasie a, tuate tungah gam uhpa dingin Shaphan’ tapa Ahikam, a tapa Gedaliah koi zo hi, ci thu a zah ciengun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Judah-te zosie a kithezahna uh gamcin teng panin Judah gam ah a kilekia vua, Judah gam, Mizpah-a Gedaliah kungah a pei uhi; tuale amate in lenggazu le khal singga kicing tahin a laton uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tu-in Kareah’ tapa Johanan le gam lahah galkapbute zosie Mizpah-a om Gedaliah kungah a pei vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />ama kungah, “Ammon kumpipa Baalis in nangma that dinga Nethaniah’ tapa Ishmael ang sawl lam a thei kha vawt lo na hi amah?” a ci uhi. Ahi vangin Ahikam’ tapa Gedaliah in amate a tahsang sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ciengin Kareah’ tapa Johanan in Mizpah-a om Gedaliah hopi dap a, “Nei hepina tawh ei peisah inlen, Nethaniah’ tapa Ishmael ei thatsah in, koima in thei lo ding hi. Nangma ang bel na kimvela om Judah mite zosie kithezahin a omlai Judah mi themkhatte zong a cigam nadingin bang dinga ama in nang ang tha laizang ding ahei?” ci-in a dap hopi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahi vangin Ahikam’ tapa Gedaliah in Kareah’ tapa Johanan kungah, “Tua bang silte bawl vet sin; bang ding ahei cile Ishmael tungtang zuouthu na gen hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="41" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A hla sagina hla-in kumpi sungkuon, kumpi vaisai a lienpen khat ahi, Elishama’ tapa Nethaniah, a tapa Ishmael in mi sawm tawh Mizpah khuo-a Ahikam’ tapa Gedaliah kungah a haw uhi. Amate in Mizpah ah an a nehton laitahun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Babylon kumpipa in tua gam sungah ama gam uhpa-in a koi ziehin Nethaniah’ tapa Ishmael le tua mi sawmte a dingto vua, Shaphan’ tapa Ahikam, a tapa Gedaliah-te namsau tawh satpua-in a that uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ishmael in Mizpah ah Gedaliah tawh a omton Judah mi zosie le tua sunga a om Chaldea galkapte zong that hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Gedaliah a kitha zaw a zing ni, koima in a thei masangin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Shechem, Shiloh le Samaria khuote panin mi sawmgiet, khamul heukieusa, puon ehkehsa le a pumpi uh kikui liemsa-in an tawh biehnate le panamtuite tawi-in Topa’ biehinn sungah biehna pie dingin a tung uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amate lamdot dingin Mizpah panin a kap kawmin Nethaniah’ tapa Ishmael a pei hi. Ama in amate a mu ciengin a kung vuah, “Ahikam’ tapa Gedaliah kungah hing pei un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khuopi laikimtah a tun ciengun Nethaniah’ tapa Ishmael le a optonpi mite in amate thatin tuikhuh sung khatah amate a paai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahi vangin amate lahah mi sawm in Ishmael kungah, “Ei that sih un, azieh pen lozau lahah ka na kholsa uh mangbu, mangbuham, sathau le khuoizu tampi ka nei uhi,” a ci uhi. Tuaci’n ama zong ki-ipin a guol honpi tawh amate that nawn lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ishmael in a thasa misi luonghawm zosie a paina tua tuikhuh pen a gol khat ahi a, tua khu Kumpipa Asa in Israel kumpipa Basha a nan nadinga a na bawl ahi hi; Nethaliah’ tapa Ishmael in a mithate tawh tua tuikhuh a dimsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ciengin Ishmael in kumpi cing galkapmangpa Nebuzradan in Ahakim’ tapa Gedaliah tungah a piehsa kumpipa’ tanute le Mizpah khuo-a a kinuasie mi zosie salin a man hi. Nethaniah’ tapa Ishmael in sal dingin Ammon gam lam zuonin amate a peipi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hizongle Nethaniah’ tapa Ishmael in a bawl a mawna huoisie teng Kareah’ tapa Johanan le a optonpi galkapmang zosie in a zah bepun
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />a mite zosie zawpi-in Nethaniah’ tapa Ishmael sim dingin a kuon uhi. Amate in Gibeon muna tuikhuh golpi ah a pha uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ishmael kunga om mi zosie in Kareah’ tapa Johanan le galkapmang zosie a mu ciengun a nuom mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuaci’n Ishmael in Mizpah panin sal dinga a mat mi zosie kinuahei-in Kareah’ tapa Johanan kungah a peikia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahi vangin Johanan kung panin Nethaniah’ tapa Ishmael le mihing giet suohta-in Ammon-te kungah a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ciengin Kareah’ tapa Johanan le a optonpi galkapmang zosie in, Nethaniah’ tapa Ishmael in Ahikam’ tapa Gedaliah a na tha zaw ciengin Mizpah panin sal dinga a kaisa mite lahah amawh teng zosie - galkapte, nupite, naupangte, le numeite a uh cilgesa pasalte a unpi-in Gibeon panin a peipikia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Egypt gam lam pei sawmin amate a dingkhie vua, Bethlehem khuo gei-a Geruth Chimham kici munah a khawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Azieh pen Nethaniah’ tapa Ishmael in gam uhpa dinga Babylon kumpipa in a koi Ahikam’ tapa Gedaliah a tha ziehin amate in Chaldea-te a giing mama uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="42" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin galkapmangte zosie, Kareah’ tapa Johanan, Hoshaiah’ tapa Azariah, le a neupen pan a golpen dongin mi zosie in ama lam a neh vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />kamsangpa Jeremiah kungah, “Hepina tawh kote thumna ei ngai inlen, ko a omlaite adingin Topa na Pasien kungah thu ei ngetpieh in. Bangzieh ahei cile na mit tawh nei mu bangin mi tampi lah panin themno khat beh ei kinuasie ta bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa na Pasien in ka pei nading uh hileh ka bawl ding uh hileh ei lahsah in,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kamsangpa Jeremiah in amate kungah, “Hoi mama hi: Na nget bangun Topa na Pasien uh kungah thu ka ngen ding a, note tungah Topa ei dawnna bangbang kang gen ding hi; bangma kang im malmal sih ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amate in a banbanin Jeremiah kungah, “ Topa na Pasien in na kungah ko dinga ang gen thu zosie bangin ka gamtat sih tah ma uleh kote langkhatah a man le a muontah teci-in Topa hing pang taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Topa i Pasieh uh thugen ka man ciengun kote ka hoi thei nadingun, nang kang sawlna uh Topa i Pasien uh’ thugen bangbang hoi taleh sie taleh ka mang ding uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ni sawm zaw ciengin Jeremiah kungah Topa’ thu a tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in Kareah’ tapa Johanan le ama kunga om galkapmang teng zosie, le mi zosie a neupen panin a golpen dongin hlan a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />amate kungah, “Ama mai-ah na deina uh thumpieh dinga nei sawlna pa uh Israel’ Pasien Topa in tam bangin ci hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tam gama na op suoh uleh beh note hing phelkhie loin kang lam ding hi; keima in note kang phutdet ding a, kang botzuon sih ding hi; azieh pen note tungah gimna kang tunsah ziehin ka kisia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ni dang na giin bangun Babylon kumpipa giing ta sih un; Topa in a cina-ah, ama giing sih un, azieh pen ama’ khut sung panin ang hundam ding le ang hunkhie dingin note tawh kang omton hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Keima in note kang hepi ding a, ama in note tungah hepina nei-in na pienna uh na gam ma vuah ang tengsahkia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahi vangin note in tam bangin Topa na Pasien uh’ thu mang loin, ‘Tami gamah teng sih va ung,’ na ci suoh vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />‘Hi lo hi, gal a op lona, pengkul gin a kizah lona, an du gilkiel lona Egypt gamah pei-in tua munah ka teng ding uhi,’ na ci uleh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Judah a omlai teng aw, Topa’ kammal ngai un. Israel’ Pasien, Vanglien Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Egypt gamah pei-in tua sunga ten ding na sawm paupau uleh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />na giin uh namsau in Egypt gamah note ang pha ding a, na giin uh kielpi in Egypt gamah note ang nuadel ding hi; tua munah note na si ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Egypt gamah a teng dinga a pei sawm paupau mi zosie a unpi-un namsau, kielpi, le pulnatna tawh si ding uhi; amate tunga ka tunsah ding gimna panin a omlai mite ahi sihle a suohta mite koima a om sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Bangzieh ahei cile Israel’ Pasien, Vanglien Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Jerusalem khuo-a a teng mite tungah ka lungthahna le ka lunghanna ka sun bangin Egypt gamah na pei uleh ka lungthahna na tung vuah hing kisung ding hi. Note pen mite’ lipkhap le kidah, hamsiet le zako-in na om ding uhi. Note in tam mun na mukia nawn sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Judah a omlai teng aw, Topa in note kungah, Egypt gamah pei sih un, ci-in ang gen zo hi. Tuni-a na tung vua kang hil thute teltahin kithei ta un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Note in a siehuoi khielna na bawl zo ta uhi. Azieh pen Topa na Pasien uh kungah nei sawl vua, ‘ Topa i Pasien uh kungah thu ei ngetpieh inlen, Topa ka Pasien un ang gen popo ko kungah ei gen inlen, kote in ka sem ding uhi,’ nei ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuaci’n tuni-in na kung vuah kang gen zo ta hi, ahi vangin Topa na Pasien un na kung vua gen dinga ei sawl thu khat beh na mang sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua ciengin note in teltahin kithei ta un, na ten nopna mun vuah namsau, kielpi, le pulnatna tawh na si ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="43" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa a Pasien un amate kungah gen dinga a sawl Topa a Pasien uh’ thute zosie Jeremiah in mi zosie tungah a gen zaw ciengin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hoshaiah’ tapa Azariah le Kareah’ tapa Johanan a kipan mi kiphasah dangte zosie in Jeremiah kungah, “Na zuou zuoupi na gen ahi bo hi. Topa i Pasien in, ‘Egypt gama a teng dingin pei sih un,’ ci-in a gen dingin nang ang sawl kha sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hizongle Neriah’ tapa Baruch in Chaldea mite kungah kote ei pie-in, amate in kote ei thatin, ahi sihle Babylon gamah sala ei kai thei nadingin kote langpang dinga nang ang hantawh ahi bo hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuaci’n Kareah’ tapa Johanan le galkapmang zosie a kipan mi zosie in Judah gama op suoh ding Topa’ thugen a mang sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahi vangin Kareah’ tapa Johanan le galkapmang zosie in a kidelmangna uh gam zosie panin Judah gama teng dinga a kilekia Judah a omlai teng zosie a peipi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Papi, nupi, naupang, kumpipa’ tanute, le kumpi cing galkapmang Nebuzaradan in Shaphan’ tapa Ahikam, a tapa Gedaliah tawh a na nuasie mi zosie le kamsangpa Jeremiah le Neriah’ tapa Baruch-te zong a peipi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa’ thu a man lo ziehun Egypt gamah pei-in Tahpanhes a tung uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ciengin Tahpanhes-a om Jeremiah kungah Topa’ thu a tung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na khut tawh suongtum golte la inlen, Tahpanhes-a Pharaoh kumpi inn lutna tungman suongpha nei-ah phum in. Na phum lam Judah mite musah inlen,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />amate kungah, Vanglien Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Keima in mi sawlin ka nasempa Babylon Kumpi Nebuchadnezzar kang peipi ding a, ama in tam ka suongphumte tungah a kumpi topha daw-in tuate tungah a kumpi puonbuh a zah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama kuonin Egypt gam sim ding a, pul natna tawh si dinga sesate pul natna tawh sisah ding a, sala mat dinga sesate salin kikai sahin, namsau tawh si dinga sesate zong namsau tawh a si ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama in Egypt pasien-te kibiehna biehinnte sungah mei taw-in, tua teng hal tumin salin a peipi ding hi; tuale tuucingpa in a puon tunga khate a sot sieng bangin ama in Egypt gam sung a siengsah ding hi; tuale lungmuong tahin tua panin ama a pei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama in Egypt gam Heliopolis khuo-a suong milim khuomte phelmang ding a, Egypt pasien-te’ biehinnte haltum ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="44" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Egypt gam sunga Migdol, Tahpanhes, Memphis, le Pathros gam sunga teng Judea-te zosie tawh kisai-in Jeremiah kungah thu tung a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel’ Pasien, Vanglien Topa in tam bangin ci hi: No mama in Jerusalem le Judah khuo zosie tunga ka tunsah gimna na mu zo ta uhi. Amate en un; tuni-in tua khuote ah koima teng loin gamdai a suoh ta hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />azieh pen amate in ahi a, note in na hi vua, na pu na pate un ahi zongin a thei ngai lo uh pasien-te’ na semin a kung vuah biehnate tawi-in gitlona a bawl ziehun keima ei thangpaisah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hinanle keima in ka nasem kamsang zosie na kung vuah kang sawl a, “Ka huot tami a kidahhuoi nate bawl nawn sih un!” ci-in kang thumsah ngitnget hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hizongle amate in ka thu ngai nuom loin a bil uh ei daw sih vua, a gitlona uh panin kiheikia nuom loin pasien dangte kungah biehnate a tawi veve uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Judah khuopite le Jerusalem gawldung tengah ka thangpaina le ka lungthahna kibuosuhin a kuong hi; tuale tuni-a om bangin tuate kinuasie-in gamdai a suoh ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuale tu-in Israel’ Pasien, Vanglien Topa in tam bangin a gen hi: Bang dinga numei, pasal, naupang le nausente dongin, a omlai om nawn loin Judah laikim panin suhmaimang nading za-in na tung vuah sietna lienpi kitun na hi uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bang dinga na ten nading vua na zot uh Egypt gamah na khut utawh na bawlsa uh pasien dangte kungah biehnate tawi-in ei lungthahsah na hi uh ahei? Note kisumaimangin leitunga minamte lahah simmaw le samsiet suoh ding na hi uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Judah gam le Jerusalem gawldung lahah na pu na pa te uh’ gitlona, Judah kumpite’ gitlona, amau’ zite gitlona, noma’ gitlona, le noma’ zite gitlonate na mangngil ta uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuni dongin amate in kisiakiana lungtang ahi a, zauna lungtang ahi zongin nei loin, note le na pu na pate uh mai-a kang pieh ka thukham le ka ngainate a zui sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Israel’ Pasien, Vanglien Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Keima in Judah gam zosie ka suhmaimang thei nadingin note tunga gimna tunsah ding ka khensat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Keima in Egypt gamah pei-in ten ding a sawm Judah a omlai teng manin a unpi-un a si sieng ding uhi; amate Egypt gamah namsau tawh pua-in kielpi tawh a si ding uhi; amate a neupen panin a golpen dongin namsau le kielpi tawh a si sieng ding vua, mite’ lipkhap le kidah, hamsiet le zako-in a om ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Keima in Jerusalem dan ka pieh bangin Egypt gama a tengte zong namsau, kielpi, le pul natna tawh dan ka pie ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Egypt gama a tengsa Judah mi a omlai teng Judah gama a nuapei kia dingin khat zong a hingin a suohta sih ding uhi. Amate tuanah kilekia-in a ten nopkia vangun galtai pawlkhat simlo a kinuale nawn sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ciengin a zite un pasien dangte kungah biehnate a tawi lam uh a thei papi zosie, khum sunga a ding nupi zosie, mipi honkhat, Egypt gam Pathros-a a teng mi zosie in Jeremiah a dawngkia vua:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“ Topa’ min tawh ka kung vua nang gen thute kote in kang ngaipieh sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kote in bawl dinga ka ciemsa uh sil bangkim ka bawl ding vua, Judah gam khuopite le Jerusalem lampi tengah koma le ka pu ka pate uh, ka kumpite ule ka uliente un a na bawl ngai uh bangin vantung kumpinu kungah biehnate tawi-in dawn thei biehnate ka sung zaw ding uhi. Kote in a kinincing neh le tah nei-in ka nuomsa vua, hamsietna zong ka tuoh sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ahi vangin vantung kumpinu kungah biehnate le dawn thei biehnate sunna ka bawl lo vua kipanin bangkim ka kitasam vua, namsau le kielpi-in ka sigam ta uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuale nupite in zong, “Kote in vantung kumpinu tungah biehnate tawina le dawn thei biehna sunna ka bawl suoh ding uhi; kote in ama nu’ lim sun dingin moh bawlin a kungah dawn thei biehna ka sun uh ciengin ka pasalte uh kihal loin a bawl nei sa uh amah?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jeremiah in khum banga a dawngkia papi, nupi a kipanin mi zosie kungah tam bangin a gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Judah khuopite le Jerusalem gawldung lahah note le na pu na pate uh, na kumpite uh, na uliente vua kipanin gam sung mi zosie in biehna na bawlte uh Topa in a phawh kha lo ahi amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Na sil hoi lo bawlte ule na sil kidahhuoi bawlte uh Topa in thuoh zo nawn lo hi; tua ahi ziehin tuni-a bangin na gam uh koima teng loin gamdai suoh zo ta a, mite’ hamsiet thuohin a kinuasie ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Note in biehnate halin, Topa’ tungah maw-in, Topa’ thu mang loin ama’ thukhamte le a ngainate na zui lo ziehun, tuni donga a om bangin note tungah tam gimnate ang tung ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Jeremiah in mi zosie le numeite kungah, “Egypt gama a om no Judah mi zosiete aw, Topa’ kammal ngai un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Israel’ Pasien, Vanglien Topa in tam bangin ci hi: ‘Vantung kumpinu kungah biehnate a tawi ding le dawn thei biehnate a sung dinga ka kiciemnate uh ka bawl teitei ding uhi,’ ci-a na gen uh pen noma le na zite un kam tawh a na gen bangun sepna tawh na muolsuo zo ta uhi. Na kiciemna uh kipsah unlen na dawn thei biehnate uzong sung phot un!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Egypt gama a teng no Judah mi zosiete aw, Topa’ kammal ngai un: En un, ‘ Topa in kang cina-ah, Egypt gam mun zosie-a a teng Judah mi khat beh in a kam uh panin, ‘ Topa a hing ahi ma bangin,’ ci-in ka min a law nawn lo nadingun ka min lienpi tawh ka kiciem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Keima in amate hoi nading ahi lo, a siet nadingun ka buh gige hi; Egypt gama a teng Judah mi zosie a cigam masangsie namsau le kielpi tawh kisusie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Namsau pana a suohta mi themno khatte Egypt gam panin Judah gamah kilekia ding uhi; tuale Egypt gama a teng dinga a pei Judah mi a omlai teng in keima’ thugen le amau’ thugen koi kip zaw, ahei ci a thei ding uhi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tami munah note dan hing pie-in note siet nading ka gensa thute ang tangtung valon ding a hina thu na thei nadingun Topa in a genna-ah, tami khu note tungah lim ahi ding hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Topa in a cina-ah, keima in ama a thasawm a galte’ khut sungah Judah kumpipa Zedekiah ka pieh bangin Egypt kumpipa Pharaoh Hophra, ama a thasawm a galpa Babylon kumpipa Nebuchadnezzar’ khut sungah ka pie ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="45" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Judah kumpipa Josiah’ tapa Jehoiakim kumpi a suo zaw a kum lina kumin, kamsangpa Jeremiah in Neriah’ tapa Baruch hopi a, tuale ama in Jeremiah’ sit bangbanga laiziel sunga a na giel kammalte tam bang teng ahi hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Baruch aw, Israel’ Pasien, Vanglien Topa in nangma kungah tam bangin ci hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nangma in, “Gim nga hi tang e! Topa in ka natna banah dana ei belap pieh hi; ka tautauna-in ka vulgawp ta a, toidamna ka mu zo sih hi,” na ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin nangma in ama kunga na gen ding ah, “ Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Keima in ka lamsate phelkia-in ka phusate ka botmang kia ding hi- tua khu gam buppi ka cina ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nangma dinga na lienpi sui na hi amah? Tuate sui da in; bangzieh ahei cile keima in mi zosie tungah gimna ka tungsah ding hi, Topa in ci hi; hizongle nang pen na peina muncin tengah galvan lah bangin na hinna kang pie ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="46" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Minamte tawh kisai-in kamsangpa Jeremiah kunga a tung Topa’ kammal tami ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Judah Kumpipa Josiah’ tapa Jehoiakim in kumpi a sep zaw a kum lina kumin Babylon kumpipa Nebuchadnezzar in a na zawsa, Euphrates gun gei Carchemish khuo-a om Egypt kumpi Pharaoh Neco’ galkapte tawh kisai tam bang ahi hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Phaw le lumte tawh kithawi unlen, gal sim dingin kuon un!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Sakol phaw guong unlen, tuong dawh ta un! Na sia lukhute uh khu unlen, panmun la un. Na teipi uh tat hiem unlen, na sia puonte sil un!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bang a cile a zausa-a amate ka va mu tah mawh ahei? Amate a kilekia ta uhi; a galhangte uh kisatlia a, a naw taimang ta uhi. Amate a kinuahei sih uhi. Muncin tengah zauna behbeh! Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A mallangte zong a taiman sih vua, galhangte a suohta tuom sih uhi; sahlam Euphrates gun gei-ah amate kipalin a pua uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nile gun banga ang khang, guntui khanglien bang khu koi ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nile gun bangin Egypt khang a, guntui phulto bang hi. Ama in, kei ei khangsah inlen, leitung zosie ei tuomsah in. Khuopite le a sunga tengte zosie ei susiesah in, a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Sakolte aw, mai nawt un, sakol leengte aw, kikhaw vapo un! Galhangte ahi: Ethiopia le Put mi lum tawite, thal kamsa-a om Ludim mite kuonsah un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Khum ni pen Vanglien Topa’ ni ahi a, phu a kilahkia ni, a galte tung panin dih tanna a nga ni ahi hi. Namsau in amate valtum ding a, a du ta sih ding hi. A kham dongin a si uh a dawn ding hi. Bang ding ahei cile Vanglien Topa in Euphrates gun gei sah lamah kithoina khat a nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Egypt ngahnu siengtho aw, Gilead ah peito inlen, damna zatui va la ta’n! A mawhna-in zatui tampi na zang zo hi; nang adingin damna om tuon lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Minamte in na zumhuoina uh a za vua, leitungah na kaana aw uh a kidim hi; azieh pen galhang le galhang kiphukha-in, a ni gelin a puaton uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Egypt gam sim dingin Babylon kumpipa Nebuchadnezzar peina tawh kisai-in Topa in Jeremiah kunga a gen thu tam bang ahi hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Egypt gamah genzah inlen, Migdol khuo ah phuongzah in; Memphis khuo le Tahpanhes khuo ah tangko in; “Na kimvel vua om mite namsau in valh ahi ziehin, na panmun uh la unlen a kigingsa-in om un,” va ci ta’n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Bang dingin Apis taimang ahei? Na bawngtang pasien uh bang dinga ding lo ahei? Bangzieh ahei cile Topa in ama a sawnpua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na mihonpite uh kipalin a pua sieng vua, “Ei susie namsau ziehin, hing pei un, i mipite kung le i pienna gamah kinualekia vai,” khatlekhat a kici uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Egypt kumpipa, Pharaoh khu “Mi kam tam, a hun hoi teng a tan pa,” ci-in min pie un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A min Vanglien Topa kici, Kumpipa in a genna-ah, keima a nungta ka hi ma bangin, muolte lahah Tabor muol bang le tuipi gei-a Carmel muol bangin mi khat ang pei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A nop khan Egypt tanu aw, sal tang dingin na puonlomte zielsa-in koi in! Azieh pen Memphis kinuasie ding a, a teng om loin kisie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Egypt gam khu bawngla melhoi bang a, leilu lam gam panin cippi khat ama tungah a tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A galkap guoite nangawn zong bawngno thaute bang uhi; amate tungah tuosietna ni le dan piehna hunte a tun ziehin amate in a sim tentun sih vua, kihei-in a taiton uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Sing phuate bangin tua nu sim dingin hei tawh a galte a honpi-in a kuon ziehin tua nu in gul kithol ging bangin a aw a gingsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Gam a pha sengin kiphu zo sih zong le a gam mangte uh a phua ding uhi, Topa in ci hi. Bangzieh ahei cile amate kauphe sangin a tamzaw vua, sim zawh ding ahi sih hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Egypt’ tanu kimaizumsah ding hi; leilu lam pana ang peite’ khut sungah tua nu kipie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Israel’ Pasien, Vanglien Topa in tam bangin ci hi: En in, keima in Thebes khuo-a Amon pasien le Pharaoh, Egypt le a pasien-te ule a kumpite uh, Pharaoh tung le ama tunga kinga teng tungah gimna ka tungsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Amate a tha sawm Babylon Kumpipa Nebuchadnezzar le a uliente’ khut sungah amate ka pie ding hi. Tua zaw ciengin tanglai hun ma bangin Egypt gamah mi tengkia ding hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hinanle ka nasempa Jacob aw, zau malmal sin, Israel aw, lungkie malmal sin; azieh pen a gamlapi panin kang hundam ding a, na suonlehlahte uh a saltanna gam panin ka hundam ding hi. Jacob kilekia-in siptah le nuomtahin om ding a, koima in ama a zausah nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ka nasempa Jacob aw, zau malmal sin. azieh pen keima in nang kang ompi hi. Amate lahah kang nawdawhna gam zosie ka sumang ding a, ahi vangin nang kang sumaimang sih ding hi! A kituoh bep khatin thu kang hil ding a, dan pieh loin lah kang mawh koi sih ding hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="47" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pharaoh in Gaza khuo a sim masangin Philistia-te tawh kisai kamsangpa Jeremiah kungah Topa’ thu a tung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa in tam bangin ci hi: En un, leilu lam panin tui ang khang a, ang letin ang luong ding hi; amate in gam sung le a sunga om zosie hlummang ding a, khuopi le a sunga tengte zosie zong hlummang ding hi. Mite a kap ding vua, gam sunga teng zosie a mau ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama’ sakol ketot gingte, ama’ sakol leeng gingte le ama’ lengkang kigawi gingte ziehin, a khutte uh zawgawpin nu le pate in a tate uh a donzo ta sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua Philistia mi zosie a kisuhgam ding ni ang tun ding zieh le, Tyre le Sidon khuo-a om mi hu thei zosie suhmaimang nading ni ang tun zieh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Gaza khuo in a lu met tol a, Ashkelon khuo mangthai zo hi. A omlai amau’ vanglietna aw, bang tanvei noma le noma kisuliem ding na hi uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kadei, Topa’ namsau! Nang bang tanvei sip ding na hei? Na pai sungah kihengkia inlen, khawl inlen sip dide in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa in thu a pieh ciengin tua khu bangci sip thei ding ahei? Ashkelon khuo le tuipi gei teng sim dingin ama in a sesa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="48" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Moab Tungtang Thu. Israel’ Pasien, Vanglien Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Nebo khuo khu da huoi sam e. A hawmkieu-a kikoi hi ta! Kiriathaim khuo kizumsah a, kilamang zo ta hi; khuo kulpi kizumsi sahin, suhsiet ahi zo ta hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Moab gam’ minthanna a om ta sih hi. Heshbon khuo ah amate in a siet nading a lunggel uhi: “Hing pei un, minam khat a hina uh suhmang pieh vawi!” a ci uhi. Madmen khuo aw, nang zong suhdai na hi ta ding hi; namsau in nang ang nuadel ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ngawi vawi un! Horonaim khuo pana kikona aw, “Gawgamna le sietna lienpi!” kici hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Moab gam kisusie zo a, a naupangte a kap uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Azieh pen Luhith muol katona lampi-ah a peito kawmun amate nahpi-in a kap uhi. Azieh pen Honaraim khuo zotsuhna lampi-ah amate in manthai kikona aw a za uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tai un! No le no kihundam un! Senel gam sunga gam- laa tai bangin taimang ta un!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A tahtahin na mun muonhuoite le na goute na suon ziehin, nang zong ang kikaimang ding hi; a siempute le a tuonvaite tawh saltang dingin Chemosh a pei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Khuopi zosie-ah mi sumang pa ang pei ding a, khuopi khat zong suohta lo ding hi; Topa gensa bangin muolkuomte mangthai ding a, zangleite kisusie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Moab adingin ci tuomkoi pieh un, azieh pen ama a kisie valon ding ahi hi; a khuopite hawmsuoh ding a, a sungah koima teng lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thasie kawma Topa’ na a sempa in samsiet thuoh taheh; sisan suohsah lo a, a namsau a nuakoi kia pa in samsiet thuoh taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Moab a neu lai panin nuom khan a, zutee tunga a om zuning bangin a om hit hiet hi; zubeel khat panin zubeel khatah kihlei loin, salin zong kikai lo hi; tua ahi ziehin a tui ngai-in tui a, a gimnam zong a theng thei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Topa in a ci na-ah, Moab mite zubeel sunga sun bangin a sung ding mi kang sawl hun ang tung valon ding a, amate in ama’ beelte hawmsahin ama’ tuibeelte a tawkeh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ciengin Israel innkuonte in a kinepna uh Bethel a zumpi bangun Moab in Chemosh zumpi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Ko galhangte le galsim hatte ka hi uhi,” bang dinga note in na ci thei uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Moab-a khuopite susie ding pa ang peito ta hi, a tangval deiteel tuomte uh gawlup dingin pei zo ta uhi, Vanglien Topa a kici, Kumpipa in gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Moab’ tuosietna ding nai zo ta a, a kisietna in mallangin a zuon hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />No a innveng zosie le a min a thei zosie in ama kaa pipi tave un; “ Vanglien kumpi ciengkhut le minthang ciengkhut bang dinga tawng ta mawh a!” ci un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Dibon khuo-a teng a tanu aw, na vanglietna pan kumsuh inlen, tuolgum ah to in! Azieh pen nang ang do dingin Moab susie pa peito ta hi; na kulpite zong susie zo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />No Aroer-a tengte aw, lam gei-ah dingin na en un! A taimang pasal le a suohta numei nu dong un; “Bang thu a om ei?” ci-in dong un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Moab kimaizumsah hi, azieh pen ama kisusie zo hi; kapin mau-in om un! Moab a kisuhsietna thu Arnon gun dungah va gen ta un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Muoltung zanglei gam teng le Holon, Jahzah, Mephaath,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Dibon, Nebo, Beth-diblathaim,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kiriathaim, Beth-gamul, Beth-meon,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Kerioth, Bozrah, le Moab gam sunga a gamla a nai-a om khuopi zosie tungah thukhenna a tung zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Moab’ ki kisattawng a, a bante zong kitawngsah ta hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Moab zu khamsah un, bang ding ahei cile Topa langpangin ama le ama kiliensah hi; a luoh lahah kibuolsah un; ama zong mite’ nuisatin a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Gutate lahah a kimat khah sih vangin nang adingin Israel khu nuizathuoi khat a suoh hi; ama na hopi sielin na lu na peisansan mawh hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Moab gama tengte aw, khuopite nuasie unlen, suong lahah teng un! Keen kawm lahah a om vakhu butom bang un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Moab’ kiphatsahna ka za zo ta vua, ama a kinah phatsah mama hi. Ama’ kilietsahna, a kiphatsahna, a kihisahna, a lungkula a kisahthei dan teng ka za zo ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ama’ thangpaina kei mama in ka thei a, a kisielnate zuoupi ahi a, a sil bawlte zong zuoupi ma ahi hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tua ziehin Moab adingin ka mau ding hi; Moab-te zosie adingin ka kap ding hi; Kir-heres khuo adingin ka kap ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Sibmah lenggui aw, Jazar ading sangin nangma adingin ka nah kaazaw hi. Na bamengte tuipi kansanin zam suoh a, Jazar tuipi dongin a zam hi; na khal singgate le na lenggate tungah a susie pa ang tungta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Moab leihoi gam panin nuomna le kipahna kilamang zo ta hi; keima in lengga cilna panin lenggatui ka kangsah dawh ta hi; koima in kipahna awging tawh a cilkia ta sih vua, tua awging khu kipahna awging ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Heshbon khuo le Elealeh khuote kap a, Jahaz cieng dong, le Zoar panin Horonaim le Eglath-shelishiah dongah amau’ kaana aw a ging hi. Azieh pen Nimrim tui nangawn a kang zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tuale keima in Moab gam muol sang tungah kithoina nei a, a pasien-te kungah biehnate a tawi mite ka khawlsah ding hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Moab adingin theile kitum bangin ka lungsim a mau a, Kir-heres mite adingin theile kimut bangin ka lungsim a mau hi; azieh pen a nei a lamte uh mangthai zo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Bang ding ahei cile lu zosie kimettol a, khamul zosie kimetmai hi; khut zosie atliem ahi ta a, kawngte ah la-ip puon a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Moab gam innkhum zosie le khuolai tuol-awng zosie ah kaana simlo bangma dang om lo hi; azieh pen keima in koima’ dei lo beel khat ka suhkeh bangin Moab gam ka sukeh hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Moab gam a kisie lah ahi ta’n! Amate nah kaa sam uh e! A maizumin Moab in ei elngat vawt ta khu la! Tuaci’n Moab khu a innveng zosie’ nuisat le lipkhap ahi ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Azieh pen Topa in tam bangin ci hi: En in, ama in muvanlai bangin a hla zahin, Moab bawhsuh ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />a khuopite kila-in a mun muonhuoite ki-imtawm hi. Khum ni ciengin nupi nau suoh bangin Moab galhangte’ lungsim in na a sa ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Ama in Topa langpangin ama le ama kiliensah ahi ziehin, Moab kisusie ding a, minam khatin a dingkia zo nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Moab gama tengte aw, na masang vuah zauna, dum le thangte om hi! Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />A zau-a taite poma dum sungah kiesuh ding a, dum sung pana a katote poma thangah a awh ding uhi. Bang ding ahei cile a dan thuoh ding uh kumin Moab tungah tam thute ka tungsah ding hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Heshbon hlim ah a basam galtaite a khawl uhi; azieh pen Heshbon panin mei khat ang kuong a, Sihon inn panin meikuong khat ang pusuoh to hi; tuami in Moab’ talpang le a gamlum mite’ luvunte a katum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Moab aw, gimna na thuoh ding hi! Chemosh mite kisusie zo ta hi, azieh pen na tapate uh salin kiman zo a, na tanute uh salin kipeipi zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Hinanle ni nukhia ciengin Moab a gam ka piekia ding hi, Topa in ci hi. Moab tunga thukhenna tam cieng ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="49" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ammon-te Tungtang thu. Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Israel in tapate nei lo amah? Ama in innluo ding nei lo amah? Tua ahile bang dingin Milcom in Gad gam la-in, a khuopite sungah a mite teng uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Ammon-te’ khuopi Rabbah sim nading galdo patauna aw ka ginsah hun ang tung valon ding hi, Topa in ci hi; tua khuopi a kisie muol gawta suohin, a khuotate mei tawh kihaltum ding hi; tua ciengin Israel in a gam a suon mite ama in a suonkia ding hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hesbon khuo aw, da-in mau in, a zieh pen Ai suhsietin om ta! Rabbah tanute aw, kap un! La-ip puon silin kap unlen, ciengpum tawh kisunliem un! Azieh pen a siempute le a tuonvaite tawh Milcom salin kipeipi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bang dingin na hatna uh kisahtheipi na hi uh ahei? Na hatna uh a kiemsuh ding ahi hi. Upna nei lo tanu aw, nang in na haunate suongin, “Koi in kei ei sim ding ahei?” na ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Keima in na veng zosie tung panin na tungah zauna kang tungsah ding hi, Vanglien Topa in ci hi. Note kithezah gawpin na tuotuona vuah na tai ding vua, galtaite a kaikhawm ding koima a om sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahi vangin khum nua ciengin Ammon-te a gam uh ka piekia ding hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Edom Tungtang Thu. Vanglien Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Teman gamah pilna a om nawn sih amah? Mi pilvangte kung panin thukupna a tawp ta amah? Amau’ pilna a maimang sieng ta amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Dedan gama tengte aw, kinuahei-in tai unlen, a thuhna munah kumsuh un! Bangzieh ahei cile, ama dan ka pieh hun ciengin Esau tungah tuosietna ka tungsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lengga khawmte na kungah hing pei uleh amate in a sanghte nuasie lo ding uh amah? Zan lai-in gutate hing pei uleh amate nangawn in a dei teng beh la ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahi vangin kei in ka hile Esau a puon hawhdawhin a guohtangin ka omsah a, a kiphuolna munte ka phele a, ama a kiphuol thei ta sih hi. A tate, a sanggamte le a innvengte kisusie a, ama om nawn lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na tagate uh nuasie un, keima in kemin ka hinsuo ding hi; na meigongte un zong keima ei muong uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Azieh pen Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Dan tuoh dinga kilawm lote in dantawhna hai a dawn lo uh phamaw lai ding ahile, nang zong dan tuoh loin na om thei ding amah? Dan tuoh loin na om sih ding a, tua hai na dawn lo phamaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Bang ding ahei cile kei le kei ka kiciem a, Bozrah pen mite’ lipkhap le zapi ding, nuasie ding le samsietna-a zah ding hi ding a, a khuopi zosie uzong hawmsuoh zing ding hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Topa kung panin thupha ka za a, minamte lahah kamtai khat kisawl zo hi: “No le no kikaikhawmin ama sim dingin hing pei unlen, gal sim dingin kisa un! a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Azieh pen minamte lahah a neu penin kang bawl ding a, mite in kang simmaw sah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Suong keen kawmah tengin muolsang dawnah a busa pa aw, mi’ giin dinga na opna le na kisahtheina in nang ang sol lawm ta hi. Muvanlai bangin a sangpi ah bu bawl nan lacin tua panin kang khiesuh veve ding hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Edom gam pen a cimulthaw huoi khat suoh ding a, ama kunga pei zosie a cimul uh tho-in, a gimna teng uh ziehin a ehneh ho ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Sodom, Gomorrah le a kimvela khuote a kisuhsiet lai bangin tua munah koima teng loin, a sungah koima in khuomkhaw lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lonona munah a om tuute ka delmang ding a, Jordan hamphul lah pana ang kuonto humpi bangin, a gam panin thakhatin Edom ka delmang ding hi; tuale keima in a gam sunga vaihawm dingin ka dei popo ka se ding hi. Bangzieh ahei cile kei tawh a kibang koi om ahei? Koi in kei ei hlan thei ding ahei? Ka mai-a ding ngam ding tuucing koi ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Topa in Edom tunga a tunsah ding a gelnasa, le Teman gama tengte tunga tunsah a sawmte za in: Ganhing a note kitawmang tahtah ding hi; gan khumna in zong a tuokhah thute ziehin a dipkuo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A puana uh a ging ngai seng ahi ziehin leitung kithingsah hi; San Tuipi dongah amau’ kaana kiza ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />En in, muvanlai bangin ama lengto-in Bozrah tungah a hla zahin bawhsuh ding a, tua ni ciengin Edom galhangte’ lungsim, numei nausuoh dingte’ lungsim tawh kibang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Damascus Tungtang Thu. Hamath le Arpad a lungmang uhi, azieh pen amate in thu hoi lo a za uhi; amate zau-in a lungkie vua, tuipi dai thei lo bangin a buoi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Damascus thazawmin a taimang dingin kihei hi, patauna in ama mancip a, lungkhamna, le dana in ama tukon hi; numei nausuoh ding bangin a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Bang a cile a minthang khuopi, kipahna khuopi khu a kinuasie ta adiei!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin khum ni ciengin a tangvalte le a galkap zosie a khuolai tuol-awngah a pua ding uhi, Vanglien, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Keima in Damascus kulpi ah mei ka tawkuong ding a, tuami in Benhadad’ mun muonhuoi a katum ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Babylon Kumpipa Nebuchadnezzar in a zawsa Kedar le Hazor kumpi gamte tawh kisai-in Topa in tam bangin gen hi: Ding unlen, Kedar sim dingin mainawt un! Nisuona lama om mite thatgam un!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A puonbuhte ule a ganhonte uh, a buh kotkhai puonte ule a van zosie uh ladawh un; amau’ adingin kalaohte kipeipi ding a, tam bang kikona aw khat kato ding hi: “Muncin tengah zauna behbeh!”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hazor khuo-a tengte aw, taimang unlen gamlapi ah vahmang un! A thuhna munte sungah kiphuol un, Topa in ci hi. Bangzieh ahei cile Babylon Kumpipa Nebuchadnezzar in nang langpan nading gelna le tupna nei zo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tho inlen, kulpi tunkot ahi a, a khana ahi zongin a nei vateh lo, muongtah le bihtaha a om hit hiet gam khat va sim ta’n, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />A kalaoh-te uh kimawh lahpieh ding a, a bawnghonte uh kitomgam pieh ding hi. A sam uh a heukieute muncin tengah ka thezah ding a, muncin teng panin amate tungah tuosietna ka tungsah ding hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Hazar khuo khu si-alte’ buolna suoh ding a, tua munah koima teng loin koima in a sungah khuom khaw lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Judah kumpipa Zedekiah kumpi a suo pat lamin Elam tungtang thu tawh kisai-in Jeremiah kungah Topa’ thu tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Vanglien Topa in tam bangci hi: Elam gam’ hatna bulpi ahi a thalpi ka kuoitawng ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />tuale keima in Edom tungah van ning li panin hui nam li ka langsah ding hi; tua huite lahah amate kithethangin Elam panin ka delmang mite tun lona gam khat beh a om sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Amate a thasawm, a galte uh mai-ah Elam mite ka zausisah ding hi; keima in amate tungah gimna le a giinhuoi ka lungthahna ka tungsah ding hi, Topa in ci hi. Amate ka thagam masangsie namsau in ka nuadelsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Elam gamah a kumpipa ule a vaihawm uliente thatin ka kumpi topha ka phut ding hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Ahi vangin ni nukhia ni ciengin Elam a gam ka piekia ding hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="50" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Babylon le Chaldea-te tawh kisai-in kamsangpa Jeremiah tung panin Topa’ thu gen tami ahi hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Minamte lahah genin phuongzah unlen, phuoldap sih unlen zawna dielkhai khai-in phuongzah un: Babylon kila ta hi. Bel pasien kimaizumsah a, Merodach pasien lungkie ta hi. Tua nu’ milimte kimaizumsah a, a pasien’ limte lungkie ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile leilu lam panin tua nu a sim dingin minam khat ang kuonto zo hi; ama in tua nu’ gam pen gamkhing suohsahin a sungah koima teng lo ding a, mihing le ganhingte taimang sieng ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khum nite le khum hun ciengin Israel mite, Judah mite tawh ang peiton ding uhi; a kaa kawmun amate hing pei-in Topa a Pasien uh a sui ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amate in Zion lam nga-in tua khuopi zotna lampi a dong ding vua, a kimangngil ngai nawn lo ding tawntung thuciemna tawh Topa kung zuonin ang kipawl ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka mite a mangthai tuu ahi ta vua, a tuucingte in muol tung tengah lamkhielin a gammanpi ta uhi; muol khat panin muol khatah a vah kawikawi vua, a giena mun uh a thei ta sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A mu tapo in amate a nawmval vua, a galte in, “Eite i khiel sih uhi, azieh pen amate in a thuman lonona ahi, Topa tung le a pu a pate kinepna ahi, Topa tungah a khiel zieh uh ahi bo hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Babylon panin taimangin Chaldea gam panin pei dawh ta unlen, keelhonte a makai keeltang bangin om un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile keima in leilu lam gam panin gam thupi honkhat hantawhin Babylon ka simsah ding hi; tua khuo a sim dingin amate ang kiguol ding uhi; tua panin khuopi kila ding hi. A thalpite uzong galhang thalkap siem pa’ thaltang kap tawh kibang ding a, a hawmpeikia sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chaldea gam kibulu ding hi; ama a bulu zosie in a khamtahin a ne ding uhi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka gouluo a bulute aw, note kipahin lungdam nan locin, lopa lahah a tai kawikawi bawnglaa le sakoltang bangin ham nan locin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />na nu uh Babylon nahpi-in maizum ding a, ang hing na nu uzong a mindai ding hi. En un, minamte lahah ama a nukhia pen hi ding a, gamlah, gam gawta le senel gam a suoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Topa’ lungthahna ziehin a sungah koima teng lo ding a, gamlah suoh ding hi; Babylon a nawh kha mi zosiete in lamdang a sa ding vua, a liemma zosiete ziehin a ehneh ho ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />No thal tawi zosiete aw, Babylon kimvelah panmun la unlen, thaltang khat zong hen loin ama kap un. Bang ding ahei cile Topa tungah ama a khiel zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A pang zosie panin ama’ langkhatah awng un, “Ama in gal a lel ta hi; a munkipte cimmang zo a, a kulbangte pua zo ta hi,” ci-in kiko un. Azieh pen tami khu Topa’ phulah ni ahi hi: Ama tungah phu la inlen, ama in a bawl bangin ama tungah bawl un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Anlah hunin Babylon panin khaitute le phieukawi tawite khawlsah un. A susie ding namsau ziehin amate a unpi-un a mipite lahah a kilekia ding vua, a unpi-un a gam ma vuah a taikia ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Israel ahile humpite in mat dinga a delmang tuu tawh kibang hi. Amasa-in Assyria kumpipa in ama netum a, tu-in a tawpkhahna ah Babylon Kumpipa Nebuchadnezzar in a gute a tepguoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Israel’ Pasien, Vanglien Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Keima in Assyria kumpipa dan ka tuosah bangin Babylon kumpipa le a gam dan ka tuohsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A gantatna lohing lahah Israel ka koikia ding a, tuale Carmel le Bashan ah gamta ding a, Ephraim le Gilead muolte tungah a dei teng kim ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Khum ni le khum hun ciengin Israel’ khielna kisui ding a, bangma khat zong kimu lo ding hi; Judah’ khielna kisui ding a, a kimu tuom sih ding hi; azieh pen keima in ka hinkhawi teng’ mawna ka maisah ding hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Merathaim gam a sim dingin peito unlen, Pekod a teng mite do un; a tawp dongin amate su maimangin kang sawl zosie bawl un, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Gam sungah gal husa le sietna lienpi om hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Leitung buppi’ sehpi-a kizang pa bangci dan a kisatkeh gawp ta adiei! Minamte lahah Babylon bangci dan a cizat huoi suoh ta adiei!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Babylon aw, nang kang thangsie a, a thei loin na awh ta hi; Topa na tawh ziehin ang kimu-in ang kiman hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Topa in a galhiem koina hongin a lungthahna galhiemte a la hi, bangzieh ahei cile Chaldea gam sungah Vanglien Topa Pasien in bawl ding khat a nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ama sim dingin muncin teng panin hing pei un; a ansalte honpieh un; anhum lom kholvum bangin ama koi-in sumaimang unlen, bangma nuasie sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A bawngtang zosie that unlen, a go dingte kungah peisuhsah un; amate adingin hun le nite ang tung zo hi, ama’ gimna thuoh ding hun ang tung zo ta hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ngai vawi un! Eite Topa’ phulahna, a biehinnpi ading phulahna thu Zion ah a phuongzah dingin Babylon gam panin galtaite le gambelte ang pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Babylon a sim dingin thal kamsa-a a tawi thalkap siemte thuta un. A khuopi kimvelah giephuol sat un; koima suohtasah sih un. Ama in a bawl bangin dinkia un; ama in ang bawlna tawh kituohin ama tungah zong bawl un, bangzieh ahei cile ama in kiliensah tahin Israel’ Siengtho Topa a simmaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin a khuolai tengah a tangvalte pua-in, khum ni ciengin a galkap zosie zong kisusie ding hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Mi kiliensah pa aw, nang kang langpan hi, Vanglien Topa Pasien in ci hi; azieh pen nang dan kang pieh ding hun le ni ang tung ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Mi kiliensah pa kipal kha-in pua ding a, a phongto ding koima a om sih ding hi, tuale a khuopite mei tawh ka hal ding a, a kimvela sil om zosie katum ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Vanglien Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Israel mite kibawlsie a, Judah mite zong tua ma bang ahi hi; sala a man mi zosie in amate tudetin a peisah nuom ta sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Amau’ Tanpa hat mama hi; ama’ min Vanglien Topa ahi hi. Ama in lei tungah toidamna a pieh thei nadingin amau’ vai pel loin ngaisutpi ding a, ahi vangin Babylon-a tengte adingin toi opna ahi sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Chaldea-te, Babylon-a tengte, a uliente le a mipilte lang khatah namsau a pang hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Amate mimaw a suo thei nadingin a aisante uh lang khatah namsau khat a pang hi! Amate a kisuhsiet nadingin namsau khat in a galhangte lang khatah a pang hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Numei tawh a kibah nadingun tua nu’ sakolte, tua nu’ sakol leengte le amate lahah gamdang galkap zosie’ langkhatah namsau khat a pang hi! Amate a kitomgam nadingin a gougil zosie lang khatah namsau khat a pang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ama’ tuite a kan sieng nadingin guotui pei nawn lo hi! Azieh pen milim biehna gam ahi a, amate in milimte a motlaw uhi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Babylon ah gamsate le si-alte tengton ding a, va-kalaohte a teng ding uhi; a khuopi ah mi tengkia ngai nawn loin a khang khangin tenna-in kinei nawn lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Pasien in Sodom, Gomorrah le a kimvela khuopite a suhsiet lai bangin khum munah koima teng lo ding a, a sungah koima in khuom khaw lo ding hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />En in, leilu lam panin minam khat ang pei hi; gam thahat khat le kumpi tampi leimong a gamla pen panin thatho tahin ang kuon uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Amate in thalpi le teipi a tawi vua, gilo mama-in hepina kici a nei sih uhi. Amau’ huging pen tuipi ging bang hi; amate sakol tungah a tuong uhi. Babylon tanu aw, gal do dinga a kithawi galhang pa bangin amate ang kuon uhi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Babylon kumpipa in amau’ thu za-in a khut a zaw hi. Lunggimna in ama gahcip a, numei takeih bangin na a sa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Lonona muna om tuute a delmang dingin Jordan hamphul lah pana ang kuonto humpi bangin, ama kung panin amate thakhatin ka delmang ding hi; keima in a gam sunga vaihawm dingin ka dei popo ka teel ding hi. Azieh pen kei bang mi koi om ahei? Koi in kei ei hlan thei ding ahei? Ka mai-a ding ngam ding tuucing khu koi ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Topa in Babylon tunga tunsah dinga a gelsate le Chaldea-te’ gam sunga tunsah a sawmte za in: Ganhing note kitawmang tahtah ding hi; a tuokhah uh thute ziehin amau’ gan khumna a dipkuo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Babylon a kimatna husa ging ziehin leitung kiling ding a, gamcin tengah ama’ kaana awging kiza ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="51" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Keima in Babylon langkhat le Leb-qamai -a tengte langkhatah a susie thei hui ka langsah ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />keima in a zap ding mite Babylon ah ka sawl ding a, amate in tua gam a zap sieng ding uhi. Gimna ni a tun ciengin ama a langpan dingin muncin teng panin amate a kuon uh ciengin, amate in gam sung teng a hawmin koi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Thaltawi pa in a thal kuoi sih hinlen, a sia songkhol zong sil sih heh. A tangvalte uh hinkhawi sih un; a galkap honte zosie that sieng un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chaldea gam sungah amate kithatin a pua ding vua, khuopi gawldung tengah a liemgawp ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Israel’ Siengtho Pa mai-ah khielna tawh a gam uh kidim nanle, Vanglien Topa a Pasien un Israel le Judah taisan lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Babylon panin tai unlen, na hinna uh taipi ciet un! Ama’ khielnate sipi sih un. Bang ding ahei cile tam pen Topa’ phulah hun ahi a, a mawna tawh kituohin ama in a thuh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Babylon pen leitung zosie a khamsah thei, Topa’ khut sunga khamhai ahi hi; minamte in ama’ zu a dawn vua, tuaci’n minamte mimaw a suoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thakhatin Babylon pua a, a guoicim sieng hi; ama adingin kapin mau un! Ama’ liemma nu ding zatui la un, ama dam thei lai kha ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Babylon a cidam ding i hanciem vangun ama kidamsah thei lo hi. Ama taisan ta unlen, i gam ciet zuonin pei va vui; azieh pen a tunga thukhenna in vantung dongah tung a, vantungte dong nangawnah kikhangto zo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa in eite ei dihsahna a talang zo ta hi; hing pei un, Topa eite’ Pasien nasepnate Zion ah va gen ta vai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thaltangte hiem un! Thalbawm thaltang tawh dim un! Topa in Babylon suhsiet sawm ahi ziehin Media kumpite a hantawh hi, azieh pen khumi khu Topa’ phulahna ahi a, a biehinn ading phulahna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Babylon kulte langkhatah diel khat khai unlen, galvilte hatsah un; a cing ding mi zong koi un; a buhdap dingin kithawi un; azieh pen Babylon-a tengte tawh kisai-in, Topa in a gensa teng gel zo-in sem zo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />No tui tamna gei-a teng gougil haute aw, na hun uh tawp zo ta a, na hinna khau uh tat zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Vanglien Topa ama le ama kiciem hi: Na tungah kauphe honpi bangin galkapte kang dimsah ding a, amate in na tungah guolzo-in awng ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A vanglietna tawh leitung bawl a, a pilna tawh leitung phutin, a theitelna tawh vantungte a kizahsah pa khu ama ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama in a aw a ginsah ciengin vante-a om tuite ging valuh a, ama in leimongte panin tuikhu a katosah hi. Ama in guo a zuh nadingin tun phesah a, a vankholna inn panin hui langsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mi zosie a mawlawm vua, bangma a thei sih uhi. Amau’ milimte ziehin khamkhengte a unpi-un a maizum uhi; azih pen a milim uh zuou ahi bo a, tuate sungah naahu om lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Khumte kimanna a nei lo, kisolna nasep ahi bo hi; dan a kipieh hun ciengin amate mangthai ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Jacob’ tanh Topa khu tamte bang ahi sih hi. Bangzieh ahei cile ama na vannuoi a bawlpa ahi hi. Israel ama’ gouluo minam ahi a, ama’ min Vanglien Topa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nang ka khetbuh le ka galvan na hi hi: nang tawh minamte ka sat guoi a, nang tawh kumpi gamte ka susie hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />nang tawh sakol le a tunga tuongpa ka sat guoi hi; nang tawh sakol leeng le a tunga tuongpa ka sat guoi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />nang tawh numei le pasal ka sat guoi hi; nang tawh khangham le khangnote ka sat guoi hi; nang tawh tangvalte le ngahnute ka sat guoi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />nang tawh tuucingpa le a tuuhonte ka sat guoi hi; nang tawh lo nei pa le a pawlte ka sat guoi hi; nang tawh gam uhte le a khut nei-a uliente ka sat guoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Babylon le Chaldea gama tengte zosie in Zion ah sietna a bawl zosiete uh ziehin nangma’ muna-ah amate ka thuh ding hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A susie muolpi aw, leitung buppi a susie pa aw, nang kang langpan hi, Topa in ci hi; nang langkhatah ka khut ka zah ding a, keen kawm panin kang liasuh ding a, a katum muol kang suohsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Innkiu suong ding le inn khuombul dingin nang tung panin bangma suong kila lo ding hi. hinanle nang gamkhing na suoh zing ding hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Khum gamah diel khai unlen, minamte lahah pengkul mut un; tua nu sim dingin minamte kithawisah unlen, ama sim dingin kumpi gamte, Ararat, Minni, le Ashkenaz gamte hlan un; ama sim dingin galkapmang khat se unlen, kauphe hon kitom bangin sakolte kai un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ama sim dingin minamte kithawisah un. Media kumpite, a uhpite le a khut nei-a uliente tawh amau’ uhna sunga gam zosie kithawisah un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Khum gam citunin kin gawp hi. Bangzieh ahei cile Topa in Babylon sim ding a gelna a tangtung hi. Ama in Babylon gamkhing suohsahin, koima’ ten lona suohsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Babylon galhangte gal kido khawlin, a mun muonhuoi sung vuah a om ta uhi; a thahatna uh tawp sieng a, numei tawh a kibang uhi; a innte uh mei tawh kihal a, khuopi tunkotgol sietawnte a tawngsan sieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Babylon kumpipa kungah muncin teng panin khuopi kila zo hi, ci thu a ko dingin patong khatlekhat, kamtai khatlekhat a kimu dingin a tai kawikawi uhi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tanmunte kila zo a, zang phaite kihaltumin, galkapte a patau uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Azieh pen Israel’ Pasien, Vanglien Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Babylon’ tanu a kisiacil ciengin ama ancilna mun tawh kibang hi; hinanle bano khat sungin ama anlah banga a kilah hun ang tung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />“Babylon Kumpipa Nebuchadnezzar in ei valtumin ei suguoi hi; beelhawm bangin ei koi a, gulpi bangin ei nawmval hi; ama ka sa tuilai teng tawh kivakham a, tuaci’n keima ei luokhie kia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Babylon tungah a kisemnen ka tahsa kithuh taheh,” Zion-a tengte in ci ding uhi. “Chaldea-a tengte tungah ka sisan kithuh taheh,” Jerusalem in ci ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Na vai kang seppieh ding a, phu kang lahpieh ding hi. A tuipi ka gawtasah ding a, a ciatui ka kangsah ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />tuale Babylon pen van kisie lompi, le si-alte kuo suohin, a lipkhap huoi, a ehheh huoi le koima’ ten lona mun a suoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Humpite bangin a hawh vapuoh ding uhi; amate in humpi note bangin mi a ngih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />A du mama laitahun a dawn ding uh zu ka pie ding a, a guolnop dong uh amate zu khamsahin, tuaci’n amate khanglo nawn loin a lum den ding uhi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Gaw dinga a kipeipi tuunote bang ahi a, tuutang le keelte bangin ahi zongin, amate ka peipisuh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Bangci danin Sheshach kila a, leitung buppi’ kisah theina kila dawh a ta diei! Bang a cile minamte lahah Babylon cizat huoi suoh a ta diei!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Babylon ah tuipi letto a, tuihuol zauhuoite in ama hlummang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />A khuopite cizat huoi suoh a, leigaw senel gam suoh sieng hi. Khum gam sungah koima teng loin, koima in nawhkha lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Babylon ah Bel ka gawt ding a, a valsate ka luokhesah ding hi. Ama kungah minamte a honhonin pei nawn lo ding hi; Jerusalem kulpi cim zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Ka mite aw, ama sung panin pusuoh un! A zauhuoi Topa’ lungthahna panin mi zosie kisuotah ciet un!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Gam sunga kam baleng kigente ziehin lungkie loin zong zau sih un. Kum khatin kam baleng khat kigenin a kumkia ciengin adang khat kigen hi. Gam sungah tatsietna le kumpi khat le kumpi khat kidona kam balengte a ging hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Babylon milimte dan ka pieh ni ding ang tung valon ding hi; a gambuppi kimaizumsah ding a, a mi kithatte khuo lai-ah a pua ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Tua ciengin vantung, leitung le a sunga om na zosie in Babylon ziehin kipahin la a sa ding uhi; bangzieh ahei cile amate do dingin leilu lam panin mi susie dingte ang pei ding uhi, Topa in a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Babylon ziehin leitung zosie-ah mi kithatte a pua bangin, Israel a thagam ziehin Babylon pua valon ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />No namsau pana a suohta teng aw, pei pai unlen lung uoikai nawn sih un! A gamlapi panin Topa phawh zing unlen, Jerusalem lunggul zing un:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Gensietna ka zah ziehun mitzum maizum teng ka tuoh vua, minsietna in ka mai uh a tuom ta hi. Bang ding ahei cile Topa’ biehinn mun siengthote sungah gamdang mite a lut ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin a milimte ka gawt ding hun ang tung valon ding a, a gam sung muncin tengah a milimte a tau ding uhi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Vantung dongah Babylon kato nanle, a sangpi-in a kulpi get zong nanle, keima kung panin mi susie dingte ama tungah tung veve ding hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Ngai un! Babylon pana kaana khu! Chaldea pana suhsietna gingpi khu!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Azieh pen Topa in Babylon a hawmguohin koi a, a husa a daisah ta hi. A tuihuolte tuipi kilawh ging bangin hawh vapuoh a, a husa in gamcin teng thawn hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />azieh pen Babylon tungah a susie dingte a kuon zo tah ziehun, a galhangte uh kiman zo a, a thaltangte uh tawng sieng zo hi; azieh pen Topa khu a thuhkia thei Pasien ahi a, ama in a kimin thuhkia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />A uliente uh, a mipilte uh zu ka tekham ding a, a gam uhte, a khut nei-a uliente le a galhangte zu tekhamin, amate pong lo kei-in lum den ding uhi, a min Vanglien Topa a kici, Kumpipa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Vanglien Topa in tam bangin ci hi: A sa mama Babylon kul khu lei ah cimsuh ding a, a khuo kul sangpite mei tawh kihaltum ding hi. Mite bangma lo a balia vua, mite in mei tawh hal ding bepin a gimpi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Judah Kumpipa Zedekiah a kumpi sep zaw a kum lina kum, kamsang Jeremiah in Babylon gama a na zawpi lai-a, Mahseiah’ tapa, Neriah’ tapa Seraiah thu a na pieh khu tam bang ahi hi. Seraiah pen galkap vansai pa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Jeremiah in Babylon tawh kisai-in Babylon-a tung ding gimna zosie laiziel khatah giel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Jeremiah in Seraiah kungah tam bangin ci hi: “Babylon na tun ciengin tam thu zosie na sim ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />‘ Topa aw, nang in mihing le ganhingte teng loin, kumtawna a kinuasie dingin tam mun suhsiet ding na galgih hi,’ ci-in gen in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Tam laiziel na sim zaw ciengin suong khat tawh khi inlen, Euphrates gun lai-ah paimangin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />tuale ‘Ama tunga ka tunsah gimnate ziehin Babylon tam bangin tumsuhin dawhto kia nawn lo ding hi,’ ci-in gen in,” a ci hi. Jeremiah’ thugenna tu-a cieng ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="52" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Zedekiah kumpi a suo-in kum sawmni le khat pha hi; ama Jerusalem ah kum sawm le kum khat sung maang hi. A nu’ min Hamutal ahi a, Libnah-a teng Jeremiah’ tanu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in Jehoiakim gamtat bangin Topa muna-ah sil hoi lo a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua bangin Jerusalem le Judah in Topa a lungthahsah ziehun ama kung panin amate a notmang hi. Zedekiah in Babylon kumpipa langpang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuale ama kumpi-a a maan zaw a kum kuo kum, a hla sawmna, a ni sawm ni-in Jerusalem sim dingin a galkap zosie tawh Babylon Kumpipa Nebuchadnezzar kuonin khuopi imtawm uhi; amate in tuami kimvelah galdalna a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuaci’n Kumpi Zedekiah in a uh zaw kum sawm le kum khat a cin dongin khuopi ki-imtawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua kum a hla lina, a ni kuo ni-in khuopi sungah kiel a natsiet seng ziehin gam mite ading an om nawn lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ciengin khuopi kulpi kitovang hi; tuale khuopi kimvelah Chaldea-te om zong le zan laitahin kumpipa’ um gei-a kulpi tegel kikala tunkot lam tawnin galkap zosie taimangin Arabah gam lam a manaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahi vangin Chaldea galkapte in kumpipa a nuadel vua, tuale Jericho zang lei-ah a pha uhi; tuale a galkap zosie kithezahin ama a taisan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ciengin amate in kumpipa manin Hamath gam Riblah khuo-a om Babylon kumpipa kungah peipi-in, tuale ama tungah thu a khen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Babylon kumpipa in Zedekiah muna-ah a tate that a, Riblah khuo ah Judah kumpi ulien zosie zong that hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama in Zedekiah’ mittangte kheipieh a, tuale ama siakhau tawh khi-in a si dongin thong sungah a khum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Babylon kumpipa Nebuchadnezzar in kumpi a sep zaw a kum sawm le kum kuo a cin kum, a hla ngana, a ni sawm ni-in Jerusalem ah Babylon kumpi cing galkapmangpa Nebuzaradan lut a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Topa’ biehinnpi a kipan kumpipa’ inn le Jerusalem-a inn zosie haltum sieng hi; inn gol kici zosie zong haltum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kumpi cing galkapmangpa tawh a omton Chaldea galkap zosie in Jerusalem kimvela kulpi zosie a satcim uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kumpi cing galkapmangpa Nebuzaradan in mipite lahah a zawngpen pawlkhat, khuopi sunga a kinuasie mite, Babylon kumpi langa a tai mite, le khutsiem mi a omlai teng, sal dingin a zawpi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hinanle kumpi cing galkapmangpa Nebuzaradan in lengga um bawl ding le lo hlo dingin gam sunga a zawng pente kimkhat nuasie lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chaldea-te in Topa’ biehinnpi sunga om sumngo khuomte, sumngo tuikuong le a tunnate satguoi-in sumngo zosie Babylon ah a puo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuale amate in beelte, vutluonate, taite-te, hengkuongte, siakeute, le biehinnpi kikhopna sunga vanzah zosie zong a la uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kumpi cing galkapmangpa in ngun le kham tawh a kibawl hengkuong neute, meikam luona kuongdaite, kuongte, beelte, meivah khuomte, siakeute, le tuibuohna kizang kuongte zong a puo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Solomon kumpipa in Topa’ biehinn dinga a bawlsa khuompi ni, tuikuongpi khat, tua nei-ah sumngo bawngtang lim sawm le ni le a tunnate , sumngo tawh a kibawl tua vanzah teng zosie pen ahile tawi te zawh vet ding ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Khuompi nite ahile, khuompi khat a sanna tong sawm le tong giet, a kimkot tong sawm le ni pha hi; tua pen a sunghawm ahi a, a san pen zung li zung li ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuami tungah sumngo khuomlu zepna om hi; khuomlu zepna khat pen tong nga sang hi; khuomlu zepna kimvel pen lenta banga kiphante le mang kawlsing limin kizem a, a unpi-in sumngo-a kibawl ahi hi. Tuale a khuompi nina zong tua bang ma-in mang kawlsing lim-a kizem ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A pang tengah mang kawlsing ga sawmkuo le guh om hi; a kimvelah a kizepna mang kawlsing zosie a unpi-in zakhat ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Kumpi cing galkapmangpa in siempupi pa Seraiah, siempu lien a nina Zephaniah, le kotpi cing thumte a kaimang hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />tuale ama in khuopi panin galkapte a uh galkapmang khat le khuo sunga a kimu kumpipa’ vaihawmpi mi sagi, gam mite a hanthawn galkap thuvanpi khat le khuopi sunga a tuokhah uh mi sawmguh, khuo sung panin a peipi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua ciengin kumpi cing galkapmangpa Nebuzaradan in amate manin Riblah khuo-a Babylon kumpipa kungah peipi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuale Babylon kumpipa in Hamath gam sunga Riblah khuo ah amate tehpuongin a thatgam sieng hi. Tuaci’n sal tang dingin a gam pulamah Judah a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tam pen Nebuchadnezzar in sal dinga a zawpi mi phaza ahi hi: A kum sagina kumin Judah mi tulthum le sawmni thum,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Nebuchadnezzar a kumpi suo zaw a kum sawm le giet kumin mi zagiet sawmthum ni sal dingin peipi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Nebuchadrezzar a kumpi suo zaw a kum sawmni le thum kumin kumpi cing galkapmangpa Nebuzaradan in a sal dingin zasagi sawmli nga peipi hi; a unpi-in mi tulli le zaguh pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Judah Kumpipa Jehoiachin a saltan zaw kum sawmthum le kum sagina, hla sawm le nina, ni sawmni le ni nga ni-in Evil-merodach Babylon kumpi-in maang a, kumpi-a a maan kipat kumin Judah Kumpipa Jehoiachin maipha pie-in thong sung pan a ladawh hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />ama hoitahin hopi a, Babylon gama a ompi kumpi dangte sangin a sang zaw tona a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tuaci’n Jehoiachin in a thong puonte suodawh a, nisimin a hin sung teng kumpipa’ sabuoi-ah an a ne zing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ama a hin sung tungtawn a si tanpha-in Babylon kumpipa in nisielin a neh ding an manmanin a pie hi.
  </para>
</usx>
